<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Suahlannak</book>
  <para style="h">Suahlannak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Suahlannak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Suahlannak</para>
  <para style="mt">Suahlannak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob le anmah ih innsang ciar thawn Izipt ramih a fehmi a fapa pawl ih hmin cu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Issakhar, Zebulun, Benjamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dan, Naftali, Gad le Asher tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob ih sungsuak tefa pawl cu an zatein sawmsarih an si. Josef cu Izipt ramah a rak um zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Caan a hung rei deuh hnuah Josef le a unau pawl cu an thi ih an khukṭhi pawl khal an thi thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl in faate tampi an nei ih Izipt ram khat ko in an zai ih a cah khal an cak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih caanah Josef ih thuhla thei dah lotu mi thar pakhat Izipt ramah siangpahrang a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih cun a milai pawl hnenah, “Zohhnik uh, hi Israel mi pawl hi an tamzet ih tlunah an cakzet fawn ih kan hrangah phan ding a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah i ngai uh, Israel mi pawl hi an tam sinsin lonak dingah fimkhur zetin an thu hi kan ruah a ṭul a si. Ral kan neih pang asile kan ral pawl hnenah an ṭang pei ih kan ram sungin an suak pang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah an thinpit koin hnaṭuan khung ṭuantertu dingah an tlunah salkhawngtu pawl an ret. Cuticun Israel mi pawl in rawl khawlnak dingah Pithom le Rameses khawpi pawl cu Faro hrangah an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Izipt mi pawl ih an hrem deuhdeuh tikah Israel mi pawl cu an pungzai deuhdeuh. Izipt mi in Israel mi pawl cu an huazet ih an ṭihzet fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah sal zonzai ah an tuah hai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tlakrawh ser le tlakrawh tuah hnaṭuan khung ṭuannak ah an nun cu a har sinsin. Hnaṭuan har tinkim cu zaangfahnak nei loin hranhram in an ṭuanter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Hebru nunau a bawmtu nau dongtu sayama pawl hnenah Izipt siangpahrang in thu a sim. Pakhat cu Shifrah a si ih a dang pakhat cu Puah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An hnenah, “Hebru nunau in fa an hrin ih nan tuamhlawm tikah naute cu mipa asile nan that pei; nunau a si ahcun nan that lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nau dongtu sayama pawl cun Pathian an ṭihzah ruangah siangpahrang ih thu cu an thlun lo. Mipa naute khal that loin an zuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang in nau dongtu sayama pawl cu a ko ih, “Zianghrangah hiti in nan tuah ih mipa naute tla nan zuah ṭheh?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Hebru nunau pawl cu Izipt nunau vek an si lo. An cakvak ih an fahrin a olzet; nau dongtu sayama kan va thlen hlanah naute cu a rak suak zo ṭheu,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian ih ṭhatnak cu nau dongtu sayama pawl ih tlunah a thleng. Israel mi pawl cu an ṭhangso ih an cak sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nau dongtu sayama pawl in Pathian an ṭihzah ruangah annih khal in faate an nei ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in a ramsung mi hnenah, “Hebru nunau-ih hrinmi fapa hmuahhmuah cu Nail tiva sungah nan hlon pei; a sinan fanu cu hlon loin nan zuah pei,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih caanah Levi mi pakhat in a phunpi nunau pakhat a ṭhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nupi cu fa a vun ih fapa a hring. Fapa mawizet a si tikha a nu in a hmuh tikah thla thum sung a thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain a thuh thei nawn lo tikah phaipheng ih tuahmi bawm pakhat a lak ih tidai lut thei lo dingin cingthling le khuaiseng a hnih. A sungah naute cu a hlum ih tivapi kap hrampi sang zetzet lakah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziang a cang pei ti theih duh ah a u nu cun hlat nawn in a thlir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Faro ih fanu tibual dingah tiva ah a ra ih a zawng-um nunau pawl cu tivakap ahcun lam an leng. Faro ih fanu in hrampi lakih bawm cu a hmuh tikah la dingah a zawng-um nu a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Faro ih fanu in bawm cu a on tikah naute cu ṭap rero ih a um kha a hmu. A zaangfahzet ih, “Hebru naute a si hi!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah cuih a u nu cun, “Hi naute a lo zohsaktu dingah Hebru nunau pakhat ka va ko pei maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Faro ih fanu in, “Va ko aw,” a ti. A va feh ih amah ih nu rori a va ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Faro ih fanu cun, “Hi naute hi i rak zohsak awla na zoh man cu ka lo pe ding,” tiah a ti. Curuangah cuih naute cu a nu in a lak ih ṭhatein a zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Naute cu a hung upat deuh tikah a nu cun Faro ih fanu hnenah a hei fehpi ih Faro ih fanu cun amah ih fapa-ah a tuah. “Tidai sungin ka suahmi a si,” a ti ih a hminah Moses a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tawkfang a hung rei hnu, Moses a upat deuh tikah a miphun pawl a va leng. Cutiih a va len tikah a miphun pawl cu Izipt mi pawl in hranhram ih hnaṭuan khung an ṭuanter kha a hmu. Cuih tlunah a phunpi Hebru mi pakhat Izipt mi pa ih a vuak kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiangkap a zoh ih zohman a hmuh lo tikah Izipt mipa cu a that ih a ruak cu vunnel sungah a thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thaisun ah a phunpi pawl hnenih a va feh sal tikah Hebru mi pahnih an sual-awk rero kha a hmu. Cutikah a mawh deuhtu pa ih hnenah, “Ziangah so na phunpi cu na thawi?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah anih cun, “Zoin so kan tlunih uktu le thuṭhentu dingah a lo tuah? Izipt pa na thah vekin a thah i tum maw si?” tiah a ti. Cutikah Moses cu a thin a phang ih, “Ka thil tuahmi hi midang in an thei zo a sihi!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cumi thu cu Faro ih a theih tikah Moses cu thah a tum. Asinain Moses cu a tlan ih Midian ramih um dingin a feh. Midian ram a thlen tikah tikhur pakhat kiangah a cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midian ramih puithiam Jethro in fanu pasarih a nei. A fanu pawl cu tikhur ah an ra ih, an pa ih tuu le me hrangah tidai an khai ih an ṭilva tidai innak kuang sungah an thlet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Culaifang ah tuukhal pawl an ra ih an ra dawi hai. Sikhalsehla Moses in nunau pawl cu a ṭan ih an ṭilva cu tidai a peksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule an pa hnenih an va kir tikah an pa cun, “Ziangtin so tuihsun bul tuanih nan tlun thei?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Izipt pa in tuukhal pawl hnenin in run ruangah a si,” tiah an ti. “Kan hrangah tidai hman in khai sak ih ṭilva pawl tla a tul a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah an pa cun, “Khuiah so a um? Ziangah so cupa cu nan taanta? Va ko uhla kan hnenah rawl ra ei seh,” tiah a fanu pawl cu a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuticun Moses cu Midian ramah cun a um ih Jethro in a fanu Zipporah cu Moses ih nupi dingah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zipporah in fapa a nei ih, “Tluang ramah ramdang mi ka si,” a ti ih a hminah Gershom a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum tampi hnuah Izipt siangpahrang cu a thi. Asinain Israel mi pawl cu sal an tuarnak ruangah an aihram ih an raak an kio lai thotho. Cuti an aihramnak aw cu Pathian hnenah a thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />an raak an kionak aw cu Pathian in a thei. Cun Abraham, Isaak le Jakob hnenih a thukammi khal a ciing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel mi pawl an sal tuarnak cu Pathian in a hmu ih an parah seherhnak a nei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses cu Midian ramih puithiam a pu Jethro ih tuu le me pawl a khal ṭheu. Voikhat ah a ṭilva pawl cu nelrawn ramṭhing ah a fehpi ih Pathian tlang Sinai timi ah a va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ih vancungmi hrambur sungih meisa-alh in a hnenah a lang. Moses in a zoh ih hrambur cu a alh rero naón a kang lo, ti kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah, “Mangbangza thil hi naih deuhin ka zohhnik pei. Ziangah so hrambur a kang lo?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses ih a naih vivo cu Bawipa in a hmuh tikah hrambur sung ihsin, “Moses, Moses!” tiah a ko. Moses in, “ Bawipa , hinah ka um,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in, “Rak naih nawn hlah. Na kedam phuak aw, ziangahtile na dinnak hmun cu hmun thianghlim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah cu na pu le na pa ih Pathian ka si. Abraham ih Pathian, Isaak ih Pathian le Jakob ih Pathian ka si,” tiah a ti. Cuvete in Moses cu a hmai a hup; ziangahtile Pathian cu a zoh ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in, “Ka milai pawl Izipt ih hrem an tuar cu fiangtein ka hmu zo. Salkhawngtu pawl kutsung ihsin luat dingih an aihramnak tla ka thei zo. An tuarnak hmuahhmuah khal ka thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Izipt mi pawl ih kut sungin a suahtu ding le cuih ram ihsin suak tahratih ramṭha le ramkau-ih thlenpitu dingah ka rung thleng zo a si. Cuih ram cu cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luannak ram, atu ahcun Kanaan mi, Hit mi, Amor mi, Periz mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi pawl an umnak ram a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ih ṭah-ainak aw cu ka hnen a thleng ih Izipt mi pawl in ziangtluk in an neh-nen hai, ti khal ka hmu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah ka milai Israel mi pawl Izipt ram sung ihsin suah dingah nangmah cu Faro hnenah ka lo thlah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Pathian hnenah, “Keimah cu zoso ka si ih Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi suakter dingah Faro hnenih ka va feh ding cu?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian in, “Na hnenah Keimah ka um ding ih a lo thlahtu Keimah ka sinak a langtertu cu himi hi a si ding: Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl na suahpi tikah, hi tlang parah hin in bia ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Moses in Pathian hnenah, “Israel mi hnenah ka feh ih ‘Nan pu le nan pa ih Pathian in nan hnenah i thlah a si,’ ka ti tikah, ‘A hmin zoso a si?’ in ti asile ziangtinso ka sim ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in, “Keimah cu Keimah ka si. Keimah a si mi in nan hnenah i thlah a si, tiin Israel mi hnenah na sim pei,” tiah Moses hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Pathian in Moses hnenah hiti in a ti sal. “ Bawipa , nan pu le nan pa ih Pathian, Abraham ih Pathian, Isaak ih Pathian le Jakob ih Pathian in nan hnenah i thlah a si tiin Israel mi pawl hnenah na sim pei. Hihi a kumkhua-in ka hmin a si ih hmailam san minung hmuahhmuah khal in hiti in in ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Va feh awla Israel hruaitu pawl ko khawm awla an hnenah, Bawipa , nan pu le nan pa ih Pathian, Abraham, Isaak le Jakob ih Pathian cu ka hnenah a lang ih hiti in nanmah sim dingah i fial a si! ‘Nan hnenah ka ra zo ih Izipt mi pawl in nan tlunih an tuahmi cu ka hmu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah hrem nan tuarnak Izipt ram ihsin lo suah ding le Kanaan mi, Hit mi, Amor mi, Periz mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi pawl ih umnak ram lo thlenpi dingah ka ruatcat zo a si. Cuih ram cu cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luannak ram a si,’ tiah na ti pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na simmi thu cu an lo ngai ding. Cun Israel mi hruaitu pawl thawn Izipt siangpahrang hnenah nan feh pei ih a hnenah, ‘Hebru mi pawl ih Pathian, Bawipa in in tong zo. Curuangah ni thum sung nelrawn ramṭhingah kan feh ih Bawipa kan Pathian hnenih thawinak kan pek theinak dingah in thlah hram aw,’ tiah nan dil pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kut cakih a hneek dah ti lo ahcun Izipt siangpahrang cun a lo thlah lo ding, ti cu ka thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka cahnak ka hmang pei ih ka tuah dingmi mangbangza pawl in Izipt mi pawl cu ka hrem ding. Cuih hnuah a lo thlah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Cuih tlunah ka milai pawl cu Izipt mi pawl ih upat tlak in ka tuah pei ih Izipt ram ihsin nan suah tikah nan kut lawngin nan suak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel nunau hmuahhmuah in an innsungih a ummi Izipt nunau hnenin siseh, an innhnenih Izipt mi hnenin siseh, hnipuan le hlawnthil, sui le ngun an dil pei ih, nan fanu le nan fapa pawl in an hruk pei. Cutiin Izipt mi pawl cu an thilri hmuahhmuah nan laksak thluh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in, “Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl in in zum lo ih ka simmi ngai loin, ‘ Bawipa cu na hnenah a lang lo a si,’ in ti asile, ziangtinso ka ti ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in, “Na kutah ziangso na ken?” tiah Moses cu a sut. “Kianghrol ka keng,” tiah Moses in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Lei parah vun hlon aw,” tiah a ti ih, Moses in a vun hlon tikah rul ah a cang. Cutikah Moses cu dungah a siip.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in, “Vun dawh awla a mei in kai aw,” tiah Moses cu a ti. Cule Moses in a vun dawh ih a kaih tikah a kut parah cun kianghrol ah a cang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Himi cu Israel mi pawl hnenah an pu le an pa ih Bawipa Pathian, Abraham ih Pathian, Isaak ih Pathian le Jakob ih Pathian cu na hnenah a lang a si, ti an zum theinak dingah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Moses hnenah Pathian in thu a sim sal ih, “Na kut cu na angki sungah ret aw,” tiah a ti. A ti bangtuk in Moses in a ret. A kut a suah sal tikah a phar ṭheh ih vur bangin a rangmi hma in a kut cu a khat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Na kut cu na angki sungah ret sal aw,” a ti. A ti bangin Moses in a ret. A kut cu a suahsal tikah a dam ṭheh ih a taksa dang bangtuk ah a cang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “A hmaisaih tican neimi hminsinnak an pom thei lo ih an lo zum lo a si khalle a pahnihnak ih tican neimi hminsinnakih ruang talah an lo zum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi hminsinnak pahnih ih hnuah an zum lo thotho ih na simmi khal an ngai lo a si ahcun Nail tiva ihsin tidai la awla leiro parah thle aw. Leiro parih na thletmi tidai cu thisen ah a cang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses in Bawipa hnenah, “Bawipa, kei cu i thlah hramhram hlah aw. Thusim thiam khal ka si dah lo. Nangmah ih i ton hnu khalah thusim thiam ka si hlei cuang lo. Santlai lo ka si ih ka ṭong a fung ih ka aw a hak fawn si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Minung cu zo in so hmurka a pek? Zoin so hnaset le ṭong thei lo khi a tuah? Zoin so khawhmuh theinak a pek? Asilole zo in so a mit a cawtter? Bawipa Keimah ka si lo maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cu a si ruangah feh aw; na ṭongnak ah ka lo bawm ding ih na ṭong dingmi khal ka lo sim ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain Moses in, “Bawipa, i zaangfah hram awla midang pakhatkhat thlah sawn aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa cu Moses parah a thin a heng ih, “Levi mi na unau Aaron a um a si lo maw? Amah cu ṭong a thiamzet ti ka thei ko. Thungai tile amah cu atu-ah nangmah tong dingin a ra lai ih a lo ton ding cu a hlawptlozet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah thawn nan biak-awk hnuah a ṭong dingmi cu nangmah in na sim pei. Nan pahnih in nan ṭong dingmi cu ka lo bawm ding ih nan pahnih ih nan tuah dingmi tla ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi hnenah nangmah ai-awh in Aaron a ṭong ding ih amah cu na hmurka a si ding. Nangmah cu amah ih hrangah Pathian bangtuk na si ding ih a ṭong dingmi simtu na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi kianghrol hi na kut in keng awla mangbangza tuahnak ah va hmang aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Moses cu a pu Jethro hnenah a feh ih, “Izipt ramih ka sungkhat pawl an nunglai maw ti zoh dingah Izipt ramih kir dingin i thlah hram aw,” tiah a ti. Cule a pu Jethro cu a lung a kim ih, “Damte in feh aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses cu Midian ramih a um laiah, “Atu cu Izipt ramah kir thlang aw, ziangahtile thah a lo duhtu pawl cu an thi ṭheh zo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in a nupi le a fapa pawl a hruai ih laak parah a toter hai ih Izipt ramah a kirpi. Pathian ih pekmi kianghrol cu a keng ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Pathian in Moses hnenah, “Atu cu Izipt ramih kir thlang ding na si ruangah tuah ding ka lo timi mangbangza hmuahhmuah cu Faro hmaiah na tuah thluh pei. Asinain Faro ih thinlung cu ka hakter ding ih ka minung pawl cu a fehter lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Faro ih hnenah, ‘Israel cu ka fatir a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keimah i biak theinak dingah ka fapa cu thlah aw ka lo ti naón na thlah duh lo. Curuangah na fatir ka that ding a si, tiin Bawipa in a ti,’ tiah na sim pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lamzin ih an riahnak hmunah Bawipa in Moses cu a tong ih thah a tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Zipporah in lunghriam pakhat a lak ih a fapa ih serh a tan. Cuih lunghriam cun Moses ih ke a daiter ih Zipporah in, “Nang cu serhtannak thisen suahtertu ka pasal na si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in Moses nunnak cu a zuah. Serhtannak thisen ruangah a nupi Zipporah in, “Nang cu serhtannak thisen suahtertu ka pasal na si,” a tinak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun Aaron ih hnenah Bawipa in, “Moses tong dingah nelrawn ah va feh aw,” tiah a ti. A ti bangin Bawipa ih tlang ah Moses tong dingin a feh. Cule Moses a ton tikah a hnam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses cun Bawipa in a thlah zawng ih a hnenih a simmi hmuahhmuah le Bawipa in mangbangza a tuahnak le thu a peknak pawl tla cu kimtein Aaron a sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Moses le Aaron cu Izipt ram ah an feh ih Israel mi hruaitu pawl an ko khawm ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih a simmi thu hmuahhmuah cu an hnenah Aaron in a sim thluh. Cule misenpi hmaiah Moses in mangbangza a phunphun a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutiin misenpi in an zum. Cule Bawipa cu an hrangah seherhnak a nei ih hrem an tuarnak pawl tla a hmu thluh a si, ti kha an theih tikah a hmaiah kuun in an biak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Moses le Aaron cu Faro hnenah an feh ih a hnenah, “Israel ih Pathian in, ‘Ka minung pawl cu nelrawn ramṭhing ah an feh ih keimah ih hrangah biaknak puai an tuah theinak dingah Izipt ram in suah hai seh,’ a lo ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in, “ Bawipa cu zoso a si? Ziangah so Bawipa ih thu cu ka ngai ding ih Israel cu ka fehter ding? Bawipa cu kei ih ka theihmi a si lo. Curuangah Israel cu ka suahter lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Hebru pawl ih Pathian cu kan hnenah a lang a si. Bawipa kan Pathian hnenih thawinak kan va pek theinak dingah nelrawn ramṭhing ah ni thum sung va feh dingin in thlah hram aw. Cutiih kan tuah lo asile, doral in maw, natnak in maw, in that ding a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Izipt siangpahrang in Moses le Aaron hnenah, “Nan milai pawl hna ṭhateih ṭuan thiam lo dingin nan tawlrel cu ziang nan duhnak so a si? Hi sal pawl hi an hnaṭuannak ah fehter uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan milai pawl hi kan ramsung minung ngaingai hnakin an tam sawn thlang. Cuih tlunah maw, an hna ṭuanlonak ding nan tumtah hrih!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih ni ah Faro in Izipt mi salkhawngtu le Israel mi hnaṭuantu pawl hotu hnenah thu a pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A hlan bangtuk in tlakrawh tuahnak ah hramro nan pe nawn lo pei; anmah tein hramro cu hawl hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain tlakrawh cu a hlanih an tuahzat thotho in tuah dingah nan fial pei; ṭhum hrimhrim hlah uh. An zaangzel ruangah an phunzai ih, ‘Pathian hnenah thawinak pe dingin kan feh pei,’ tiah an tinak hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam sinsin le har sinsin in hna nan ṭuanter pei. Thuphan lawnglawng a ṭongtu pawl ih thu ngai loin an hnaṭuannak ah taima sawn hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah salkhawngtu le hnaṭuan hotu pawl cu an minung pawl hnenah an feh ih, “Faro in, ‘Hramro ka lo pe nawn lo ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nan hmuh naknak ah nan hawl pei ih nan la pei; asinain tlakrawh cu nan tuah ṭheumi zat thotho nan tuah pei,’ a ti,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cu hramro hawl ah Izipt ram a suk le a so-ah an vak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Salkhawngtu pawl cun an nawtzok rero ih, “Hramro pek nan si laiih ni khatih nan tuah ṭheu zat thotho ni khatah nan tuah a ṭul a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Faro ih minung, salkhawngtu pawl in Israel hnaṭuan hotu pawl an hnaṭuanmi hmuahhmuahah ṭuanvo pekmi pawl cu, “Zianghrangah so a hlanih ni khat sungih nan tuah ṭheumi tlakrawh cu atu-ah nan tuah thei lo?” tiah an kawk ih an vuak ciamco hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Israel mi hnaṭuan hotu pawl cu Faro hnenah an feh ih, “Bawipa, zianghrangah so na siahhlawh pawl hiti ih in tuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Atu-ah hramro in pe nawn lo; asinain bawipa, ‘Tlakrawh tuah uh’ in ti thotho fawn. Cuih tlunah bawipa, vuak tiangin kan tuar fawn. Na minung pawl ih mawh hrimhrim a si,” tiah an va phunzai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in, “Nanmah pawl hi mizee nan si; mi zaangzel phun hrimhrim nan si ruangah, ‘Kan feh pei ih Bawipa hnenah thawinak kan pe ding,’ tiah nan ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah atu rori nan hnaṭuan thok uh! Hramro malte hman pek nan si lo ding; asinain tlakrawh cu nan tuah dingzat thotho nan tuah hrimhrim pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mi hnaṭuan hotu pawl cun, “Nan tuah ṭheumi zat thotho nitinte in tlakrawh nan tuah pei,” tiah Faro in a ti thu an theih tikah kan harsa riai a sihi, ti an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Faro hnen ihsin an suak ih anmah a rak hngaktu Moses le Aaron an ton tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an hnenah, “Nan thil tuahmi hi Bawipa in hmu hramsehla, Faro le a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih in huatnak ding nan phiar ruangah Bawipa in lo cawh hram seh. Kanmah pawl thahnak dingah hin an kut sungah namsau nan ret zo a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Moses cu Bawipa ih hnenah a feh sal ih, “ Bawipa , ziangah so hi Israel mi pawl parah harsatnak na thlenter? Ziangah so an hnenah keimah hi i thlah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah ai-awh in Faro hnenih ka thlen vete in na minung pawl hi a tuahsiat ringring zo a si. Nang in le anmah runsuak ding zianghman na tuah fawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in Moses hnenah, “Atu thok ihsin Faro hnenih ka thil tuah dingmi cu na hmu ding. Israel mi pawl thlah dingah ka kut cak in ka hneek ding. Thungai in tile ka kut cak ih ka hneek hnuah cun amah hrimhrim in a ram sung ihsin a dawi hai ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in Moses hnenah, “Keimah cu Bawipa ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian tiin Abraham, Isaak le Jakob hnenah ka lang. Asinain an hnenah Bawipa timi ka hmin in ka lang-awter lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule ramdang mi bangtuk ih an rak um dahnak Kanaan ram cu ka lo pe ding, tiah anmah thawn thukamnak ka tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu-ah Izipt mi pawl in salih an kaihmi Israel mi pawl aihramnak cu ka thei ih ka thukam cu ka ciing ṭha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah nangmah in Israel mi hnenah ka thu cu na sim pei, ‘Keimah cu Bawipa ka si. Izipt mi pawl in hramhram ih an lo ṭuantermi hnaṭuan khunghar sung ihsin ka lo luatter ding. An sal nan sinak sungin ka lo run ding. Ṭihnungza hremnak thawn an thu ka ṭhen ding ih ka baan thacak thawn ka lo humhim hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka minung ah ka lo tuah ding ih Keimah cu nan Pathian ka si ding. Izipt mi pawl in nan parih an suanmi hnaṭuan khunghar sung ihsin a lo suahtu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si kha in thei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham, Isaak le Jakob hnenih ka hmin saal in ka kam ciami ramah ka lo thlenpi hai ding. Cuih ram cu nanmah ih ta si dingin ka lo pe ding. Keimah cu Bawipa ka si,’ a ti tiah va sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ih a sim bangtuk in Moses in Israel mi hnenah a sim. Asinain Moses ih thusimmi cu an ngai lo; ziangahtile an saltuarnak cu a na tuk ih an thin a pit ih an bei a dong ṭheh ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Izipt siangpahrang Faro hnenah feh awla, Israel mi pawl cu na ramsung ihsin na suakter hrimhrim pei, tiah va ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa ih hnenah Moses in, “Israel mi hman in ka thu in ngai lo a si ahcun ziangtinso Faro cun i ngai ding? ṭong lam ahcun ka hlawhsam tuk lawmmam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Moses le Aaron cu Izipt ramsung ihsin Israel mi pawl hruaisuak tengteng dingih a thlahmi an si ti cu Israel mi pawl le Izipt siangpahrang sim dingin a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An sungkhat ih cithlahtu pawl cu hihi an si. Israel ih fatir Reuben ih fapa-ah Hanok, Pallu, Hezron, le Karmi an si. Hihi Reuben ih sungkhat tesinfa cithlahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simeon ih fapa-ah Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakhin, Zohar le Kanaan nu-ih fapa Shaul tla an si. Hihi Simeon ih sungkhat tesinfa cithlahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi ih fapa pawl ih hmin cu, an tefa pawl thawn, Gershon, Kohath le Merari an si. Hihi Levi ih sungkhat cithlahtu an si. Levi cu kum za le sawmthum le kum sarih a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gershon ih fapa pawl cu Libni le Shimei an si ih tefa tampi an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath ih fapa pawl cu Amram, Izhar, Hebron le Uzziel an si. Kohath cu kum za le sawmthum le kum thum a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari ih fapa pawl cu Mahli le Mushi an si. Hi pawl cu Levi ih sungkhat, an tesinfa pawl ih thuanthu thawn an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Amram in a pa ih farnu Jokhebed a ṭhit ih Aaron le Moses a hrin. Amram cu kum za le sawmthum le kum sarih a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izhar ih fapa pawl cu Korah, Nefeg, le Zikhri an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzziel ih fapa pawl cu Mishael, Elzafan le Sithri an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aaron in Amminadab ih fanu, Nahshon ih farnu Elisheba a ṭhi ih Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Korah ih fapa pawl cu Assir, Elkanah, le Abiasaf an si. Hihi Korah mi pawl ih sungkhat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron ih fapa Eleazar in Putiel ih fanu lakah pakhat a ṭhit ih Finehas a hrin. Hihi an sungte ciar in Levi miphun ih cithlahtu pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi Aaron le Moses hi Bawipa in, “Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl cu suakter uh,” tiih a fialmi cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Izipt siangpahrang hnenah Israel pawl Izipt ram ihsin thlah dingin a va simtu cu anmah thotho an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Izipt ramih Moses hnenah Bawipa in thu a sim tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Keimah cu Bawipa ka si. Ka lo simmi hmuahhmuah cu Izipt siangpahrang hnenah va sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain Moses in Bawipa hnenah, “ṭong lamah cun ka hlawhsam tuk lawmmam. Ziangtin so Izipt siangpahrang in ka thu cu a ngai duh ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Zohhnik, Faro hnenah nangmah cu Pathian bangtuk ah ka lo tuah pei ih, na u Aaron cu a hnenah na profet bangtuk in thu a sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu ka lo pekmi hmuahhmuah Aaron na sim pei ih, amah in Faro hnenah a ramsung ihsin Israel mi suakter dingin a sim pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Faro ih thinlung cu ka hakter pei ih Izipt ram sungah mangbangza a phunphun ka tuah khalle,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Faro in nan thu a ngai lo ding a si. Cutikah an ram cu napi in ka hrem pei ih Izipt mi pawl cu nasa zetin cawhkuan ka pe pei; cutiin ka minung Israel mi pawl cu a bur a bur in Izipt ram ihsin ka hruaisuak hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ram ihsin Israel mi ka hruaisuak ih an tlunih ka baan thacak ka hawi tik lawngah Izipt mi pawl in Bawipa ngaingai ka si ti in thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih a fial bangtuk in Moses le Aaron in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Faro hnenih thu an va sim tikah Moses cu kum sawmriat a si ih Aaron cu kum sawmriat le kum thum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Faro in, ‘Ziangngai nan si le si lo, mangbangza cu tuah hnik hmen uh,’ a lo ti asile, nang Moses in Aaron hnenah, ‘Na kianghrol la awla Faro hmaiah hlon aw; cule rulah cangter aw,’ na ti pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses le Aaron cu Faro hnenah an feh ih Bawipa ih thupek vekin an tuah. Faro le a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih hmaiah Aaron in a kianghrol cu a hlon ih rulah a cang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Faro in a mifim pawl le a dawithiam pawl a ko ih an dawithiamnak in Aaron ih tuah vekin an tuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kianghrol cu an hlon ih rulah an canter ve. Asinain an rulpi pawl cu Aaron ih rul in a dolh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa ih a sim cia bangtuk in Faro ih thinlung cu a hak ngaingai ih Moses le Aaron ih thu cu a ngai duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Faro ih thinlung cu a hak ngaingai. Ka minung pawl cu a thlah duh lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro cu zinglamih Nail tiva-ih a feh tikah va tong aw. Tivapi kap in rak hngak awla, rulih a cang dahmi kianghrol kha keng aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Faro hnenah, ‘Hebru mi pawl ih Pathian Bawipa in na hnenah i thlah ih, ka minung pawl in ramṭhing ah in biak theinak dingah ka minung pawl cu thlah seh, a lo ti. Asinain atu tiang cu a thu na ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa ih thu cu hiti in a si: Bawipa ka sinak cu ka tuah dingmi thil in na thei ding. Zohhnik, hi kianghrol hin tivapi ih tidai cu ka vuak pei ih tidai cu thisen ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nga hmuahhmuah an thi thluh ding ih tiva cu a nam tuk lawmmam ding ruangah Izipt mi pawl in tivapi ih tidai cu an in thei lo ding,’ tiah na va ti pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Aaron kha, ‘Na kianghrol la awla Izipt ram sungih a ummi tiva siseh, tihriat siseh, tili siseh, tidai hmuahhmuahih tlunah na kianghrol cu thlir aw. Tidai cu thisen ah a cang ding ih Izipt ramsung khuazakip ah, tikuang sungih tidai le lungbeel sungih an khawlmi tidai tiangin thisen ah an cang thluh ding,’ tiah sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa ih a fial bangtuk in Moses le Aaron in an tuah. Faro le a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih hmai rori-ah Aaron in a kianghrol cu a thlir ih tivapi cu a thawi. Cuvete in tidai cu thisen ah a cang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tiva sungih nga hmuahhmuah an thi ṭheh; curuangah a nam ngaingai ih Izipt mi pawl in tiva ih tidai cu an in thei lo. Izipt ram cu thisen lawnglawngin a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Izipt ramih dawithiam pawl in an dawi in cubangtuk cu an tuah ve. Faro ih thinlung cu a hah keelin a hak thotho. Bawipa ih a rak sim cia vekin Moses le Aaron ih thu cu a ngai hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi bangtuk mangbangza hman cu poisa loin Faro cu a siangpahrang innpi ah a kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Izipt mi pawl cun tiva ih tidai an in thei nawn lo ruangah tiva kapah tikhur an lai ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa in tiva a vuak hnuah ni sarih a rei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Faro hnenah feh awla, Bawipa ih thu cu hiti in a si, ‘Ka minung pawl in in biak theinak dingah na thlah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaihnik, na thlah duh lo a si ahcun na ram cu butlak in ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tiva cu butlak in a khat ṭheh ding. Tiva in an suak ding ih na siangpahrang inn le na ihnak khaan, na ihkhun par le na kuthnuai bawi pawl le na minung pawl ih inn tiangin an lut ding. Na tappi le na beel sung tiangin an thleng thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na minung, na kuthnuai bawi pawl le nangmah ih par tiangah an ra dawp ding,’ a ti va ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Aaron hnenah, ‘Tivapi tlunah siseh, tihriat tlunah siseh, tili tlunah siseh, na kianghrol thlir awla, Izipt ram sungah butlak suakter aw,’ tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ti bangtuk in Aaron in a kianghrol cu tidai tlunah a thlir ih butlak an suak ngaingai ih Izipt ram cu an khat sohso ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla dawithiam pawl khal in an dawi in butlak cu an ram ah an suakter ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Moses le Aaron cu a ko ih, “Keimah le ka minung pawl ih hnen in butlak pawl a laakhlo theinak dingah Bawipa hnenah thla cam hram uh. Bawipa hnenih thawinak pe thei dingin nan minung pawl cu ka thlah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Moses in Faro hnenah, “Butlak pawl cu nan inn hmuahhmuah sung ihsin an tlan thluh ih Nail tiva sung lawnglawngih an umnak dingah ziangtikah so nangmah, na kuthnuai bawi pawl le na minung pawl hrangih thla ka cam ding; a tikcu i sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Faro in, “Thaisun ah cam aw,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Moses in, “ Bawipa kan Pathian bangtuk Pathian dang a um lo a si, ti na theihnak dingah na tivek ngaingai in a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Butlak in nangmah siseh, nan inn pawl siseh, na kuthnuai bawi pawl le na minung pawl siseh, an lo taan dingih Nail tiva sung lawnglawngah an um ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Moses le Aaron cu Faro hnen ihsin an suak ih Faro hnenih a thlentermi butlak thu-ah Moses in Bawipa hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses ih a dil vekin Bawipa in a kimter ih innsungih a ummi butlak le hmuansung le lo sungih a ummi butlak an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl in butlak cu a bur tumpipi ah an peng ih an ram cu butlak rimsia nam in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro in butlak pawl an thi ṭheh thlang ti a hmuh tikah a thinlung cu a hak sal lala. Bawipa ih simcia vekin Moses le Aaron ih thu cu a ngai duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses hnenah Bawipa in, “Aaron hnenah, ‘Na kianghrol in leilung vua awla, Izipt ramsung hmuahhmuahih leivut cu fikfa-ah an cang ding,’ tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cubangtuk in an tuah. Aaron in a kianghrol cu a lak ih leilung a vuak. Cutikah leivut cu fikfa-ah a cang ih milai le ramsa parah an fu hluarhlo ciamco. Izipt ramsungih leivut hmuahhmuah cu fikfa-ah an cang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Izipt ramih dawithiam pawl in fikfa cu a tuah an tum ve naón an tuah thei lo. Khawzakip ah fikfa cu milai le ramsa parah an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An dawithiam pawl cun Faro hnenah, “Himi cu Pathian ih thiltinak a si,” tiah an ti. Sikhalsehla Faro ih thinlung cu a hak thotho ih, Bawipa ih rak simcia vekin Moses le Aaron ih thu cu a ngai duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Tiva-ih Faro a feh tikah Faro tong dingin zingpitah va feh awla a hnenah, Bawipa in, ‘Keimah in biak theinak dingah ka minung pawl thlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na thlah lo asile nangmah le na kuthnuai bawi pawl le na minung pawl parah le na inn sungah thothe ka khatter ding, tiah atu ihsin ka lo tiamcia. Izipt mi pawl ih inn siseh, an dinnak hmun leilung tiangin thothe a khat ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain cuih ni ahcun ka minung pawl ih umnak Goshen ram cu ka zuah ding; Keimah cu Bawipa ka si ih hiti in thil a titu cu Keimah ka si kha na theihnak dingah Goshen ramah cun thothe pakhat hman a leeng lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuticun ka minung le na minung karlakah thleidannak ka tuah ding. Cuih mangbangza cu thaisun hrimhrim ah a thleng ding,’ a ti tiah va sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in mangbangza cu a tuah ngaingai ih thothe cu siarcawk loin Faro siangpahrang inn le a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih inn ah le Izipt ramsung hmuahhmuah ah an khat nohno. An ram cu thothe in a siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Moses le Aaron cu Faro in a ko ih, “Feh uhla kan ram sungah hin nan Pathian hnenah thawinak cu pe ko uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “Cuticun a cang thiam lo ding; zianghrangah tile Bawipa kan Pathian hnenih thawinak kan pekmi rannung cu Izipt mi pawl thinhengtertu a si ding. Izipt mi pawl mithmuh ah thawinak kan tuah ih kan rannung thahmi cu Izipt mi thinhengtertu ih a can ahcun lungto in in deng that ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah kan Pathian ih thu in pek bangtuk in Bawipa hnenih thawinak pek dingah nelrawn ramṭhing ah ni thum sung kan feh a ṭul hrimhrim a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Faro in, “Hla tuk tiang nan feh lo ding a si ahcun Bawipa nan Pathian hnenih thawinak pe dingah ramṭhing ah ka lo thlah ding. Keimah hrangah thla cam aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “Ka feh vete in Bawipa hnenah thla ka cam pei ih thaisun ah thothe pawl cu na hnen le na kuthnuai bawi pawl ih hnen le na minung pawl hnen ihsin an hlo ṭheh ding. Asinain ka minung pawl in Bawipa hnenih thawinak an pek theinak ding thu-ah in bum sal nawn hrimhrim hlah aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Faro hnen ihsin Moses cu a feh ih Bawipa hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Moses ih a dil vekin Bawipa in a run kimter. Faro le a kuthnuai bawi pawl le a minung pawl hnen ihsin thothe cu pakhat hman taang loin an kiang reprep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asinain Faro ih thinlung cu a hak sal thotho ih Israel mi pawl cu a suahter duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Faro hnenah feh awla a hnenah, ‘Hebru mi ih Pathian Bawipa in, hiti in a ti: Keimah in biak theinak dingah ka minung pawl cu thlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na thlah duh lo ih na hren thotho hai a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />napi in ka lo hrem ding ih na ṭilva - na rang pawl, na laak pawl, na kalauk pawl, na cawrual, na tuurual le na me pawl - tlunah natnak ṭha lo a tlung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ih ṭilva le Izipt mi pawl ih ṭilva cu ka thleidang pei ih Israel mi pawl ih ṭilva cu pakhat hman an thi lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in tikcu a tin zo ih thaisun rori-ah a thlengter ding a si,’ tiin va ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa ih a sim vekin a thaisun ah natnak ṭha lo cu a thleng ngaingai ih Izipt mi pawl ih ṭilva hmuahhmuah cu an puul ṭheh. Asinain Israel mi pawl ih ṭilva cu pakhat hman an thi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Faro in cuih thuhla cu a zingzoi ih Israel mi pawl ih ṭilva cu pakhat hman an thi lo ti cu a thei. Sikhalsehla Faro ih thinlung cu a hak thotho ih Israel mi pawl ih feh ding cu a duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah, “Tappi-ih vutcam ṭhuam hnihthum in lak uhla Faro ih hmaiah acuih vutcam cu Moses in van ah theh seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt ramsung hmuahhmuah ah leidip bangtuk in a ṭhen-aw thluh ding ih khuazakip ah khuaihli hma a suakter ding ih minung le ramsa pawl cu an hma hluahhlo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuticun vutcam cu tappi ihsin an lak ih Faro ih hmaiah cun an va ding. Moses in vutcam cu van ah a theh ih minung le ramsa parah khuaihli a cang ih an hma hluahhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt ramih dawithiam pawl cu Moses hmaiah an ra suak thei lo; ziangahtile a dang Izipt pawl vek thotho in annih khal khuaihli hma an tuar thluh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Faro ih thinlung cu Bawipa in a hahter thotho. Moses hnenah Bawipa ih a sim cia bangtuk in Israel mi pawl cu a fehter duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Zingthlapit tein feh awla Faro va tong aw. Cule a hnenah, ‘Hebru mi pawl ih Pathian, Bawipa in na hnenah: Ka minung pawl ih in biak theinak dingah thlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuih ṭum cu nangmah pumpak tlun le na kuthnuai bawi pawl le na milai pawl par hrimhrim ah leilung tlunah keimah bangtuk zohman an um lo ti nan theihnak dingah nasa zetin ka lo hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangmah le na minung pawl parah ka kut hawi in natnak thlenter ningla nang cu siatsuah thluh relrel na si zo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla leilung tlun hmuahhmuah ah ka hminthannak a zai theinak dingah ka cahnak ka lo hmuh ih na nunnak ka lo zuah hrih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain nangmah cu ka minung pawl ih tlunah na puarthau thotho ih na thlah duh hai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaihnik, thaisun tuih tikcu ah Izipt ram thuanthu-ih a um dah lomi rial napi in ka tlakter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cu a si hrangah, ṭilva siseh, thildang hmuahhmuah siseh, a lengih a ummi hmuahhmuah khum thluh dingin thu pe aw. A lengih a um mi minung le ṭilva tlunah rial cu a tla ding ih innsungih khum lomi pohpoh cu an thi ṭheh ding a si,’ tin va sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭongmi cu an theih tikah Faro ih kuthnuai bawi pawl a hrek cu an thin a phangzet ih an sal pawl le an ṭilva pawl cu inn ah an khum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain a hrekkhat cun Bawipa ih ṭongmi cu zianghman ah an siar lo ih an sal pawl le an ṭilva pawl cu innlengah an taan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Na kut vanah thlir awla Izipt ramsung hmuahhmuah ih minung siseh, ṭilva siseh, lo sungih rawlkung tlun tiangin rial a tla ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Moses cun a kianghrol cu van ah a thlir ih, Bawipa in nimthlakau le khuari le rial thawn leilung cu a burh ciamco. Bawipa in rial cu Izipt ramah a tlakter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nasa ngaingai mi rial a si ih nimthlakau cu khuazakip ah a hrawh aw zohzo. Izipt ram a thok ihsin cumi cu a roh bikmi thlisia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Izipt ramsung khuazakip ah innlengih a ummi pohpoh, minung siseh ṭilva siseh, rial cun a siatsuah thluh. Lo sungih rawlkung hmuahhmuah an tlu thluh ih hramlakih thingkung hmuahhmuah an kiak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Goshen ram Israel mi-ih umnak lawnglawng a him; rial pakhat hman a tla lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Moses le Aaron cu a ko ih, “Tuih ṭum cu keimah ka sual ih Bawipa cu a dik a si. Keimah le ka minung pawl kan mawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah thla cam hram uh. Hi khawri le rial cu kan khop zo. Nan suak hrimhrim ding, tiah ka lo kam. Rei nan um ding hman a ṭul nawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in Faro hnenah, “Hi khawpi sung ihsin ka suah vete in Bawipa hnenah ka baan ka phar ding. Cutikah khawri a reh pei ih rial khal a tla nawn lo ding. Cuticun leilung hi Bawipa ih ta a si ti na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nangmah le na kuthnuai bawi pawl in Bawipa Pathian cu nan ṭih hrih lo ti ka thei a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rial in khumla kung le barli sangvut pawl cu a deng siat ṭheh. Ziangahtile khumla cu a cuut laifang a si ih barli sangvut khal a rah laifang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asinain sangvut le fangtlor cu an siat lo. Ziangahtile an cuut a tlai deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses cu Faro taan in khawpi sung ihsin a suak. Cule Bawipa hnenah a baan phar in thla a cam ih cuvete in khuari le rial tla cu an reh ih ruah khal a han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Faro in ruah a han ih rial a tla nawn lo ih khuari khal a reh ti a hmuh tikah a sual sal ih a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih hnenah a ṭang lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moses hnen ihsin Bawipa ih a sim cia vek thothoin Faro ih thinlung cu a ruh sinsin ih Israel mi pawl cu a thlah duh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Faro hnenah va feh aw. Hi bangtuk mangbangza ka tuahsuaknak dingah amah le a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih thinlung cu ka hakter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anmah lakah hi bangtuk mangbangza ka tuah ih Izipt mi pawl kha hnihsuahsainak menih ka hman hi na tu le na fa hnenih na run sim dingah a si. Bawipa ka si hi nan zatein nan thei leh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuhrangah Moses le Aaron cu Faro hnenah an feh ih a hnenah, “Hebru mi pawl ih Pathian, Bawipa ih a simmi cu: ‘Ka hmaika-ah ziangtik tiangso lungnem tangdor duh loin na um ding? Keimah in biak theinak dingah ka minung pawl cu feh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka minung pawl thlah ding na el thotho a si ahcun thaisun ah na ramsung ah kharbok ka run thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kharbok cu an tam tukah leilung malte hman lang loin an khuh mepmep ṭheh ding. Rial ih a siatsuah lomi thil hmuahhmuah an ei ding ih na ram sungih thingkung hmuahhmuah an ei ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Culawng si loin na siangpahrang inn, na kuthnuai bawi pawl ih inn le na minung pawl hmuahhmuahih inn khal an khat ṭheh ding a si. Na pu le na pa pawl le nan cithlahtu pawl hi ram an thlen pek ihsin thokin an ton dah keel lomi thil siava a si ding,’ a ti,” tiah an ti. Cule an her sal ih Faro hnen ihsin an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Faro ih kuthnuai bawi pawl in, “Ziangtik tiangso hi pa in hnaihnawhnak in pek ding? Bawipa an Pathian cu an biak theinak dingah mipa pawl cu feh ko hai seh. Ziangahtile Izipt ram a siat zo hi na hmu lo maw?” tiah Faro cu an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Moses le Aaron cu an va ko sal ih Faro in an hnenah, “Nan va feh pei ih Bawipa nan Pathian cu nan va biak a si pei cu! Asinain zo pawl so a feh ding?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “Kan zatein kan feh ding; kan fanau le kan nutar le kan patar pawl khal an tel ding. Kan fapa kan fanu, kan tuu le kan me le kan caw pawl thawn kan feh ding, ziangahtile Bawipa hrangah thawinak puai kan tuah ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in an hnenah, “A ṭha ko; Bawipa in lo bawm seh. Sikhalsehla nan fanau le nan nunau pawl cu nan fehpi lo pei. Kan hrangih harsatnak suahter dingah in phiar rero a si ti cu a fiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Annih cu an feh lamlam zik lo! Mipa lawnglawng nan feh pei ih Bawipa cu nan biak pei. Nan dilmi cu cumi a sisi,” tiah a ti. Cuthluh in Faro hnenin a dawi in an dawi hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Izipt ram sungih kharbok a thlennak dingah na baan cu phar aw. Thingkung hramkung a nungmi hmuahhmuah le rial ih a siatsuah lomi pohpoh cu an ei thluh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah Moses cun a kianghrol a thlir ih Bawipa in nisuahnak lam ihsin thli a rak hranter ih sun nihlawh le zan khuavar a hrang. Zinglam ah thli cun kharbok pawl cu a rak hrancih ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Izipt ram khuazakip ah an thleng ih a ram pumpuluk in an khat. Kharbok cu an tamtuk ih cubangtuk cu an hmu dah lo. Hmailam khalah cubangtuk cu an hmu nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leiram lang loin an khuh ṭheh ih an khuh tukah a dum in a dum hmerhmer. Rial ih a siatsuah lomi thingkung hramkung le thingrah hmuahhmuah an ei ṭheh. Izipt ramsung hmuahhmuah ah thingkung le hramkung parah hnah hring pakhat hman a taang nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Moses le Aaron cu zamrangte in a ko ih, “ Bawipa nan Pathian hmai le nanmah hmaiah ka sual zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah atu voikhat cu ka sualnak i ngaithiam hram uhla hi in pekmi ṭihnungza hremnak hi ka hnen ihsin la sal dingah Bawipa nan Pathian hnenah i dil sak hram uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Faro hnen ihsin Moses cu a suak ih Bawipa ih hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in nisuahnak lam thli cu nitlaknak lam thli cakzetah a vun thleng ih acuih thli cun kharbok pawl cu Tipi Sen sungah a hran thlak thluh. Izipt ram pumpi ah kharbok pakhat hman a taang nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain Faro ih thinlung cu Bawipa in a hakter thotho ih Israel mi pawl cu a fehter duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “A sah ih tuk taakah pah luihlo tlak thimkhawzing in Izipt ram sung khuh ṭheh dingah na baan cu van ah phar aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in a baan cu van ah a phar ih Izipt ram cu thimkhawzing sahzetin ni thum sung a khuh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutiih khua a thim ruangah Izipt mi pawl cu pakhat le pakhat an hmu aw thei lo ih ni thum sung zohman lengah an suak thei lo. Asinain Israel mi umnak ram ahcun khua a vang ringring ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Faro in Moses a ko ih a hnenah, “ Bawipa biak dingah feh uh. Nan nunau pawl le nan nauhak pawl khal nan hnenah feh ko hai seh. Asinain nan tuu, nan me le nan caw pawl lawngte nan taanta pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “ Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah mei-ur thawinak le thawinak dang hrangih a ṭulmi ṭilva pawl cu nangmah in in ruahsak a ṭul ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuhrangah kan ṭilva pawl cu kan hnenah an feh thluh a ṭul a si; pakhat hman kan taanta lo pei. Bawipa kan Pathian biaknak ih kan hman dingmi ṭilva cu kan hril ding ih a hmun kan va thlen hlanah cun kanmah khal in Bawipa kan biaknak ah khuimi kan hmang pei ti kan thei ve hrih lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Faro ih thinlung cu Bawipa in a hakter ruangah Israel mi pawl cu a fehter duh thotho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Moses hnenah, “Ka hmuh ban lonak ah tlanhlo aw. Ka lo hmuh sal nawn lonak dingah ralring aw, ziangahtile ka lo hmuh sal citcet ahcun cuih ni cu na thih ni a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “Na ti bangin si ko seh; ziangtik hmanah ka hmai i hmu nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses hnenah Bawipa in, “Faro le Izipt mi hnenah hremnak pakhat lawng ka thlengter thlang ding. Cuih hnuah a lo fehter ding. Thungai tile a lo thlah tikah cun hitawk ram ihsin a dawi in a lo dawi hlohhlo hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuhrangah Israel mi pawl hnenah sim aw: Nunau khal mipa khal an innhnen pawl kha hlawnthil sui le ngun dil ciar hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in hna a ṭuan ruangah Izipt mi pawl in Israel mi pawl cu an upat hngin ih, Moses tla cu bawi pawl siseh misenpi pawl in siseh mimakzet ah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in Faro hnenah, “ Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu hiti in a si: ‘Zanṭim ah Izipt mi pawl hnenah ka feh pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izipt ram sungih fapatir hmuahhmuah, siangpahrang rocotu ding Faro ih fapatir ihsin thokin fang rialnak ih hnaṭuantu salnu ih fapatir tiangin an thi ding. Ṭilva hmuahhmuahih fatir khal an thi ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan dunglam khalah a um dah hrih lo ih kan hmailam khalah a um nawn lo dingmi ṭah le raak cu Izipt ram sungah a khat ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in Izipt mi le Israel mi cu a thleidang a si, ti nan theihnak dingah Israel mi pawl cu uico pakhatte hman in, ṭilva siseh milai siseh, a bo lo ding,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah na kuthnuai bawi pawl hmuahhmuah cu ka hnenah an ra ding ih an lu an kuun ding ih, ‘Feh uh, nangmah le na mi pawl feh thlang hram uh,’ an ti ding. Cutikah ka feh ding a si,” tiah a ti. Cule thinheng zetin Moses in Faro cu a tlansan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses hnenah Bawipa in, “Izipt ram sungih mangbangza tam deuh ka tuahnak dingah Faro cun na thu a ngai lo ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses le Aaron cun Faro ih hmaiah mangbangza hizat an tuah zo. Asinain Faro ih thinlung cu Bawipa in a hakter ih Israel mi pawl in Izipt ram an taan ding cu a siang hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izipt ram thotho ah Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuih thla hi nan hrangah kum khat sungih thla hmaisabik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuhrangah Israel miburpi hnenah: Tuih thla a ni hranak ah mipa hmuahhmuah in an innsang hrang ciarah, innsang pakhat ah tuu note asilole me note pakhat ciar hril hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Innsang pakhat in an ṭilva thahmi an ei thluh thei lo ding asile an minung zat zoh in an innhnen te thawn ṭilva pakhat ṭawm aw hai seh. Minung ziangzat an um ti le ziangzat ciar an ei thei ding ti zoh in a man khal zuul hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ṭilva cu a him raitluan a si pei ih, a pa kum khat ti a si pei. Tuu asilole me an hril pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A cuih thla ni hleili ni tiang an ret pei ih a ni hleili zanlam ah Israel mi zatein ṭilva cu an that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun a thisen hrekkhat cu an lak pei ih, acuih sa an einak ding inn sangka tunrel le sangka tlunah an hnih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zan ah acuih sa cu meisa-ah an em pei ih thilnu tel lo sang le anfangkha thawn an ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hel in nan ei lo pei. A suan khalin nan ei lo pei. A pum in a lu le a ke le a sungril thawn nan em pei ih cutiin ei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sa malte hman zinglam tiang nan hlah lo pei. Nan hlahmi a um pang le meisa-ah nan ur ral pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan ei ding daan cu hiti in a si pei: Nan hnipuan nan taai ah nan ṭem pei, nan kedam nan hruk pei ih nan kianghrol nan kai fekfek pei ih zamrangte in nan ei pei. Ziangahtile Bawipa ih Lantak puai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih zanah Izipt ram pumpi sungah ka feh ding ih minung siseh ṭilva siseh an fatir cu ka that ṭheh ding. Keimah cu Bawipa ka si ih Izipt ramih an khawzing hmuahhmuah tlunah thu ka ṭhen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sangka ih thisen hnihmi cu nan umnak inn a si ti hminsinnak a si ding. Thisen ka hmuh tikah ka lo lanta ding. Izipt ram ka hrem tikah nannih cu siatsuahnak nan tong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih ni cu nan hrangah nan ciin ringring dingmi ni a si ding ih, Bawipa hnenah biaknak puai tiah nan tuah ringring pei. Sankhat hnu sankhat, kumkhua cat loin puai ni a si tiah nan tuah ringring pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ni sarih sung thilnu tel lomi sang nan ei pei. Nikhat ni-ah nan inn ihsin thilnu hmuahhmuah cu nan hlon thluh pei; ziangahtile mi pakhatkhat in ni khat ni in ni sarih ni tiang thilnu telmi sang a ei ahcun Israel miphun sungin nan suah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni khat ni le ni sarih ni-ah biakkhawmnak nan tuah pei. Hi ni hnih sungah ziang hna hman ṭuan ding a si lo. Senpi hrangah rawl lawngte nan suang thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi thilnu tel lo puai hi ṭhatein nan ul pei, ziangahtile a hi ni-ah Izipt ram ihsin nan zatein ka lo hruaisuak a si. Sankhat hnu sankhat hi ni cu a kumkhua in puai ni-ah nan hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thla hmaisa bikih ni hleili ni zanlam in ni kul hluan khat ni zanlam tiang thilnu tel lo sang nan ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni sarih sung cu nan innsung pohpoh ah thilnu nan ret lo pei; ziangahtile mi pakhatkhat, ram dangmi siseh, nan phunpi siseh, thilnu rawimi a ei a si ahcun Israel miphun sung ihsin dawi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thilnu telmi nan ei hrimhrim lo pei. Nan innsung pohpoh ah thilnu tel lo sang lawnglawng nan ei pei, tiin thu than aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Israel hruaitu upa pawl a ko ih an hnenah, “Feh uh la nan innsang hrangah tuu note a si lole me note va hril uhla Lantak aihnak puai hrangah that uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun hissop thingṭeek pakhat in lak uhla kheng sungih a ummi thisen sungah hnim in sangka tunrel le sangka tlunlam tlang ah hnih uh. A thaizing khua a van hlan lo zohman nan inn ihsin nan suak lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl that dingah Izipt ram sungih Bawipa a feh tikah nan sangka tunrel le a tlunlam tlang ih thisen hnihmi a hmu pei ih siatsuahtu vanmi cu mi that dingah nan innsungah a lutter lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih tlunah hi daan pawl cu nanmah le nan tesinfa pawl hrangah kumkhua hrangih thupekmi a si ih nan thlun tengteng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa ih a lo kam cia bangtuk in a lo pek dingmi ramih nan thlen tik khalah hi daan hi nan thlun pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nan faate pawl in, ‘Hitiih kan hman daan hi ziang tican so a si?’ tiah an lo sut asile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nannih in, ‘ Bawipa hnenih pekmi Lantak raithawinak a si; ziangahtile Izipt mi pawl a thah hai tikah Israel mi pawl ih inn tla cu a lanta ih kan inn cu a zuah a si,’ nan ti pei,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Israel mi pawl cun an khuk an bil ih an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an feh ih cuih thu cu an thlun. Moses le Aaron hnenih Bawipa ih thupekmi vekin Israel mi cun an tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun zanṭim ah Bawipa in Izipt ram sungih fatir hmuahhmuah, Faro ih fapatir, siangpahrang rocotu ding a si mi ihsin thokin leilung hnuai thawnginn ih thawngtla mi ih fapatir tiangin a that ṭheh; ramsa hmuahhmuahih fatir khal an thi ṭheh relrel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih zan cu Faro le a kuthnuai bawi pawl le Izipt mi pawl cu an tho ih Izipt ram cu ṭah le raaknak hlir in a khat; ziangahtile fapa thih lonak inn pakhat hman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuih zan thotho ahcun Faro in Moses le Aaron cu zamrang in a ko ih, “Pok uh! Nanmah le Israel mi pawl zamrangte in tlan uh. Ka minung pawl cu taanta uhla feh uh. Nan dil vekin nan Bawipa cu va biak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nan tuu le nan me le nan caw pawl khal nan dil vekin hruai uhla feh uh. Keimah hrang khalah thluasuah in dil sak uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl khal in zamrangte ih an ramsung ihsin suak hlohhlo dingah an fial hai; ziangahtile, “An feh lo asile kan thi thluh ngaingai ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cun thilnu tel lo sangvut cu an lak ih an sang tuahnak beel sungah an hnipuan in an tuam ih an liang in an phur ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moses ih thucah bangtuk in Izipt mi pawl ih hlawnthil sui le ngun le hnipuan pawl cu Israel mi in an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawipa in hna a ṭuan ruangah Israel mi cu Izipt mi pawl in an hmaizah hngin ih an dilmi hmuahhmuah an ngah. Cuticun Israel mi pawl in Izipt mi pawl ih thilri cu an laksak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Rameses in an pok ih Sukkoth lamah an feh. Nunau le nauhak siar loin mipa patling hlir thawng zaruk an ke in an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel mi a si lomi midang tampi le tuu, me le caw tampi tla an hnenah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin an kenmi sangvut cu thilnu tel loin sangah an tuah. Thilnu tel lomi sang a si, ziangahtile rinlopi-ah Izipt ram in dawimi an si. Anmah hrangih rawl suannak caan khal an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu kum zali le sawmthum Izipt ram ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum zali le sawmthum a kim ni-ah Bawipa ih miburpi cu Izipt ram in an suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cuih zan cu Izipt ram sung ihsin suak dingah Bawipa in a kilven zan a si. Curuangah cuih zan cu Israel mi pawl Bawipa ih a kilven zan tiah nehhnu san tiangin ulta dingah Bawipa ih hnenah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenah, “Lantak puai ih thlun ding daan cu hiti in a si ding: Ramdang mi in Lantak puai rawl an ei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asinain nan leimi sal cun a serh nan tan hnu lawngah a ei thei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A laangte ih a ummi le nan saancopmi kuli pawl cun an ei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Inn pakhat sungah nan ei pei ih a lengah zianghman nan suahpi lo pei. Cun nan thahmi ṭilva cu a ruh nan khiak lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel mi zatein puai cu nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ramdangmi nan hnenah an um ih Lantak puai Bawipa upatnak ih tuah an duh a si ahcun hmaisabik ah mipa hmuahhmuah an serh nan tan ṭheh pei; cuihnu lawngah puai ah an tel thei ding; nan sungsuak Israel mi bangtuk ah rel an si thlang ding. Sikhalsehla serh tan lomi pa cun a ei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hi daan pawl in Israel hrin a si mi le nan lakih a ummi ramdangmi khal a huap a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cuticun Israel mi pohpoh in an thlun ih Bawipa in Moses le Aaron hnenih thu a pekmi vekin an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A cuih ni-ah Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa in a burpipi in a suahter hai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Fapatir hmuahhmuah cu keimah hnenah nan pek ding. Israel mi lakih fapatir pohpoh cu ka ta an si; ṭilva lak khalah a pa fatir cu ka ta an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses in Israel mi hnenah, “Izipt ram, salih nan tannak ram ihsin nan suah ni, tuihsun hi ciing ringring uh; ziangahtile Bawipa in a baan thacak in a lo suah ni a si. Thilnu telmi sang nan ei hrimhrim lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abib thla, tuihsun ah Izipt ram in nan suak a si hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Kanaan mi, Hit mi, Amor mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi tla-ih umnak ram cu nan hnenih pe dingin nan pu le nan pa hnenah Amah ih hmin saal in thu a rak kam zo. Cuih ram cu cawhnawi le khuaitizu a luannak ram a si. Curuangah cuih ram nan thlen tikah Abib thla tengteng ah thilnu tel lo sang puai tuah cu nan hngilh lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sarih sung cu thilnu tel lo sang nan ei pei ih a ni sarihnak ah Bawipa hrangah puai nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sarih sung cu thilnu tel lo sang nan ei pei. Thilnu telmi sang siseh, thilnu siseh nan ramsung hrimhrim ah nan umter lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Hi hmuahhmuah kan tuahnak cu Izipt ram ihsin kan suah tikah kanmah hrangah Bawipa ih thil tuahmi hngilh lonak a si,’ tiah cuih ni-ah nan faale pawl hnenah nan sim pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiti nan tuahnak cu dunglam thu a lo theih tertu, nan kutah siseh, nan cal ah siseh hminsinnak bangtuk a si ding ih, cuti lawngin Bawipa ih daan cu a sim le a rel nan dai lo ding; ziangahtile a cahnak huham thawn Bawipa in Izipt ram ihsin a lo suah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum khat hnu kum khat a camah feltein nan tuah ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Bawipa in Kanaan mi pawl ih ramah a lo thlenter hai ding; ziangahtile Amah ih hmin saal in nan pu le nan pa hnenah thu a rak kam zo. Cuih ram cu nan hnenih a lo pek tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nan fapatir hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa hnenah nan hlan ding. Nan ṭilva-ih hrin hmaisa bik fatir a pa tla Bawipa ih ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain laak fatir a pa cu tuu faate in nan tlen pei; nan tlen duh lo asile a hngawng nan khiak pei. Nan fapatir pohpoh cu nan tlen sal pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nehhnu ah nan fapa in, ‘Hitiih nan tuah mi hi a tican ziangso a si?’ tiih a lo sut asile, ‘ Bawipa in kan saltaannak Izipt ram ihsin a cahnak huham thawn in rak suah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro a thinlung a hak ih Izipt ram ihsin in suah duh lo tikah, Izipt ramih fapatir hmuahhmuah, milai fapa siseh, ramsa fa siseh Bawipa in a rak that ṭheh. Curuangah fapatir pohpoh cu Bawipa hnenih hlan an sinak a si; asinain ka fapatir cu ka tlen sal a si,’ tiah nan ti pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hitiih nan tuahnak cu dunglamih thu a lo theihtertu, nan kutah siseh, nan cal ah siseh hminsinnak bangtuk a si ding; ziangahtile Izipt ramsung ihsin Bawipa in a cahnak huham thawn in suah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Faro in Israel mi pawl a fehter tikah, Filistia tipikap ih a fehmi lamzin cu a tawi bik asinain Bawipa in hi lamzin cun a hruai hai lo. Ziangahtile Pathian in, “Ral an do dingmi pawl an hmuh tikah an thinlung thleng aw in Izipt ramih an kirsal ding cu ka duh lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih lamzin ai-ah, nelrawn ramṭhing zin ihsin Tipi Sen lamah Bawipa in a heelpi a si. Israel mi pawl cu ral do dingah timtuah cia in Izipt ihsin an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in Josef ih ruh khal a keng; ziangahtile amah Josef in Israel mi pawl cu siatcam in thu a kamter ciami an si. An hnenah, “Pathian in a lo runsuak hai ding a si. Cutikah hitawk ihsin nan suah tikah ka ruh nan keng pei,” tiah Josef in a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sukkoth ihsin Israel mi pawl cu an pok ih nelrawn kiangte Etham ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sun ah an lamzin hmuhtu dingah mero zual in Bawipa cu an hmaiah a feh. Zan a si tikah tleunak pe dingah le a sun a zanih an feh theinak dingah meisa zual in Bawipa cu an hmaiah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mi hmaiah cat loin sunah mero zual a um ih zanah meisa zual a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl cu dungah siip dingin le Pi-hahiroth hmai, Migdol le Tifinriat karlak ah Baalzefon lam hoih in riak dingah sim aw. Cuih hmun Tipi Sen kapah riak hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in, ‘Israel mi pawl cu vansaangin an vakvai ih nelrawn ah an taang a si,’ tiah a ruat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Faro ih thinlung cu ka hakter ding ih Israel mi pawl cu an dung in a dawi sal ding. Cutikah Faro le a ralkap pawl ka neh ding ih cumi cun ka hmin i thangter ding. Cutik lawngah Izipt mi pawl in Bawipa ka si kha an thei ding a si,” tiah a ti. A sim vek cun Israel mi pawl in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl an luat zo tiin Izipt ram siangpahrang an sim tikah, amah le a kuthnuai bawi pawl cu an thinlung a thleng aw sal ih, “Kan thil tuahmi hi ziangso a si? Ziangah so kan sal an sinak ihsin Israel mi pawl kan suahter?” tiah an ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in a raldonak rangleng pawl cu tim a tuahter ih a ralkap pawl cu a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An rangleng lakih a ṭha bikmi rangleng zaruk, le a parah ralbawi pakhat ciar to in a dang Izipt pawl ih rangleng tla in an dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in Faro ih thinlung a hahter ruangah, ralṭhazet ih a fehsuakmi Israel pawl cu a dawi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl cun an rang hmuahhmuah thawn Faro ih rangleng le a mawngtu pawl le a ralkap tla thawn Israel mi pawl cu an dawi ih Baalzefon hmai, Pi-hahiroth kiang Tipi Sen kapih an riahnak ah an man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Faro in a hei naih vivo tikah Israel mi pawl cun anmah dawi ih Izipt mi an rat kha an hmu tikah an ṭih ngaingai ih Bawipa hnenah an ṭap an ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Moses hnenah, “Izipt ramih thlaan a um lo ruangah maw hitawk nelrawn ramṭhing ahhin thi dingih in rak hruai? Izipt ram ihsin in suah ih na thil tuahmi hi zohhnik!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Izipt ramih kan um lai ihsin hitivek a si ding ti cu kan lo sim cia tho lo maw? ‘In hnaihnok duh hlah; Izipt mi hnenah sal kan si ko pei,’ kan lo ti tho lo maw? Hi nelrawn ramṭhing sungih thih hnakin sal si cu kan hrangah a ṭha sawn a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Israel mi hnenah, “Phang hlah uh; hnget zetin ding uhla, tuihsun ah nanmah run dingah Bawipa ih tuah dingmi rak zoh uh. Tuihsun ih nan hmuhmi Izipt mi pawl hi nan hmu nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanmah ih ai-ah Bawipa in a lo do sak ding. Nannih tuah ding zianghman a um lo. Thlangamtein um uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Ziangah so ka hnenah na au rero? Israel mi kha hmailamih nor dingin sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kianghrol khai awla, tifinriat tlunah na baan phar aw. Cule tidai cu a ṭhen-aw ding ih Israel mi pawl cu leicaar parin an feh lan thei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl ih thinlung cu hakzet in ka tuah pei ih khuitawk khalah an lo dawi ding. Cutikah Faro le a ralkap pawl le a rangleng le a rangleng mawngtu pawl ka neh ding ih cumi in ka hmin a sunglawiter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiin Faro le a rangleng le a rangleng mawngtu pawl tlunih nehtu ka si ih ka hmin sunloih a si tik lawngah Izipt mi pawl in Bawipa ka si hi an thei ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel ralkap burpi hmaiih a feh ṭheutu Pathian ih vancungmi cu a ṭhawn ih dunglamin a khor hai. An hmaiih a um ṭheumi mero zual khal cu dunglamah a ṭhawn aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Izipt ralkap pawl le Israel mi burpi karlakah a ceer. Mero a um ih Izipt ralkap hrangah khua a thim; asinain Israel mi hrangah a vaang. Curuangah zanvaar naih aw thei veve loin Izipt ralkap pawl le Israel mi cu an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses in tifinriat tlunih a baan a phar tikah, Bawipa in nisuahnak lam thli cu napi in a hranter ih zanvaar a hran hnuah tifinriat tawphah-ih leiro a hung lang. Tidai cu a ṭhen aw ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tifinriat sungih leiro par in Israel mi pawl cu an feh. An sir le sirah tidai cu phar bangtuk in a tiang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Izipt mi pawl cun Faro ih rang hmuahhmuah le a rangleng pawl le a mawngtu pawl tla thawn tifinriat sungah cun an hei dawi thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zinglam khawfingcat ah Bawipa in meisa zual le mero zual parin Izipt ralkap pawl cu a vun zoh ih vansaanglamin a tuah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An rangleng ke pawl cu a tarhakter ruangah harsa zetin an ṭhawn-aw thei ceu. Cutikah Izipt ralkap pawl in, “ Bawipa in Israel mi a ṭan ih kannih cu in do a si, kan tlan pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Culaifang ah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Tifinriat tlunah na baan phar awla Izipt mi pawl le an rangleng pawl le an rangleng mawngtu pawl ih parah tidai a ra kirsal ding ih a phim ṭheh hai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Moses in a baan cu tifinriat tlunah a phar ih khua a van tikah cun tidai cu a ra kirsal ih amah keelah a cang sal. Izipt mi pawl cu tlansuah an tumnak ah tidai cu an pah ih Bawipa in tidai sungah a hlon ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tidai cu a ra kirsal ih tifinriat sung tiangin Israel mi a dawitu, Faro ih ralkap hmuahhmuah le an rangleng le a mawngtu pawl tla cu a khuh ṭheh hai a si. Pakhat hman an luat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asinain Israel mi pawl cu an sir le sirah tidai cu phar bangin a tiang aw ih tifinriat sungih leiro parin an fehsuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih ni-ah Izipt mi pawl kut sung ihsin Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa in a runsuak ih Izipt mi pawl ih ruak cu Israel mi pawl in tikap ah an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziangtluk huham cak thawn Bawipa in Izipt mi pawl a do ti cu Israel mi pawl in fiangtein an hmuh ruangah Bawipa cu an ṭih; curuangah Bawipa le a salpa Moses parah rinsannak an nei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Moses le Israel mi pawl cun hi hla hi Bawipa hnenah an sak, “Mangbangza in a neh ruangah, Bawipa ih hnenah hla ka sak ding. Ti sungah rang le a cuangtu pawl, A hlon ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu ka cahnak le ka thazaang a si, I runsuaktu khal Amah a si. Ka Pathian a si ih ka thangṭhat ding; Ka pa ih Pathian, a maksaknak ka cawimawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu ralnehtu a si; A hminah Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Faro ih rangleng le ralkap pawl, Tifinriat sungah a paih ṭheh. A kuthnuai bawi ṭhaṭha pawl, Tipi Sen sungah an pil ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thukmi tipi cun a khuh hai ih, A tawne ah lungto bangin an pil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na vorhlam baan thacak cu, Maw Bawipa mangbangza a si. Na vorhlam baan thacak cu, Ral pawl ṭhio thluhtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nasami na mi nehnak in, Na ral pawl na hlon ṭheh ih, Na thinhengnak a alh tikah, Annih cu fang kuang ro bangin an kaang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na hnar na phawt tikah, Tidai pawl an tiang aw, A luanglaimi tidai cu, Phar bangin an ding. A thuk zetmi tifinriat cu, Tikhal bangin a khal ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan ral in, ‘Ka dawi pei ih ka man mai ding; An hlawn le an thil hmuahhmuah ka ṭhen thluh pei ih, An hnen ihsin ka duh pohpoh ka duh zatzat ka lak ding; Ka ralnam ka zuk pei ih, An ci ka mit ṭheh ding,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain na thaw voikhat na phawt tikah, Tifinriat in a khuh ṭheh hai. Ṭihnungza tidai sungah, Suantum bangin an pil ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , leilungih khawzing pawl lakah, A lo bangtu zoso a um? Nangmah a lo bangtu zoso a um? Thianhlimnak ah na ropi, Sunlawinak ah ṭihnungza, Thilti theinak ah mangbangza.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na vorhlam baan na phar ih, Kan ral pawl cu leilung in a dolh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na duhdawtnak ah rintlak na si, Na tlen ciami pawl na hruai hai. Na cahnak in na minung pawl hi Na hmun thianghlim tiang na khor hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leitlun ih ramtin in an thei ih, ṭihphang in an khur. Nausuaknat ih thlaphannak bangin, Filistin mi cu an thla a phang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Edom ram ih uktu pawl cu, ṭihnak thawn an bei a dong. Moab ram ih micak pawl cu, An thin a thir thlohthlo. Kanaan ram ih a ummi hmuah tla, An ralṭhatnak a reh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭihnak le thlaphannak in an khat, Na baan thacak an hmuh tikah cun; Lungto bangin caang loin an ding, Maw Bawipa na luattermi Na minung pawl an lan hlanah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah in na hruai hai dingih, Nangmah ih tlangpar ah na phun hai ding. Maw Bawipa na umnak dingih Na tuah mi hmunah, Maw Bawipa nangmah ih na sakmi biakinn ah na fehpi hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa cu kumkhua in kumkhua tiang, Siangpahrang a si ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Izipt rang pawl, rangleng le a mawngtu pawl cu Israel mi dawi in ti sungih an vung luh tikah, Bawipa in tidai cu a ciip awkter sal ih annih cu a khuh ṭheh hai. Asinain Israel mi pawl cu tifinriat sungih leiro parin an feh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aaron ih farnu, nunau profet a si mi, Miriam in khuang pakhat a lak ih a dang nunau tla in khuang tum phah in an laam ih Miriam cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miriam cun an hnenah, “ Bawipa hnenah hla sak uh, Sunglawi zetin a neh zo. Rang le rang ralkap pawl cu, Ti sungah a thlak ṭheh zo,” tiah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses in Israel mi pawl cu an tim a tuahter ih Tipi Sen ihsin pok dingin a fial. Cule Shur nelrawn ah an feh. Nithum sung nelrawn ah an feh naón tidai an tong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutiin Marah ah an va thleng naón cutawkih tidai cu a khaat tuk ruangah an in thei lo. Curuangah Marah tiih an kawhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Moses hnenah, “Ziang so kan in ding?” tiah an phunzai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses cu napi in Bawipa hnenah thla a cam ih, Bawipa in Moses hnenah thingtan pakhat a hmuh. Cuih thingtan cu Moses in ti sungah a vun thlak ih tidai cu a kha nawn lo. Cutawkah Bawipa in a hniksak hai ih an thlun ringring dingah daan a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Keimah nan Bawipa le nan Pathian thu feltein nan ngai ih a dik ka timi nan tuah ih ka thukham thlun in ka daan hmuahhmuah nan ul asile, Izipt mi pawl hnenih ka thlenter mi natnak pawl kha pakhatte hman nan tuar lo ding. Keimah cu a lo damtertu Bawipa ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih hnuah cirh hleihnih le tuumkung sawmsarih umnak Elim ah an va thleng. Cutawkih tikap ah buuk an saam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi miburpi cu Elim ihsin an pok ih, Izipt ram in an pawhsuak thlahnihnak ni hleinga ni-ah Elim le Sinai karlakih a ummi Sin nelrawn an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule cuih nelrawn ramṭhing ahcun an zatein Moses le Aaron hnenah an phunzai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Izipt ramah khan Bawipa in in rak that thluh sawnta sehla kan va duh so! Izipt ram ahcun sakheng kan hil ih rawl kan duh zat in kan ei. Asinain nanmah in in suahpi ih hitawk nelrawn ramṭhing ahhin rilrawng in in thiter thluh ding a sihi!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Atu-ah nan zate hrangah van ihsin ruah bangin sang ka surter ding. Israel mi cu nitinte an riahbuk in an suak pei ih acuih ni hrang daih in sang cu an sar ṭheu pei. Cuticun ka thupekmi an thlun le thlun lo ka hniksak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni ruknak ni-ah cun ni dangih an sar keelih lethnih tam in an sar pei ih ei dingin an timtuah pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuhrangah Moses le Aaron cun Israel mi zate hnenah, “Tuihzan zanlam ah Izipt ram ihsin in suahtu cu Bawipa a si ti kha nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule zinglamah Bawipa ih sunlawinak nan hmu ding. A parih nan phunzainak a thei zo. Asi! Bawipa Amah ih parah nan phunzai. Ziangahtile kannih cu phunzai san tlak kan si ual lo!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “Zanlam ei dingah sa a lo petu ding le zinglam ei dingah nan duh zat sang a lo petu ding cu Bawipa a si. Ziangahtile voi tamzet a parih nan phunzaimi cu a thei zo. Kannih thamtham cu ziangti tlak kan si ual lo! Nan phunzainak cu kan parah a si lo; Bawipa ih parah a si sawn,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Aaron hnenah, “Israel mi zate hnenah, ‘Ra uhla Bawipa ih hmaiah ra ding uh; ziangahtile nan phunzainak a thei zo a si,’ tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An zate hnenih Aaron a ṭong vete in nelrawn lam an hoi ih hmakhatte-ah Bawipa ih sunlawinak tleu cu mero parah a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl ih phunzainak cu ka thei zo; an hnenah, ‘Zanlam khawmawt zawng ah ei ding sa nan ngah ding ih zinglamah nan duh zat rawl nan ngah ding. Cutikah Bawipa keimah cu an Pathian ka si hi an thei ding,’ tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule zanlam ah vanim tampi an ra ih Israel mi an riahbuk hrawng cu an khat ṭheh. Zinglam ah riahbuk kiangkapah cun daiti thuah khat a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih daiti cu a ro tikah nelrawn leilung parah cun thil phunkhat, a paa ih a peer zetmi, leilung parih tikhal paate bangtuk a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cumi cu Israel mi pawl in an hmuh tikah ziang a si ti an thei lo ih pakhat le pakhat, “Ziang so a si?” tiah an sut-aw ton vivo. Cutikah Moses in, “Himi hi Bawipa in nan ei dingah sang a lo pekmi cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in nanmahte nan ṭul zat ciar nan sar khawm pei ih mi pakhat hrangah khuat li ciarin nan sar pei. Mi pakhat in a riahbuk sungih a ummi zate hrangih a ṭulmi zat ciar nan lak pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cun Moses ih sim vekin an tuah; mihrek cun tam an khawm ih mihrek cun mal an khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an tah tikah tam deuh a khawmmi pawl in tamtuk an nei cuang lo ih mal deuh a khawmmi pawl khalin maltuk an nei cuang fawn lo. A khawmtu hmuahhmuah in an ṭul tawk zat ngaingai ciar an khawm a rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “Zohman in thaisun hrangah tiah nan ret lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain mi hrekkhat cu Moses ih thu ngai loin sang malte cu thaisun hrangah tiah an rak ret. A thaizing ahcun a siat ṭheh ih tholung a rak khah ruangah a nam hiamhiam. Cutikah Moses cu an parah a thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cun zingtinte an ṭul zat ciar an khawm ṭheu; asinain sunih ni a ling tikah leilung parih a taangmi cu a zup thluh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Niruknak ni-ah cun rawl cu lethnih tam in minung pakhat hrang khuat riat ciarin an khawm. Israel mi hruaitu pawl cu an ra ih cuih thu cu Moses hnenah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “Himi hi Bawipa ih thupek a si, ‘Thaisun cu colh ni, Bawipa hnenih ni, sabbath thiang a si. Em nan duhmi atu ah em uhla, suan nan duhmi atu-ah suang uh. Nan hlahmi pohpoh cu a dangte in khawl uhla thaisun hrangah ret uh,’ a ti a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Moses ih sim vekin an hlahmi cu a thaisun tiang an ret ih a uih hrimhrim lo; tholung khal a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “Himi hi tuihsun ah ei uh; ziangahtile tuihsun cu Bawipa hrangih sabbath a si ruangah khawlengah zianghman nan hmu lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Niruk sung nan khawm pei. Asinain ni sarihnak ni cu sabbath a si ruangah zianghman a um lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain mi hrekkhat cu rawl hawl dingah khawlengah an feh ih an hawl thotho naón an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Ziangtik tiangso ka thukham le ka daan pawl hi thlun duh loin nan um ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sabbath a lo tuahsaktu cu Bawipa Keimah ka si ti cu thei uh. Curuangah a si ni hnih hrang daih in ni ruk ni-ah rawl ka lo pek. Nisarih ni cu zozo khal mah ih umnak ciarah um ding a si. Zokhal mah ih inn ihsin suak lo ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Curuangah nisarih ni-ah Israel mi pawl cu an cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in a cuih an rawl cu manna tiah an ti. Manna cu Koriander ci a bang. A raang ih a thawtzia cu khuaitizu rawimi sangpheng vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “ Bawipa ih thupek cu hiti in a si, ‘Manna sang cu dawng pakhat sungah ret uh. Izipt ram ihsin ka lo suakter ih nelrawn sung nan feh laiih nan ei dingah ka lo pekmi rawl a si, ti nan tesinfa pawl ih an hmuh leh dingah ṭhatein ret uh,’ a ti,” tiah Israel misenpi hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun Moses in Aaron hnenah, “Beel pakhat in la awla manna sang khuat li-in a sungah thun aw; na tesinfa pawl hrangah Bawipa hmaiah ret aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a pek bangtuk in Aaron in a tuah ih thukam retnak kuang hmaiah a himnak dingah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Kanaan ram an thlen hlan, kum sawmli sung cu manna an ei. Manna cu umhmun an khuarnak Kanaan ram an thlen tiang an ei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />(Omer pakhat cu efah pakhat ih ṭhen hra ṭhen khat a si.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an zatein Sin an timi nelrawn ramṭhing ihsin an pok ih Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in hmunkhat in hmunkhatah an riak vivo. Voikhat cu Refidim ah an riak ih cutawk hmunah an hrangah tidai a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses thawn an to-aw ih Israel mi pawl in, “Tidai in ding in pe-aw he,” an ti. Cutikah Moses in, “Ziangah so keimah cu in tawh? Zianghrangah Bawipa cu nan hniksak?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain mipi pawl cu an ti a haal tuk ruangah Moses parah an phunzai thotho. “Ziangah so Izipt ram ihsin in suahpi? Kan ṭilva le kan tefa pawl thawn tihal in thi thluh hai seh ti in duh ruangah maw a si?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Moses cu nasazetin Bawipa hnenah thla a cam ih, “Himi pawl hi ziangtinso ka ti ding? Keimah lehlam lungto in a deen in tum zuakzo thlang a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Israel mi hruaitu lakin a hrekkhat rak hruai awla, mi burpi ih hmaiah rak feh sung uh. Nail tiva na vuaknak na kianghrol kha keng awla feh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sinai tlang ih lungpi parah na hmaiah ka rak ding ding. Lungpi cu vua awla misenpi hrangah in ding tidai a suak ding,” tiah a ti. Bawipa ih a ti bangtuk in Israel mi hruaitu pawl ih hmaiah cun Moses in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hmun cu, “Massah,” le “Meribah,” tiah an ko; ziangahtile Israel mi pawl an to-aw ih Bawipa cu hniksak tahrat in, “ Bawipa kan hnenah a um maw, um lo so?” tiah an tinak hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Refidim ah Amalek mi pawl in an ra do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in Joshua hnenah, “Kanmah lakin mi hrekkhat hril awla, Amalek pawl va do dingah thaisun ah feh aw. Kei cu tlang parah ka ding pei ih Pathian ih i pek mi kianghrol hi ka thlir ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses ih fial bangtuk in Joshua in a tuah ih Amalek pawl do dingah a feh; cule Moses, Aaron le Hur cu tlang parah an kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses in a baan a thlir sung pohpoh cu Israel mi pawl in an ral an neh vivo; asinain a baan a ṭhum tikah cun Amalek mi pawl in an rak neh deuh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Moses cu a baang zet; a baan tla a zawng ih Aaron le Hur in lungto an lak ih a hnuai ah an ret, acuih parah Moses cu a to ih annih pahnih cu a kapah dingin a baan pawl cu an kai ih an thlir sak. Zanlam nitlak tiang a baan cu an thlir sak ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah Amalek pawl cu Joshua in a neh ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Ciin ringringmi a sinak dingah hi ralnehnak thu hi cabu sungah ngan aw; cun Joshua khal sim aw. Cule Amalek mi pawl cu hloral tata dingin ka tuah ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutawkah Moses in biakṭheng a don ih, “ Bawipa cu ka Thantar a si,” tiah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “ Bawipa ih thantaar khaisaang uh. Ziangahtile Bawipa in Amalek mi pawl cu sankhat hnu sankhat a do ringring ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Midian ramih puithiam, Moses ih pu Jethro in Moses le a minung Israel mi pawl hrangah Pathian ih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah le Izipt ram ihsin Bawipa ih a suahternak thu tla cu a rak thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Moses ih nupi, a pu hnenih a kuatmi, Zipporah cu Jethro in Moses hnenah a ratpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jethro in Zipporah ih fapa pahnih, Gershom le Eliezer khal a rak hruai. Moses in, “Tluang ramah ramdang mi ka si,” tiin a fapa pakhat cu a hmin ah Gershom a sak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pahnihnak cu, “Ka pa ih Pathian cu i bawmtu a si ih Faro ih ralnam ihsin i run a si,” a ti ih a hminah Eliezer a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jethro cu Zipporah le a fapa pahnih thawn Pathian tlang thiang kiangih Moses a riahnak ramṭhing ahcun an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Moses hnenah a pu in, “Keimah na pu Jethro cu na nupi le na fapa pahnih thawn kan ra a si,” tiah thu a hei than.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Moses cu amah hmuak dingah a feh ih a ton tikah a hmaiah a kun ih a hnam. Cule an harhdam le dam lo thuhla an sut-awk hnuah Moses ih riahbuk sungah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses cun Israel mi pawl ih ruangah Bawipa in Faro le Izipt mi pawl parih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu Jethro hnenah a sim ṭheh. Lamzin ih harsatnak an tonmi le Bawipa ih a runnak thu tla a sim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutiih Izipt mi kutsung ihsin a runsuaknak ruangih Bawipa ih ṭhatnak thu a theih tikah Jethro cu a lung a awi ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Faro le Izipt mi pawl hnen ihsin a lo runtu Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh. Izipt mi pawl hnuai ih saltuarnak ihsin a minung a runsuaktu Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa cu khawzing dang hmuahhmuah hnakin a tum sawn a si ti ka thei; ziangahtile Izipt mi pawl in Israel mi pawl ih parah huatnak thawn hna an ṭuan laiah hi thil hmuahhmuah hi a tuah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Jethro in Pathian hnenah raithawinak le mei-ur thawinak a pek ih, Aaron le Israel mi hruaitu pawl cu Moses ih pu Jethro thawn Bawipa ih hmaiah rawl an hil tlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thaisun ah Moses cu a minung pawl ih thuṭhen dingah a to ih, a hmaiah mipi pawl cu zing ihsin zanlam tiang an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses ih pu Jethro in cumi a hmuh tikah Moses hnenah, “Mipi pawl hrangih thiltuah na tummi hi ziangso a si? Ziangah so nangmah lawng hiti in na to ih midang hmuahhmuah cu na kimvelah zing ihsin zanlam tiang an din ringring?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “Hitiih ka tuah cu a ṭul hrimhrim a si. Ziangahtile Pathian ih duhmi ziangso a si ti theih duh ah mipi pawl cu ka hnenah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi pahnih thu an el awk tikah ka hnenah an ra ih cutikah zoso a mawh, zoso a mawh lo tiin thu cu ka relcat sak ih an hnenah Pathian thukham le daan pawl cu ka sim,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Jethro in, “Na thil tidaan hi a dik lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmah le nangmah na siatsuah-aw ding ih hi mipi pawl khal na siatsuah ding a si. Na thil timi hi a tam tuk. Nangmah pakhat lawngin na ti cawk lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah ka thu i ngai aw. Ruahnak ṭha ka lo pe ding ih na hnenah Pathian a um ding. Nang cu Pathian hnenah misenpi ih palai na si pei ih an thu cu a hnenah na thlen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Pathian thukham le daan pawl cu an hnenah na zirh ding ih an nundaan ding le an tuah dingmi cu na simfiang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain thilti theinak a neimi mi hrekkhat hril awla cu pawl cu Israel mi hruaitu dingah ret aw. A thawngthawng, a zaza, sawmnga le pahra-ih hruaitu tla an si ding. Anmah cu Pathian ṭihzahtu le rinsan tlakmi an si pei ih nawhthuh pek theih lomi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cumi pawl cu a kumkhua in mipi pawl ih thuṭhentu si hai seh. Thuhar deuhdeuh cu na hnenah an thlen pei. Asinain thu nepnawi pawl cu anmah tein rel hai seh. Cutiin na tuah asile na thilrit an lo phurh bawm ah a cang ih na nuam deuh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian ih duhnak a si bangin cutiin na tuah asile nangmah le nangmah na siatsuah-aw lo ding ih mipi ih thu cu relcat sak ṭheh an si ding ruangah an innah thawsuakin an kir ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses in Jethro ih thu cu a ngai ih a tivek cun a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel mi sung ihsin thil titheinak a neimi pawl a hril ih misenpi hruaitu dingah a ret hai. A thawngthawng, a zaza, sawmnga nga le pahra hra-ih hruaitu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An nunsungah cat loin misenpi ih thuṭhentu an ṭuan. Thu harsa pawl cu Moses hnenah an thlen. Asinain thu nepnawi pawl cu anmah tein an rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Moses in a pu cu cibai a buk ih Jethro cu a ramah a tlung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Izipt ram ihsin an suah hnu thlathumnak ni khat ni-ah Sinai nelrawn ah an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Refidim ihsin an pok ih Sinai nelrawn an thlen tikah Sinai tlang hmaizawn ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Moses cu Pathian tong dingah tlang parah a kai. Tlangpar ihsin Bawipa in Moses cu a ko ih a hnenah, “Jakob ih tesinfa pawl Israel mi hnenah hiti in sim aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Izipt mi pawl parih ka tuahmi cu nan hmu zo a si ih nannih cu muvanlai in a thla parih a fano a thiar bangtuk in ka hnenah ka lo thiar, ti khal nan hmu zo. Cuticun hitawk ka hnenah ka lo thlenpi hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu ka thu nan ngai ih ka thukham nan thlun asile nannih cu keimah ih minung nan si ding. Leilung pumpi hi ka ta a si, asinain nannih cu keimah ih hrilmi, ka minung hleice nan si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nannih cu keimah hrangih pekmi miphun thiang, puithiam hnaṭuannak sungah keimah i riantu miphun nan si ding,’ tiin Israel mi pawl hnenah sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Moses cu a feh ih Israel mi hruaitu pawl a ko khawm ih Bawipa ih thupekmi hmuahhmuah cu an hnenah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah misenpi in, “ Bawipa ih sim bangtuk in kan tuah thluh ding,” tiah hmunkhatah an let tlang. Moses in Israel mi pawl ih thulehnak cu Bawipa hnenah a va sim sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Nangmah ih hnenih thu ka sim tikah mipi pawl in an theih ih an lo zum ringringnak dingah na hnenah mero sahzet sungin ka ra ding a si,” tiah a ti. Cule mipi pawl ih thulehnak cu Moses in Bawipa ih hnenah a va sim sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Mipi pawl hnenah feh awla, Bawipa bia dingah tuihsun le thaisun an tim tuah-aw hai seh. An hnipuan an sawp pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tipsun ahcun timtuah ciain an um pei. Cuih ni-ah mi zate ih hmuh dingin Sinai Tlang ah ka rung ṭum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sinai tlang a kimvel in mipi pawl hrangah ramri na tuah pei ih, ‘Tlang parih nan kai lonak dingah le a hram tla nan tham lonak dingah ralring uh. Mi pakhatkhat in a tham asile cu pa cu thah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah cu zohmanih tham loin lungto ih den that a si ding, a si lole thal in kah that a si ding. Minung a si khalle ṭilva a si khalle thah a si ding,’ tiin sim aw. Tuucang ki an tum tik lawngah mipi pawl cu tlang ah an kai pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Moses cu tlangpar ihsin a ṭum ih, Pathian bia dingah mipi pawl cu an tim a tuahter. An hnipuan an sawp ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in, “Tipsun cu timtuah ciain um uh; nunau hnen khalah it hlah uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni thumnak ni zinglamah cun tlang parah khua a ri ih nimthla a kau zukzo. Mero sahzet a um ih tuucangki ringzet ih tummi a thang. Riahbuk ih a ummi hmuahhmuah cu an thinphang in an khur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in mipi pawl cu Pathian tong dingah an riahbuk ihsin a suahpi hai ih tlang hramah cun an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sinai tlang hmuahhmuah cu meikhu in a tuam ṭheh. Ziangahtile Bawipa cu tlang parah meisa in a rung. Meikhu cu cahmang meikhu vekin a kai ih Sinai tlang cu a pumpi in a hnin durdo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuucang ki tummi cu a thang sinsin. Moses a ṭong tikah Pathian in khuari in a run let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa cu Sinai tlang parih a rung ṭum tikah Bawipa in Moses cu tlangzim parah a ko ih a kawh vekin a hung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Vung feh awla keimah ra zoh duh ah ramri tla an lan lonak dingah mipi pawl ralrinnak vung pe aw. Culo ahcun mi tampi an thi ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hnenih a rami puithiam pawl hman an thianfaiter-awk a ṭul; culole ka cawh hai ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Moses in Bawipa ih hnenah, “Mipi pawl cu an hung thei lo ding. Ziangahtile hi tlang cu a ri tuah uhla tlang thiangah ret uh, tiah ralrinnak Nangmah in pe zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Vung feh awla na hnenah Aaron hun hruai aw. Asinain puithiam pawl le mipi pawl cun ramri lan hrimhrim hlah hai seh. Culo ahcun ka hrem hai ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Curuangah Moses cu a vung ṭum ih misenpi hnenah a vung sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in hiti in an hnenah a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keimah cu salih nan taannak Izipt ram ihsin a lo suaktertu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keimah siar lo pathian dang nan bia lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Vancung ah siseh, leilung parah siseh, leihnuai tidai sungah siseh a ummi pawl hmuihmel cuangin nan hrangah milem nan tuah lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Milem nan bia lo pei; a hmaiah nan lu khal nan kun lo pei; ziangahtile keimah cu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si ih thiik nei Pathian ka si. Keimah i huatu parah cun an sualnak ruangah ka hrem hai ding ih an tesinfa san, santhum sanli tiang cawhkuannak ka thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sikhalsehla keimah i duhtu le ka thukham pawl a thluntu ih parah cun ka duhdawtnak cu cat loin san thawng tampi tiang ka thlenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Bawipa nan Pathian ih hmin cu duhdah menin nan saal lo pei; ziangahtile Bawipa Keimah in ka hmin cuti a hmangsualtu cu ka hrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Sabbath ni thiangte in nan ul pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Niruk sungah nan hna hmuahhmuah nan ṭuan pei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ni sarih ni cu sabbath ni a si ih Bawipa nan Pathian hrangah a si. Cuih ni-ah cun hna nan ṭuan lo pei; nanmah siseh, nan faate pawl siseh, nan sal pawl, nan ṭilva pawl le nan khawsungih a ra ummi miphundang pawl khal siseh hna an ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Niruk sung Bawipa in van le leilung, tipi le a sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah a tuah ih a ni sarih ni-ah a cawl. Curuangah Bawipa in sabbath cu a thlawsuah ih amah ih hrangah a thianter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nan nu le nan pa nan upat pei; cuticun Bawipa nan Pathian ih ka lo pekmi leiram parah cun san sau in nan nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mi nan that lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ṭaangṭawm sualnak nan tuah lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ruk nan ru lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nan innhnen parah a dik lo theihpitu nan si lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mi thil nan daw lo pei. Mi inn siseh, mi nupi le mi sal pawl siseh, an caw, an rang le midang ih neih mi hmuahhmuah nan daw lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in khuari le tuucangki tummi thawm an theih ih nimthlakau zohzo le meikhu suak hluahhlo tlang an hmuh tikah an ṭih tuk ih an khur thlohthlo. Curuangah a hlapi ah an va ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Moses hnenah, “Nangmah kan hnenah ṭong awla kan lo ngai ding; Pathian kan hnenih a ṭong ahcun kan thi rori ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in an hnenah, “ṭih hlah uh! Ziangahtile Pathian cu amah nan ṭihzah ih nan sual lonak dingah nanmah hniksak ding lawngah a ra a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain Israel mi pawl cu lam hlatpi ah an ding thotho. Pathian umnak khuadur kiangah cun Moses lawng a va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Israel mi pawl hnenah hiti in sim aw, ‘Nan hnenah van ihsin ka ṭong ih nan hmu zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keimah thawn ceemcih ih biak dingah ngunih tuahmi khuavang siseh, sui ih tuahmi khawzing siseh, nan hrangah nan tuah lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leilung ih tuahmi biakṭheng ka hrangah nan tuah pei ih a parah nan mei-ur thawinak le nan pawlkom thawinak pawl, nan tuu le nan caw pawl in nan thawi pei. Keimah biak dingih ka lo simnak hmun kipah nan hnenah ka ra ding ih ka lo thlawsuah hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hrangih lungto biakṭheng nan tuah tikah thirkhen hmangin nan kher lo pei, ziangahtile nan borhhlawhter pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka biakṭheng nan sak tikah a parih kainak dingah tiah kailawn thawn nan sak lo pei; nan sak asile nan kai tikah nan zahmawh nan langter sual pang ding, a ti,’ tiah sim aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hi a thuailam daan pawl cu Israel mi hnenih na pek dingmi an si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebru mi salih nan lei tikah kum ruk sung sal a si ding. Kum sarihnak ahcun zianghman kuan ṭul loin a luat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sal si a thok tikah nupi nei lo a si ahcun nupi nei loin a luat pei. Nupi nei cia a si ahcun a nupi thawn an luat tlang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain sal a si sungah a bawipa in nupi a ṭhit sak ih fanu fapa a nei asile a nupi le a faate pawl cu a bawipa ih ta an si pei ih amah lawng a luat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a salpa in, ‘Ka bawipa, ka nupi le ka faate pawl ka duh hai a si, luat ka duh lo,’ a ti ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a bawipa in Pathian hnenah a hruai pei ih sangka ah, a si lole sangka tunrel ah a fehpi hnuah a hna a vit pei. Cuticun kumkhua-in a salah a cangta pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in a fanu salih a zuar a si ahcun mipa vekin nunau cu a luat thei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nupi ih tuah a tumtu a bawipa ih thinlung a nomter lo a si ahcun a pa in a tlen sal thei ding. A bawipa in mi phundang hnenah a zuar thei lo pei, ziangahtile cumi cu thil mawi lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain salah a lei naón a fapa nupi dingih a tum a si ahcun a fanu tlukah a ruat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun nupi ih a neih hnuah nupi dang a ṭhit sal a si khalle a nupi hlun cu a hlan vek thotho in rawl le hnipuan le nupi a sinak covo cu a ngah thotho pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thil phunthum a pek thei lo asile zianghman kuan ṭul loin a luat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Midang a thawithattu cu thah an si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain thah hrim si loin tuahmawh pang mi asile nan hrangih ka hrilmi hmunah a tlan pei ih cunah a relh thei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla mi pakhat in thin heng in midang a that hrim asile ka biakṭheng ah him duhih a relh hmanah nan diirsuak pei ih nan that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mah ih nu a si lole, mah ih pa, a vuatu cu thah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in midang pakhat kha zuar dingah siseh, salih ret dingah siseh, a duh lo cingin a ruk ih a tlanpihlo asile cupa cu thah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mah ih nu a si lole, mah ih pa, a camtu cu thah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mi pahnih an sual-aw ih pakhat in pakhat pa kha lungto in a sut, a si lole a kuttum in a thong ih a tuahmawh naón a thi lo a si ahcun a thawitu pa cu hrem a tuar lo pei. Asinain a thawi mipa cu tho thei loin hmun a to ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a dam hnuah kianghrol hman ṭul a si ahcun a hmunto sung a nihlawh a kuan pei ih a dam ngah hlan lo a kilkhawi pei ih a bawm pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in a salnu a si lole a salpa kha funghreu in a vuak ih hmakhatte-ah a thi asile a vuatu cu hremnak a tuar pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain a sal cu ni khat ni hnih a nun a si ahcun a bawipa cu cawhkuan a tong lo pei. Ziangahtile a sal cu a thilri a si ih a thilri a sun cu a mawitawk cawhkuan a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi an sual-aw ih nunau favun an tuahmawh ih amah a thi lo naón a fa a siat asile a tuahmawhtu pa in nunau nu-ih pasal ih ngen zat, thureltu pawl ih an rel hnuah a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain nunau nu cu tuahmawhnak a tong ih a thi asile nunnak cu nunnak in kuan a si pei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mit cu mit in, ha cu ha in, kut cu kut in, ke cu ke in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ur cu ur in, hriamhma cu hriamhma in, vunpilh cu vunpilh in kuan a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in a salnu a si lole a salpa a mit ah a vuak ih a mit a cawt asile a mit manah a sal cu a luatter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ha a beuhter asile a ha manah a sal cu a luatter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Cawcang in nunau a si lole mipa pakhat a khik that a si ahcun cawcang cu lungto in den that a si pei ih a sa cu ei a si lo pei. Asinain caw neitupa cu cawhkuannak a tuar lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cuih caw cu a heezet ih mi khal a zon ṭheu hrangah a neitupa cu an sim cia zo naón khum loin a thlah men ih nunau a si lole mipa a khik that a si ahcun, acuih caw cu lungto in den that a si pei ih, a neitu khal thah a si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asinain that loin cawhkuan ding sawnin an rel a si ahcun a nunnak tlen dingah an cawh zat cu a kuan thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun cawcang in suakthuan tualleng, nunau khal siseh, mipa khal siseh, a khik that asile a tlunih daan thotho hi thlun a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Salnu a si lole salpa a khik that asile caw neitu in sal neitu hnenah ngun tangka sawmthum a kuan pei ih cawcang cu lungto in den that a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in khur a lai ih a khuh a tuah lo ruangah a si lole a khur cu a khuh a on ta ruangah, cawcang a si lole laak a tlak asile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />acuih ṭilva man cu a kuan pei. Ṭilva neituih hnenah paisa a pek pei ih a thimi ṭilva sa cu amah in a co pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi pakhat ih cawcang in midang cawcang a khik that asile an pahnih in a nungmi cawcang cu an zuar pei ih a man an ṭhen aw pei. A thimi cawcang ih sa khal an ṭhen aw pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cawcang cu a heezet ih mi khal a zon ṭheu ti theih asinain a neitu pa in a khum lo a si ahcun a kuan pei; a nungmi cawcang cu a thimi cawcang ai-ah a pek pei ih a thimi cawcang cu amah in a co pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in cawcang a si lole tuu a ruk ih a that, a si lole a zuar a si ahcun, cawcang pakhat ai-ah cawcang panga in a kuan pei; tuu pakhat ai-ah tuu pali in a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuticun a ruk man cu a kuan hrimhrim pei. Zianghman a nei lo asile a rukmi kuannakah amah cu zuar a si pei. Asinain a rukmi cawcang, a si lole laak, a si lole tuu cu a hnenah a nung in an hmuh asile a lethnih in a kuan pei. “Rukru pakhat cu zanah inn a bauh ih an kai ih an that asile a thattu cu laithat asilo. Asinain nisuah hnu ih a thah a si ahcun laithat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in lo ah siseh, sabit hmuan ah siseh, a ṭilva pawl hrampi a eiter laiah an hri a suut ih midang lo an ei thluh asile ṭilva neitupa cun a lo ṭha bik asilole a sabit hmuan ṭha bik in a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in meisa a ur ih hrampi khal a kang hnuah rawl khawlmi pawl le rawl kung pawl, a si lole lo sungih thingkung ciinmi pawl a kang thluh a si ahcun meisa a urtu in a siatsuah mi hmuahhmuah a kuan thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in midang hnenah paisa siseh, a dang thil mankhung siseh, a retter ih mi in an ruk sak asile a rutu an kai a si ahcun a lethnih in a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun a rutu an kai lo a si ahcun a ret saktu cun a rualpa ih thilri a lak lonak kha puang dingin Pathian hmaiah siat a cam-aw pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mi pahnih thilri an cuh-aw ih cawcang siseh, laak le tuu siseh, hnipuan a si lole a hlomi thildang pakhatkhat ka ta a si an ti veve a si ahcun an thu cu Pathian hmaiah suahpi a si pei. Pathian ih mawh a pekmi in a lethnih in a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in midang pakhat hnenah laak, caw, tuu, a si lole ṭilva dang pakhatkhat a kilkhawiter ih, a ṭilva cu a thi, a si lole a tuahmawh aw, a si lole rukru in an tlanpi ih zohman a hmutu an um lo a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa hmaiih siatcamnak in a rualpi ih ṭilva a lak le lak lo a hliah-aw pei. Rukru ih lakmi a si lo ahcun a kilkhawitu in a kuan lo pei. A neitu cu a sung ko pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla acuih ṭilva cu an ruk a si ahcun a kilkhawitu in a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sahrang in a deh asile a sa hlahmi kha tetti-ah a rak keng pei. Sahrang ih dehmi cu a kuan a ṭul lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mi pakhat in midang ih ṭilva a saang ih a neitu um lo sungah a thi, asilole a tuahmawh-aw a si ahcun, a saangtu in a kuan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a neitu a um a si ahcun a kuan lo pei. Man nei ih saan mi ṭilva asile a saanman lawng kimtein a pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Fala himte mi ih ham hrih lomi, mi pakhat in a thlem ih a sualpi asile a man hmuahhmuah a pe thluh pei ih a ṭhi pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a ṭhit ding cu a fala ih pa in a lung a kim lo asile fala ih man zat cu paisa in a pek thotho pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Dawithiam nunau cu nan nunter lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ṭilva a sualpitu milai cu thah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ Bawipa Pathian hnen siar lo, a dang khawzing hnenih thawinak a petu cu thah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ramdang mi mikhual cu nan tuahsia lo pei ih nan zonzaihter lo pei. Ziangahtile nannih khal Izipt ram ah ramdang mi mikhual nan rak si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nuhmei siseh, nupa nei lo ngakṭah siseh, nan tuahsia lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nan tuahsiat asile bomnak dilin ka hnenih an au tikah an aw ka thei ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka thinhengnak cu meisa bangtuk in a alh pei ih, doral ah ralnam in ka lo that ding. Nan nupi pawl cu nuhmei ah an cang pei ih nan faale pawl ngakṭah ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nannih in ka minung pawl sung mifarah hnenih paisa nan coih tikah paisa coihtu pawl ih an tuah ṭheu bangtuk in nan tuah lo pei ih paisa ṭhang khal nan lak lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lo rulhnak dingih kam awknak ah a puan nan lak sak asile nitlak hlanah nan khirh sal tengteng pei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ziangahtile a sin dingmi cu cumite lawng a si. Culole ziangso a sin ding? Bomnak dilin ka hnenih a au asile a aw cu ka thei ding; ziangahtile kei cu mi zaangfahtu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Pathian nan thangsiat lo pei ih nan miphun hotu khal nan cam lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Nan rawl, nan sabitti le nan olif hriak pawl cu ka hnenih pek dingah nan nuar lo pei. “Nan fapa upa bik cu ka hnenah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nan caw siseh, nan tuu siseh, an hrin hmaisa bikmi cu ka hnenah nan pek pei. An fatir cu a nuih hnenah ni sarih a um pei ih, ni riat ni-ah ka hnenah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Nannih cu ka hrangah mithiang nan si ding; curuangah hramlakih sahrang ih dehmi saseh cu nan ei lo pei. Uico nan pek sawn pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“A dik lomi thu nan than lo pei. A mawhmi ṭan duh ah a dik lomi thu va sim hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thilsual tuah dingah mi tam deuh va thlun cuang hlah. Tazacuainak ih thurelnak ah mi tamsawn ih lungkimnak tuah duh ah a dik lomi thu va sim hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi farah pa ih thu rel a si tikah a farah ruangah va ṭan cuang hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na ral ih cawcang asilole laak a tlanmi na hmu a si ahcun a hnenah na hruai kir sal pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A rang khal a thilrit ruangah a bok a si ahcun fehsan in na taanta lo pei; a rang cu na thawh bawm pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nan lakih farah nauta-ih thu nan relsak tikah nan namnuai lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A dik loih midang sualpuh cu nan hrial pei. Mawhnak a nei lomi cu nan that lo pei. A thattu an um asile ka zuah hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nawhthuh nan lak lo pei; ziangahtile nawhthuh a eitu cun, a nawhthuh eimi in a mit a cawtter ruangah, thudik a hmu thei nawn lo ih mawhnak a nei lomi ih lamzin khal a pitter thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ramdang mikhual nan tuahsia lo pei; nannih khal Izipt ramah ramdang mikhual nan rak si zo ih mikhual si cu ziangvek a si ti nan thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kum ruk sung nan lo ah thlaici nan tuh pei ih a suakmi cu nan khawm pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain kum sarihnak cu nan colhter pei ih lo sungih a khomi zianghman nan khawm lo pei. Lo sungih a khomi a um asile nanmah lakih mifarah pawl in an khawm pei ih a taangmi cu ramsa pawl in ei men hai seh. Cubangtuk thothoin nan sabit hmuan le nan olif hmuan khal nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ni ruk sung hna nan ṭuan pei ih ni sarih ni cu hna ṭuan loin nan cawl pei. Cuticun nan caw le nan rang khal an cawl pei ih, nan hnen-um le nan mikhual khal thazaang thar an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nan hnenih ka simmi hmuahhmuah hi ngai uh. Khawzing dang pawl ih hmin a sal khal sal hlah uh; an hnenah thla khal cam hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Kum khat sungah keimah upatnak ah puai pathum nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thilnu Tello Sang Puai nan tuah pei. Ka lo sim zo vekin ni ka lo tinmi Abib thla ah ni sarih sung thilnu tel lo sang nan ei pei; ziangahtile cuih thla ah Izipt ram ihsin nan suak a si. Kut lawngin ka hnenah zohman nan ra lo pei. Kutken thawn keimah bia dingah nan ra pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nan lo sungih nan tuhmi thlaikho a cut ih hmasa bik nan lak tikah Thlaithar Puai nan tuah pei. “Cule kum a cem ih nan sabit hmuan le nan lo ihsin thingrah pawl nan khawm tikah Rawlkhawm Puai nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nanmah lakih mipa hmuahhmuah cu kum khatah voithum, hi puai caan ah, keimah Bawipa nan Pathian hmaiah nan ra pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka hnenah thawinak nan tuah ih ṭilva in pek tikah thilnu rawimi sang nan hmang lo pei. Ka hrangih nan tuahmi puai ih nan thahmi ṭilva ih thau pawl cu a thaizing tiang nan taangter lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Nan lo ihsin nan lakmi rawl thar a ṭha bik pawl cu Bawipa nan Pathian ih inn sungah nan rak keng pei. “Tuu faate cu a nuih hnawiti in nan suang lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nan lamtluanih a lo kilvengtu ding le nan hrangih ka timtuah zomi ramih a lo hruaitu dingah nan hmaiah vancungmi pakhat ka thlah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah cu nan upat pei ih a simmi thu cu ngai in nan thlun pei. Amah cu kan duh lo tiin nan ralsan lo pei, ziangahtile ka hmin in hna a ṭuan a si. Nan ralsan pang asile a lo ngaidam hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a thu nan ngai ih ka simmi hmuahhmuah nan tuah asile nan ral pawl cu ka do ding ih a lo raltu cu ka ral ve ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka vancungmi cu nan hmaiah a feh pei ih Amor mi, Hit mi, Periz mi, Kanaan mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi pawl ih ramah a lo hruai ding a si. Cuih mi pawl cu keimah in ka siatsuah thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih mi pawl ih khawzing pawl cu nan biak lo pei ih an hmaiah nan lu khal nan kun lo pei. Himi pawl ih tuahdan vekin nan tuah lo pei. An khawzing pawl cu nan siatsuah thluh pei ih an khawhrum pawl cu nan khuaibal thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nannih cu Bawipa nan Pathian nan biak pei; rawl le tidai in ka lo thlawsuah ding ih nan hnen ihsin natnak cu ka laakhlo ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih nan ram ahcun nunau in nausiat ti an nei lo ding ih nucing ti khal an um lo ding. Nan san ka sauter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“A lo dodaltu pawl cu keimah in ṭihnak dingah an parah hna ka ṭuan ding. A lo dotu pawl lakah buainak ka thlengter ding ih nan ral pawl cu dunglamah siip tahratin ka tlanter thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan hmaiah ṭihnungza khuai-ngal pawl ka thlah pei ih Hiv mi, Kanaan mi le Hit mi pawl cu nan thlen hlanah an rak dawitlan thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum khat sungah ka dawi thluh lo ding, ziangahtile ramṭhingah a cang pang ding ih ramsa pawl tla an karhzai pei ih nan hrangah an tamtuk pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nan tam deuhdeuh ih ram pumpi nan lak ṭheh thei hlan lo, maltete in ka dawi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nan ramri cu Tipi Sen ihsin Mediterranean tifinriat tiang ka kauter ding ih thlanglam nelrawn ihsin Eufrates tiva tiang ka sauter ding. Cuih ram sungih a ummi minung pawl ih tlunah huham ka lo neiter ding ih nan dawisuak thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anmah thawn siseh, an khawzing pawl thawn siseh, lungkimnak nan tuah lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nan ram sungah nan umter hai lo pei; nan umter asile ka parah sualnak an lo tuahter ding. An khawzing pawl nan biak asile a lo thlemsiat tengteng ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Tlang parah Aaron, Nadab le Abihu le Israel mi hruaitu sawmsarih thawn ka hnenah ra uhla a hlat nawn in nan lu kunin in ra bia uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses nangmah lawng ka kiangah na ra pei. Midang pawl cu in ra naih hlah hai seh; misenpi pawl cu tlangpar hmanah an ra kai lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses cu misenpi hnenah a feh ih Bawipa ih thupekmi le daan pekmi hmuahhmuah cu an hnenah a sim. Cutikah misenpi in, “ Bawipa ih simmi hmuahhmuah cu kan tuah ṭheh ding,” tiah hmun khatte-ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih thupekmi pawl Moses in a ngan ṭheh. A thaizing zingpitte-ah acuih tlang hramah Moses in biakṭheng a don ih Israel miphun hleihnih hrangah rolung hleihnih a phun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun mei-ur thawinak a pek ih Bawipa ih hnenah thawinak pekmi cawcang pawl a thattu Israel mino pawl cu pawlkom thawinak tuah dingah Moses in a fehter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in caw thisen a hrek cu a lak ih kheng sungah a ret ih a hrek cu biakṭheng parah a theh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun thukam cazual cu a lak ih zapi theih in misenpi hnenah a siar. Misenpi in, “ Bawipa ih thupekmi hmuahhmuah cu kan tuah ṭheh ding ih a thu kan ngai ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in kheng sungih thisen cu a lak ih misenpi parah a theh ih, “Hi thisen cu Bawipa in nanmah thawn thukamnak a tuah ih a thupekmi hmuahhmuah nemhngetnak thisen a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Moses, Aaron, Nadab, Abihu le Israel mi hruaitu sawm sarih cu tlang parah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ih Pathian cu an hmu. A ke hnuai ahcun a thian tukah van fiim a bang kelkelmi mepian lungvarih phahmi lungphah bangtuk a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi hruaitu pawl in Pathian an hmu naón hlohralnak an tong lo; cutawkah hmun khatah an ei an in tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Tlang parah ka hnenah ra kai awla hitawk ih na ra um sungah Israel mi thuzirhnak dingih ka ngan ciami thukham le daan pawl cu lungpher in ka lo pe ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah Moses le a bawmtu Joshua cu an tim an tuah hnuah Moses cu tlang thianghlim parah cun a hung kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “Kan ra kirsal hlan lo hitawk ihsin in rak hngak uh. Aaron le Hur cu nan hnenah an um ih thupoi a um asile anmah nan rak tong pei,” tiah Israel mi hruaitu pawl hnenah a cahta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses cu tlang parah a hung kai ih tlang cu mero in a tuam leihleih ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih sunlawinak cu tlang parah a rung thleng ih cu ruangah mero in tlang cu ni ruk sung a khuh. Ni sarih ni-ah Pathian in mero sung ihsin Moses cu a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hrangah cun Bawipa ih sunlawinak cu tlangpar ih meisa a kaanghliau reromi a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuticun Moses cu tlangpar mero sungah ni sawmli le zan sawmli a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka hrangah thawhlawm an peknak dingah Israel mi pawl sim aw. Ka hrangih pek a duhtu hmuahhmuah hnen ihsin thawhlawm cu na rak saang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na saan dingmi thawhlawm pawl cu sui, ngun, daar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a mepianmi le a sen-uai le a senmi tuuhmul puan, puan neem le mehmulih tuahmi hnipuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a senih buhmi tuucang phaw, saphaw phun ṭha a neemmi le lawithing;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mei-inn hrangah zinan le hnih dingah hriak le a rim hmuimi ur dingah zihmui;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />puithiam pawl in an ṭaangthlaih le an ṭaangben parih an ret dingmi lungvar sen le lungvar dangdang tla an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in ka umnak hrangah inn an sak pei ih anmah lakah ka um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka inn nan sak dingmi cu ka lo hmuh dingmi vekin a innruang le a sungih thilri pawl cu an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Lawithing in kuang an tuah pei ih dong hnih le hrek a sau pei, dong khat le hrek a kau pei ih dong khat le hrek a sang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sungah siseh, a lengin siseh, sui hlir in nan khuut pei ih a tlang kimvel cu suipheeng in nan vel pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sui kual pali nan tuah pei ih khat lamah pahnih veve in a ke pali ah nan bun pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lawithing in zawnfung nan tuah pei ih sui in nan khuut pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A putnak ah zawnfung cu thingkuang ke-ih sui kual sungah a kap le a kapah nan hrolh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi zawnfung pawl cu sui kual sungah taan ding a si ih lak ding a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun cuih kuang sungah cun ka lo pek dingmi thukham ngannak lungpheng pahnih cu nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A sin cu sui hlir in nan tuah pei ih dong hnih le hrek sau le dong khat le hrek kau a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sinih khatlam le khatlam zim veve-ah sui ih sermi cherub timi thlanei ramsa lem pahnih nan tuah pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />zim khatah pakhat ciar nan ret pei. A dangte in si loin a sin thawn an peh-aw thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cherub pahnih cu a tlunah an thla an pharh pei ih kuangsin cu an thla in an khuh pei. Cherub pahnih cu an hawih aw pei ih kuangsin cu an zoh veve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kuang parah a sin cu nan ret pei ih kuang sungah cun ka lo pek dingmi thukham ngannak lungpheng pahnih nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutawkah ka lo tong ding a si; kuangsin tlun le kuang parih a ummi cherub pahnih karlak in Israel mi pawl ih hrangah ka thukham hmuahhmuah ka lo pe ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Lawithing in cabuai pakhat nan tuah pei ih dong hnih sau, dong khat kau le dong khat le hrek sang a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih cabuai cu sui hlir in nan khuut pei ih a kimvel sui in nan vel pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tlangkap cu zungpibok pathum kau in nan tuah pei ih sui thotho in nan khuut pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sui kual pali in nan tuah pei ih a ke umnak kil li-ah nan bun pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih sui kual pali cu cabuai putnak zawnfung a kaitu an si pei ih cabuai ih tlangkap ah nan bun pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zawnfung pawl cu lawithing in nan tuah pei ih sui in nan khuut pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule inmi thawinak hrangah pakan, hai, khuat le kheng pawl nan tuah pei. Sui hlir in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka hrangih nan hunmi sang thiang cu cabuai parah nan ret ringring pei ih cuih cabuai cu Thukam Kuang hmaiah nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Sui in meivannak fung nan tuah pei. A tawphah le a fung pawl cu sermi sui in nan tuah pei ih a mawitertu pangpar pawl, a mum le a par tla cu a fung thawn an peh-aw thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A fung ihsin ṭeek paruk a kho pei ih kap khatah ṭeek thum veve an um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ṭeek hmuahhmuah ah kulhṭhuang par bangin a mum le a par thawn, a mawitertu pangpar par thum ciar an um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A fungah kulhṭhuang par bangin a mum le a par thawn, a mawitertu pangpar pali an um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ṭeek khuah thumih hnuai ciarah pangpar mum pakhat fingfing a um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A mum le a ṭeek pawl tla cu a fung thawn an peh-aw thluh pei; sermi sui hlir pakhat in tuah ṭheh a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih meivannak fung pakhat parah mei pasarih nan vang pei ih a hmailam tleu dingin nan vang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Caiceh le darkheng pawl khal sui hlir in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hi meivannak fung le a thilri hmuahhmuah pawl tuahnak ah sui pawng zakhat nan hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tlang parih ka lo hmuhmi innruang vek cekci in feltein nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka umnak dingah Puanthlam, coihcinmawi puanṭha mankhung, mepian, sendup le a senmi puan zun hra in nan sak pei. Hi puan pawl cu cherub timi thlanei ramsa lem cuangin mawizetih ṭelhmi puan an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puan pawl cu a saulam kaih hleili le a kauhlam kaih hnih ciar an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zun nga cu nan pehkhawm pei ih a dang zun nga khal nan pehkhawm thotho pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutiih nan pehkhawmmi puan tlunta bikih zimah mepian puan in a beu pawl nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puan pehmi pakhatnak ah beu sawmnga nan tuah pei ih a pahnihnak puan pehmi khalah beu sawmnga in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puanthlam cu umnak pakhat ih cang dingin puan awknak kual sawmnga sui in nan tuah pei ih cumi thawn puan thuah hnih cu nan peh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hi Puanthlam khuhnakah mehmul in puan zun hleikhat nan tah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zun khat cu kaih hleinga a sau pei ih kaih hnih a kau pei ih an zatein an tia-aw thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zun nga kha zun khat cang dingin nan peh pei ih a dang zun ruk khal zunkhat kim ve dingin nan peh pei. A zun ruknak cu Puanthlam ih hmailamah bil hnih ah nan bil pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nan pehmi puan khatlam zimah puan beu sawmnga nan tuah pei ih a dang pehmi puanzim khalah beu sawmnga thotho nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puan awh-nak sawmnga dar in nan tuah pei ih Puanthlam pakhat ih cang dingin nan peh ciami puan pahnih cu cuih daar cun nan awk pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puanthlam parih a thlai aw mi puan a hrek cu Puanthlam ih dunglam ah a thlai aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puanthlam a sau zawng ih a thlai awmi puan hleimi kaih hrek veve cu Puanthlam khuhtu-ah a sir ah an thlai-aw pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Puanthlam khuhnak dingah a senih buhmi tuucang phaw le acuih par a lenglamih khuh dingah saphaw ṭha nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hi puanthlam ih phar cu a tung zawng in nan song pei ih lawithing in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Phar cu tlepkhat ah dong hra a sau pei ih dong khat le hrek ciar an kau ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a pehkomnak ah a kap ciar kha nan khuar pei. Phar a zatein cutiin nan tuah thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi phar pawl nan tuah tikah thlanglam phar hrangah tlep kul nan tuah pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an tawdam cu ngunih tuahmi tawdam sawmli nan ret pei. Nan khuarnak zawn ihsin a hun dotu-ah phar pakhat ah ngun tawdam pahnih fingfing nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saklam phar hrangah tlep kul nan tuah pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />phar pakhat hrangah tawdam pahnih ciar in ngun tawdam sawmli nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nitlaknaklam, Puanthlam dunglam phar hrangah cun phar tlep ruk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlam dunglam kil hrangah phar tlep hnih nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlamkil pahnih ih phar pahnih cu a tawlam ihsin a luziik tiangin an peh-aw thluh pei. Phar kil pahnih ih phar tlep hnih cu a cutiih tuahmi an si thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuhrangah phar tlep riat a um pei ih pakhat hnuai ah ngun tawdam pahnih ciar in ngun tawdam hleiruk an um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Lawithing in phartlang nan tuah pei ih siir khatah phartlang panga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a dang siir khatah phartlang panga le dunglam nitlaknak lam sir ah phartlang panga nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Phar laifang zawnih phartlang cu kil khat ihsin kil khat tiang a saumi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sui kual pawl nan tuah pei ih phar parah nan bun pei. Phartlang pawl cu acuih suikual sungah nan hrolh pei. Phar siseh, phartlang siseh, sui in nan khuut pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tlang parih ka lo hmuhmi vekin puanthlam cu nan sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Coihcinmawi puan mankhung le mepian, a sen le a sendupmi tuuhmul in puanzar pawl cu nan tuah pei. A cuih puanzar pawl cu cherub timi thlanei ramsa lem mawizetih ṭelhmi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngun tawdam pali ihsin a ding ih sui ih khuutmi lawiṭhuam pali parah suikual in puanzar pawl cu nan thlai pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanthlam khuhnak thawn a peh awmi puan awh-nak ihsin puanzar cu nan thlai pei. Cuih puanzar phenah lungpheng pahnih retnak Thukam Kuang cu nan ret pei. Puanzar cu Hmun Thiang le Hmun Thiang Bik dangtu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hmun Thiang Bikih a ummi Thukam Kuang cu a sin nan sin pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puanzar ih lengah cabuai nan ret pei. Cuih cabuai cu saklam kapah nan ret pei ih meivannak fung cu thlanglam kapah cabuai ralden ah nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Puanthlam ih hmailam khalah puanzar nan tuah pei ih mepian, a sen, le a sendupmi puan, coihcinmawi puan mankhung in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih puanzar hrangah sui in khuutmi lawiṭhuam panga nan tuah pei ih sui ih tuahmi puan awh-nak in nan awk pei. Cuih lawiṭhuam hrangah daarih tuahmi tawdam panga nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Biakṭheng cu lawithing in nan don pei ih a saulam le a kauhlam a can awmi a si pei. Pi sarih le hrek a saumi le a kaumi, pi li le hrek a saangmi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kil li ah thingzum pali nan bun pei ih a biakṭheng thawn an peh-aw thluh ding. A zatein daar in nan tuam pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biakṭheng ih sahriak le vutcam laknak ah, cawhleek, kheng, thil awh-nak le beel pawl nan tuah pei ih biakṭheng thilri cu a zatein daar in nan tuah thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule biakṭheng hrang thotho ah daar in sur nan tuah pei. Cuih daar sur kil li ah darkual pali nan thlaih pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />biakṭheng a saannak ih hrek tiang a thlennak dingah darkual cu biakṭheng ih zim hnuai ah nan thlaih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Biakṭheng hrangah lawithing in zawnfung pawl nan tuah pei ih daar in nan tuam pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakṭheng nan zawn tikah biakṭheng siirih a ummi darkual ah zawnfung pawl cu nan hrolh ṭheu pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biakṭheng cu a sungah thingpheng in a kua nan tuah pei. Tlang parih ka lo hmuhmi innruang vekin nan tuah thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hi ka umnak Puanthlam hrangah tualrawn nan tuah pei. Thlanglam kapah kaih 50 sau puanṭha mankhungih phiarmi puanzar nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A cuih puanzar cu daar tawdam a neimi darṭhuam ṭhuam kul ah nan thlai pei ih acuih ṭhuam pawl ih parah a bannak le ngunih tuahmi a tlangkham pawl an um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuvek thothoin saklam kapih puanzar cu kaih sawmnga saumi a si pei ih daar tawdam a neimi darṭhuam ṭhuam kul ah nan thlai pei. A cuih ṭhuam pawl ih parah a bannak le ngunih tuahmi a tlangkham pawl an um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitlaknaklam, a kauhlam kulhnak dingah cun kaih kul hluannga a saumi puanzar in ṭhuam pahra le tawdam pahra thawn nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nisuahnaklam, sangka a umnak lamih a kulhnak cu kaih kul hluannga a kau pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A luhnak ihsin khatlam kapih puanzar cu kaih sarih le a hrek a kaumi, ṭhuam pathum le a tawdam pathum nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule a dang khatlam kapih zaarmi puanzar khal kaih sarih le a hrek kaumi, ṭhuam pathum le a tawdam pathum in a si ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A luhnak sangka puanzar cu mepian, a sen le a sendup, tuuhmul le coihcinmawi puan mankhung, kaih hra sau in nan tuah pei. Cuih puanzar cu tawdam pali ihsin a dingmi ṭhuam pali parah nan thlai pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kulhnak hrangih ṭhuam hmuahhmuah cu ngunih tuahmi ṭhuam tlang in a peh thluh pei ih ṭhuamtlang bannak pawl cu ngunih tuahmi an si pei. Ṭhuam tawdam pawl cu daarih tuahmi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi kulhnak cu kaih sawmnga sau, kaih kul hluannga kau le kaih hnih le hrek sang a si pei. Puanzar pawl cu patphiar ih tahmi puan mankhung an si pei. Ṭhuam tawdam pawl cu daarih tuahmi an si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian umnak Puanthlam sungih hmanmi thilri hmuahhmuah, ziangih hman an si khalle, Puanthlam le a kulhnakih thil bannak hmuahhmuah tiangin daar in tuahmi an si thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl kha an olif hriak ṭha bik rak keng dingin thu pe awla, cule mei-inn cu cat loin a vang ringring thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in a minung pawl a tonnak Puanthlam sung, Thukam Kuang an retnak hmai zawnih puanzar lenglamah acuih mei-inn cu Aaron le a fapa pawl in an ret pei. Cutawkah Bawipa ih hmaika-ah zanlam ihsin zinglam tiang mei-inn cu an vangter pei. Hi thupekmi cu Israel mi pawl le an tesinfa pawl in a kumkhua-in an thlun dingmi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka hrangih puithiam an ṭuannak dingah Israel mi lakin na u Aaron le a fapa Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar pawl cu na hnenah ko aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na u Aaron kha mawinak le zohso a co theinak dingin hnipuan thianghlim na tuahsak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thiamnak ka pekmi zungthiam pawl ko awla ka hrangih puithiam thianghlim hna a ṭuan theinak dingah Aaron ih hnipuan pawl tuahter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An tuah dingmi a hnipuan pawl cu ṭaangben pakhat, ṭaangthlaih pakhat, angki fual pakhat, coihcinmawi ṭelhmi angki leng pakhat, lupawng pakhat le taikhap pakhat an si ding. Na u Aaron le a fapa pawl in ka hrangih puithiam an ṭuannak dingah kutzungthiam pawl in cuih hnipuan thiang pawl cu an tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutiih an tuah tikah sui siseh, mepian le a sendup mi le a sen mi tuuhmul le puan mankhung pawl tla siseh an hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ṭaangthlaih angki cu, sui le mepian, a sen le sendup tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung le coihcinmawi puan in an tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A liangah ṭemnak dingah hri pahnih a um pei ih, a siir veve-ah ṭemcih a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mawizet ih tahmi taikhap cu a ṭemnak hri pahnih thawn an peh aw pei ih an tuah daan khal a bangrep thluh ding. Taikhap cu sui le mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung thotho in tuahmi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungmankhung a senmi pahnih la awla a parah Jakob ih fapa hleihnih hmin kher in nan ngan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An kum vekin a sangsangin lungmankhung sen pakhat ah hmin ruk, a dang parah a dang hmin ruk nan kher pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungmankhung lamih kutzungthiam mi le hmin khennak a tuah thiamtu pawl ih bomnak thawn Jakob ih fapa hleihnih hmin pawl cu lung mankhung pahnih parah cun nan kher pei ih lungmankhung pawl cu sui in a tlang nan khap pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mi phun hleihnih theih ringringnak dingah sunghruk angki ih liangbat hri pawl ih parah cun lungmankhung pawl cu nan ben pei. Cuticun an hmin pawl cu Aaron in a liang parah a keng ringring pei ih Bawipa in anmah tla cu a ciing ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sui tlangkap pahnih le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hridai vekih merhmi sui hrihrual pahnih tuah uhla, sui hrihrual cu sui tlangkap ah nan ngerh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Cun Pathian duhnak theihtheinak dingah ṭaangben nan tuah pei. Sunghruk angki vek thotho in ṭhateih ṭelhmi a si pei. Sui le mepian sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zungpibok pakua kau le bok kua sau, a tung le a vang a can awmi a si pei ih bil hnih ih bilmi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A parah lungmankhung tlar li-in nan ben pei; tlar khatnak ah a sen, mepian le sendup nan ben pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlar hnihnak ah tangphaw, a pawlmi le daimon lungvar mankhung;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tlar thumnak ah sendup, a sen le a engmi lungmankhung;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tlar linak ah tangphaw, sendup le a varmi lungmankhung nan ben pei. Hi lungmankhung pawl cu sui in a kimvel in nan tuam pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungmankhung hleihnih nan ret pei ih, Jakob fapa pawl ih hmin an parah nan khen ciar pei. Cuih an hmin pawl cu fiangtein nan khen pei ih pakhat parah Israel phun ih hmin pakhat ciar nan ngan pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭaangben hrangah hrihrual bangtuk in a hrual awmi sui hlir in suiṭhi nan tuah pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ṭaangben tlunlam kil veve ih ben dingah suikual pahnih nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih sui hrihrual pahnih cu suikual pahnih parah nan khit pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A cuih sui hrihrual ih khatlam zim pahnih cu lungmankhung benmi parah nan khit pei. Cubangtuk in sunghruk angki ih hmailam liangbah parah nan hei khit pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun sui kual pahnih nan tuah pei ih ṭaangben ih thuailam kiil, ṭaangthlaih sangtu a sunglam zimah nan sih veve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sui kual dang pahnih nan tuah hrih pei ih ṭaangthlaih angki ih hmailam liangbah thuailam ah nan hun khit pei ih ṭhazet ih tahmi, taikhap ih tlunah nan vun sih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ṭaangben ih kual pawl cu ṭaangthlaih angki ih kual pawl thawn mepian hrihrual in nan ṭawnkom pei ih cuticun ṭaangben cu taikhap ih tlunah seep puakpo loin a bek thlepthli ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Aaron kha Hmun Thianghlim ih a luh tikah Israel miphun pawl ih hmin cu a ṭaang parih a ummi thurelcatnak ṭaangben parah a kher aw ding a si ruangah Bawipa keimah in anmah kha ka ciing ringring ding. Cuih ṭaangben cu Aaron ih lung zawn ah a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Urim le Thummim timi lung thianghlim kha thurelnak ṭaangben ih sungah nan ret pei ih Aaron kha Bawipa ih hmaika ih a luh tikah a ṭaangah an um ding. Cuvek caanah a ṭaangben kha a hruk ringring pei ih cutiin Israel mi phun hrangih ka duh sakmi kha a thei thei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Sunghruk angki lengih hrukmi angki fualpi cu tuuhmul mepian hlir in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Angki fualpi ih laifangah lu hrolhnak dingah a ong nan tuah pei. Cuih ongih kimvel cu savun angki nan tuah bangtuk in tlek lo dingin a tlang nan khul pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih angki ih thuailam zim cu tuuhmul mepian, sendup le a sen in tale rah cuangin nan ṭelh pei. Angki ih kimvel ah cubangtuk in nan ṭelh pei ih nan ṭelhmi ih karlakah sui khingte nan thlaih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cubangtuk in angki fualpi ih thuailam zim kimvel a zatein tale rah zuk ṭelhmi le sui khingte thlaihmi an um ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aaron cu puithiam hna a ṭuan tinte in cuih angki cu a hruk ringring pei. Bawipa ih hmaika, hmun thianghlim sungih a luh le a suah tinte in khingte awn selso cu theih a si ding ih Aaron cu thihter a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Sui hlirih tuahmi calben nan tuah pei ih a parah, ‘ Bawipa ih hrangih a thiangmi,’ tiin nan kher pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuih calben cu lupawng hmailamah mepian hridai in nan thlaih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aaron in a cal ah a ben pei ih, cubangtuk in Israel mi pawl in Bawipa hnenih an pekmi parah soiselnak a um lo ding. An pekmi pawl kha Bawipa ih saantlak a sinak dingah acuih calben cu Aaron in a cal ah a ben ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Pat mankhung thawn Aaron angki le a lupawng nan tah pei ih a taikhap cu coihcinmawi puan mankhung in nan tah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Aaron ih fapa pawl hrangah mawinak le zohso an conak dingin angki, taaiṭemnak le lukhum pawl tla nan tuah sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cuih hnipuan pawl cu Aaron le a fapa pawl nan hrukter pei. Cuṭheh in ka hnaṭuantu puithiam si dingah pumpeknak le Pathian hnenih hlannak thawn hriak nan culh hai pei ih cuticun puithiam ah an cang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An taksa lang lo dingah an taai le an kawng hup thei dingin bawngbi tawi nan ṭhit sak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa pawl in puithiam hna ṭuan dingin Hmun Thianghlim sungih an luh ah siseh, tonkhawmnak thlam sungih biakṭheng an pan tikah siseh, an zahmawh a langlonak dingah le thihter an si lonak dingah cuih bawngbi tawite cu an hruk ṭheu pei. Himi hi Aaron le a tesinfa pawl ih hrangah an thlun ringring dingmi daan a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aaron le a fapa pawl cu ka hrangih puithiam ṭuan dingih an pum an pek tikah hi bangtuk in nan tuah pei. Raitluan cawcang no pakhat le tuucang pahnih nan lak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule thilnu tel lomi sang, thilnu tel lo le siti ih tuahmi sangfun le thilnu tel lo le siti ih tuahmi sangpheng khal nan lak pei. Hi sang pawl cu a ṭha zetmi sangvut in nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kho sungah nan ret pei ih cawcang le tuucang pahnih nan thah tikah kho sungih sang cu ka hnenah in pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Keimah ka umnak Puanthlam sangka-ah Aaron le a fapa pawl kha rak hruai uhla kholh aw hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun sunghruk angki, a tlunih hrukmi angki fualpi, ṭaangthlaih, ṭaangben le taikhap pawl kha Aaron hrukter uhla taikhap khal khapter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lupawng khal a lu-ah pawngter uhla, cuih parah calben khal ben uh. Calben parah cun ‘ Bawipa hnenih pekmi,’ tiah khen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule hriak la uhla a lu-ah nan toih pei ih cuticun hriak nan culh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A fapa pawl rak hruai uhla angki hrukter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An taai ah taaiṭem ṭem uhla an lu-ah lukhuh khumter uh. Cuti vekin a si Aaron le a fapa pawl puithiamah nan canter ding daan cu! Amah le a tesinfa pawl in Keimah in rian ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Keimah ka umnak Puanthlam hmaiah cawcang kha rak keng uhla Aaron le a fapa pawl in a lu parah an kut an suang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pumkhawmnak Puanthlam ih luhnak sangka, Bawipa ih hmaika ahcun cawcang cu nan that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cawcang ih thisen kha nan mehtok in tok uhla, biakṭheng parih thingzum nan bunmi parah nan maan pei. A taanglaimi a thisen cu biakṭheng hramah nan bur thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cu ṭheh in a sungril tuamtu a thau le a thin bawr le a kaileng pahnih le a tuamtu a thau pawl cu nan lak pei ih biakṭheng parah Keimah in biaknak ah nan ur pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a tit, a vun le a sungril hmuahhmuah cu bukthlam lenglamah nan ur ṭheh pei. Himi cu puithiam pawl an sualthianfai thawinak dingih pekmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuucang pakhat kha la uhla, Aaron le a fapa pawl in a lu parah an kut an suang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nan that pei ih a thisen nan suah pei ih biakṭheng ih kimvelah nan thle pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuucang sa cu nan can ṭheh pei ih a sungril le a ke pawl nan kholhfai pei. Cu ṭheh in a lu le a sa dang pawl ih tlunah nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biakṭheng parah tuucang sa hmuahhmuah cu Keimah in biaknak ah nan ur pei. Himi cu Bawipa hrangih mei-ur thawinak a si; meisa thawn thawinak a si ih Bawipa ih hrangah rimthaw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Cun tuucang dang pakhat kha lak uhla, Aaron le a fapa pawl in a lu parah an kut an suang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nan that pei ih a thisen hrekkhat nan lak pei ih, Aaron le a fapa pawl ih vorhlam hna-rah par le an vorhlam kutzungpi par le an vorhlam kezungpi parah nan maan pei. A taanglaimi thisen cu biakṭheng kimvelah nan bur ṭheh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakṭheng parih thisen kha nan lak pei ih culhmi hriak thawn nan rawi hnuah Aaron le a fapa pawl ih hnipuan parah nan theh pei. Aaron, a fapa pawl le an hnipuan tla cu a thianghlimmi ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tuucang ih thau, a meifi thau, a sungril tuamtu thau, a thin bawr, a kaileng pahnih parih thau pawl le a vorhlam cawn nan lak pei; (zianghrangah tile hi tuucang cu puithiam an cannak kutsuannak hrangih hmanmi a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa hmaika ih retmi sangkho sung ihsin thilnu tel lo sang pakhat, siti thawn tuahmi sangfun pakhat le sangpheng pakhat nan lak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi sang pawl cu Aaron le a fapa pawl ih kut sungah nan ret pei ih thlir tahratin Bawipa ih hnenah an pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cu ṭheh in an kut parih sang pawl cu nan lak pei ih biakṭheng parih mei-ur thawinak parah nan ret pei ih Bawipa ih hrangih rimthaw si dingin nan ur pei. Himi cu Bawipa ih hnenah meisa thawn biaknak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Aaron pumpeknak tuucang ih ir kha nan lak pei ih, Bawipa hnenah thlir tahratin biaknak ah nan hmang pei. Himi tuucang sa cu nanmah ih covo a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Aaron le a fapa pawl pumpeknak ih hmanmi tuucang sa ihsin a ir kha kut in thlir tahratin biaknak ah nan hmang pei ih a cawn cu puithiam pawl hrangah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thleng-aw dah lomi ka thu pekmi bangtuk in a hi sa pawl cu Aaron le a fapa pawl hrangih Israel mi pawl ih pekmi sa a si ding. Israel mi pawl ih pawlkhawm biaknak sa sung ihsin hi sa - a ir le a cawn pawl cu - puithiam pawl hrangih a dangte ih retmi sa a si. Bawipa hnenih an laksawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Aaron ih fapa pawl kha puithiam an si ve theinak dingin Aaron a thih tikah a hnipuan thianghlim pawl cu a fapa pawl hnenah nan pek thluh pei ih kutsuannak an ngah tikah cuih hnipuan ah an hruk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aaron ih puithiam hnaṭuan a sawngtu a fapa in hmun thianghlim ih puithiam hnaṭuan dingih tonkhawmnak thlam sung a luh tikah acuih hnipuan cu ni sarih sung a hruk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Pumpeknak hrangih hmanmi tuucang cu nan lak pei ih hmun thianghlim ah a sa cu nan suang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Keimah umnak Puanthlam luhnak sangka ah Aaron le a fapa pawl in tuucang ih sa le kho sungih sang pawl cu an ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anmah pumpeknak le hriakculh caanah an hnenih ngaidamnak a thlentertu cu anmah in an ei pei. Hi rawl cu a thiangmi a si hrangah puithiam pawl lawngin an ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sa siseh, sang siseh zinglam tiang a taangmi a um a si ahcun ur-kang thluh ding an si. Ei sal ding a si nawn lo; ziangahtile a thiangmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Aaron le a fapa pawl hrangah ka thupekmi vek cekci in nan tuah pei. An pumpeknak cu ni sarih sung nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nitinte in sualthianfai thawinakah cawcang nan that pei ih sual ngaidamnak a um ding. Sual ngaidamnak hrangih cawcang nan thah ruangah biakṭheng ihsin sualnak cu a hlo ding a si. Cun biakṭheng cu sahriak nan culh pei ih Pathian hnenah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ni sarih sung biakṭheng hrangah sualthianfai thawinak nan tuah pei ih Pathian hnenah nan pek pei. Cuticun biakṭheng cu a thianghlimzet ding ih thil zarh ah a cang ding; curuangah biakṭheng a daitu hmuahhmuah in a zarhmi ah an cang ve ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Biakṭheng parih thawinak nan pek dingmi cu hihi a si ding: Nitinte in cat loin kum khat a timi tuu note pahnih nan that ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zinglam ah tuu note pakhat nan that pei ih zanlam ah a dang tuu note pakhat nan that pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Siti ṭhazet khuat thum rawimi sangvut ṭhazet cuai li thawn a hmaisaih tuu note nan thahmi cu thawinakah nan pek pei. Cule inmi thawinak hrangah sabitti khuat thum khal nan toih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuu note pahnihnak cu zanlam ah, zinglam ih nan tuah vek thotho in, eimi thawinak le inmi thawinak thawn nan pek cih pei. Cuticun Bawipa ih hrangih meisa thawn ur-in thawinak rimthaw a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A hi mei-ur thawinak cu Bawipa keimah ih hmaiah Keimah umnak Puanthlam sung luhnak sangka ah sankhat hnu sankhat cat loin nan tuah ringring pei. Cutawkah cun ka minung pawl ka lo tong ding ih nan hnenah thu ka sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutawkah Israel mi pawl cu ka tong pei ih keimah ih sunlawinak tleu in acuih hmun cu hmun thianghlim ah a cangter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Puanthlam le biakṭheng cu ka thianghlimter ding; Aaron le a fapa pawl tla cu keimah ih puithiam hna an ṭuannak dingah a hrante in ka ret ding ih ka thianghlimter hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel mi lakah ka um pei ih an Pathian ka si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Keimah cu anmah lakih ka um theinak dingah Izipt ram ihsin a suaktertu an Bawipa Pathian ka si kha in thei ding. Keimah cu Bawipa an Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Zihmui rimthaw urnak ah lawithing in biakṭheng nan don pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dong khat sau, dong khat kau, a tung a vang a can-aw ih dong hnih saangmi a si pei. Thingzum nan bunmi pawl cu biakṭheng thawn an peh-aw thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A par le a kil pali le thingzum bunmi pawl cu sui in nan khuut thluh pei ih a kimvel cu sui in nan khap pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A putnak zawnfung pawl kaitu-ah suikual pahnih nan tuah pei ih a zim hnuai, a siirlam pahnih ah nan bun pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi zawnfung pawl cu lawithing in nan tuah pei ih sui in nan khuut pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sin a neimi Thukam Kuang hmaiih a thlai awmi puanzaarih hmaiah biakṭheng cu nan ret pei. Cutawkah ka lo tong hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aaron in meivanmi a zoh tikah acuih biakṭheng parah zingtinte in zihmui rimthaw a ur pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zanlam ih meivanmi a thleng tik khalah zihmui rimthaw cu a ur pei. Hi zihmui rimthaw nan pekmi cu sankhat hnu sankhat cat loin nan tuah ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi biakṭheng parah thlenter lo dingih khammi zihmui siseh, mei-ur thawinakih hmanmi ṭilva le thawinakih hmanmi rawl tla siseh, nan ret lo pei ih inmi-thawinakih hmanmi tidai khal nan burh lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum khatah voikhat, Aaron in thingzum bunmi pawl ih parah sual ngaidamnak hrangah thawinakih hmanmi sathi thawn acuih biakṭheng cu a thianghlimter pei. Himi khal hi sankhat hnu sankhat tuah ringring a si pei. Bawipa hnenih pekmi a thianghlim zetmi biakṭheng a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl mipum nan siar tikah Bawipa hnenah mi hmuahhmuah in an nunnak tlennak man an pek ciar pei; ziangahtile mipum siar laiah an hnenih siatsuahnak a thlen lonak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipum siarnak cazin sungih a telmi hmuahhmuah in hmunthiang cuaithlainak ih an khiahmi zat in an pek ciar pei. Himi cu Bawipa hnenih thawinak a si bangtuk in mikip in an pek thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum kul le a tlunlam mi hmuahhmuah in mipum siarnak cazin sungih telhcih an si hrangah hi paisa cu Bawipa ih hnenah an pek ciar pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan nunnak man Bawipa hnenih nan pek tikah milian le mifarah thleidannak um loin bangrep te in nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mi hnen in hi paisa cu nan khong pei ih Keimah umnak Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuannak ah nan hmang pei. Bawipa in Israel mi pawl cu a ciin ringringnak dingah le nan nunnak hrangih pekmi-ah hi paisa cu a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kutke kholhnakah kheng pakhat dar in nan tuah pei ih a tawdam khal dar in nan tuah pei. Pumkhawmnak thlam le mei-ur thawinak biakṭheng karlakah acuih darkheng cu nan ret pei ih a sungah tidai nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa pawl in an kut le an ke kholhnakah cuih tidai cu an hmang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih mei-ur thawinak pek dingah pumkhawmnak thlam sungih an luh tik le puithiam hnaṭuan in biakṭheng an naih tikah hi tidai thawn an kholh-aw a si ahcun an thi lo ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An thih lonak dingah an kut le an ke pawl cu an kholh tengteng pei. Himi cu anmah le an tesinfa pawl tiangin a kumkhua-in an thlun ringring dingmi daan a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Zihmui phun ṭha bik pawl: cingthling pawng kul, a rimhmuimi sinnamon thing thling pawng hra, a rim thawmi futi pawng hra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />lawi thingthling pawng kul, (biakinn cuai khainakih khaimi fekfek) le olif hriak khuat nga nan lak pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himi pawl cu zihmui rawithiamtu ih rawimi bangin nan rawi pei ih culhnak ding hriakah nan hmang pei. Cumi cu a thianghlimmi culhnak ding hriak a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi hriak in Keimah umnak Puanthlam, thukam kuang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />sang retnak cabuai le a thilri pawl, meisa vannak fung le a thilri pawl, zihmui rimthaw urnak biakṭheng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mei-ur thawinak biakṭheng le a thilri hmuahhmuah le kut kholhnak kheng le a tawdam pawl cu nan culh ṭheh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cubangtuk in thlam sungih thilri pawl cu Pathian hrangah nan thianghlimter pei ih a thianghlim ngaingaimi thil zarh ah an cang ding. Himi thilri pawl a daitu hmuahhmuah cu an thianghlim ve ding ih a zarhmi-ah an cang ve ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun Aaron le a fapa pawl cu hriak nan culh pei ih ka hrangih puithiam an ṭuan theinak dingah nan thianghlimter pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl hnenah, ‘Hi culhnak ding hriak thiang cu nan hrangah sankhat hnu sankhat a thianghlimmi siti a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi menmen parah nan burh lo pei ih hi hriak thiang bangtuk in rimthawmi zihmui le hriak rawi in nan hmang lo pei. A thianghlimmi hriak a si bangtuk in a thiangmi a si tiin nan ruat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi hriak bangtuk tuah a cawngtu le puithiam siar lo midang parih a hmangtu pohpoh cu a miphun sung ihsin hlon a si pei,’ tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Zihmui rimthaw a phunphun: stakte, onikha, galbanum le a citmi frankinsens zihmui pawl ihsin a zatrep ciar in la aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cupawl cu zihmui tuah thiamtu pawl ih an tuah vekin feltein rawi awla zihmui rimthaw-ah tuah aw. Cumi cu ci thawn rawi awla thiangfai ding le thianghlim dingah alter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A hrek cu a vut ṭhazet ih cang dingin deng awla, a hrek cu ka lo tonnak ding hmun, Puanthlam sungih Thukam Kuang hmaiah thawinakah nan hmang pei. Hi zihmui rimthaw cu a thianghlim zetmi-ah nan ruat pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A cuih zihmui rimthaw bangtuk in nanmah hrangah tuah tahratin nan hmang lo pei. Hi zihmui rimthaw cu Bawipa hnenih pek ciami thil thianghlim a si kha nan thei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat in acuih zihmui rimthaw bangtuk a tuah ih a hmang a si ahcun a miphun sung ihsin hlon tengteng a si pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Judah phun sung ihsin Hur ih tupa Bezalel, Uri-ih fapa, cu ka hril zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu ka thlarau in ka khahter zo ih, thiltitheinak, fimthiamnak le kutzung thiamnak a phunphun a nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Innruang pungsan a phunphun suai theinak le a cupawl cu sui, ngun le dar in suai theinak a nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungmankhung taat theinak, zanthing in thilri a phunphun tuah theinak le kutzung thiamzet ih thil phundang dang tuahtheinak tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah thawn hnaṭuan tlang dingah Dan phun sung ihsin Ahisamak ih fapa Oholiab cu ka hril zo. Tuah dingih ka lo fialmi hmuahhmuah an tuah theinak dingah a dang zungthiam pawl hnen khalah thiltitheinak tamzet ka pe zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuah dingmi pawl cu: Keimah umnak Puanthlam, Thukamnak Kuang le a sin, Puanthlam sungih thilri hmuahhmuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cabuai le sui ih tuahmi meivannak fung le a thilri, zihmui rimthaw urnak hrangih biakṭheng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mei-ur thawinak hrangih biakṭheng le a thilri pawl, kut kholhnak kheng le a tawdam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa pawl in puithiam hna an ṭuan ah an hruk dingmi puan mankhung pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hriak culhnak dingih hmanmi siti le hmun thianghlim hrangih hman dingmi zihmui rimthaw pawl tla an si. Hi thil pawl an tuah tikah na hnenih thu ka lo pekmi vek cekci in an tuah thluh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Israel mi pawl hnenah, ‘Ka sabbath ni cu nan ul pei, zianghrangah tile cuih ni cu keimah le nanmah le nan tesinfa karlakah Bawipa keimah in nanmah cu ka minung ngaingai ah ka lo tuah zo a si, ti langternak ih hminsinnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabbath ni cu nan ul pei, ziangahtile nan hrangah thiantermi ni a si zo. Zokhal sabbath ni a buartu cu thah a si pei; zokhal sabbath ni ul loin hna a ṭuan asile a minung sung ihsin dawihlo a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Niruk sung hna ṭuannak caan nan nei; sikhalsehla ni sarih ni cu a thianghlimmi sabbath ni a si ih Bawipa hrangah ni thianghlim a si. Zokhal cuih ni-ah hna a ṭuantu cu thah tengteng a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumkhua daih thukam hminsinnak a si bangtuk in Israel mi pawl in sabbath ni cu an ul pei ih an tesinfa san khalah an ul ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi ni cu keimah le Israel mi karlakih kumkhua hminsinnak a si, ziangahtile Bawipa keimah in van le leilung cu ni ruk sungah ka tuah ṭheh ih ni sarih ni-ah hnaṭuan loin ka colh ruangah a si,’ tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sinai Tlang parah Bawipa in Moses hnenih thu a simmi a ṭheh tikah Pathian amah ih kut rori in thukham a ngannak lungpheng pahnih cu Bawipa in Moses hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses cu tlang parah caan reipi a um ih a rung ṭum dah lo ti kha Israel mi pawl in an theih tikah Aaron an pan ih a hnenah, “Izipt ram ihsin in hruaisuaktu hi milaipa Moses cu ziang a cang ti kan theih lo; curuangah in hruaitu dingah khawzing pakhat in tuahsak aw,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Aaron in, “Nan nupi pawl le nan fapa pawl le nan fanu pawl ih khaihmi sui hnakhai pawl cu phoih ṭheh uhla ka hnenah rak keng uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah an zatein an sui hnakhai pawl cu an phoih thluh ih Aaron an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aaron in hnakhai pawl cu a lak ih meisa-ah a titter ih sui cu a er ih caw faate lem ah a tuah. Cutikah misenpi in, “Maw Israel mi pawl, Izipt ram ihsin a lo suahtu nan khawzing cu himi hi a si,” tiah an ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuti an ti ciamco cu Aaron in a hmuh tikah cawlem ih hmaiah cun biakṭheng a don ih, “Thaizing cu Bawipa sunloihnak dingah rawl ei puai kan tuah pei,” tiah thu a than.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cun a thaizing zingpitah mei-ur thawinak hrangah ṭilva an that ih pawlkom thawinak hrang khalah ṭilva an rak keng. Cule Israel mi pawl cun an ei an in ih zoh mawilo tiangin an nuam-aw ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Zamrang in vung ṭum aw, ziangahtile Izipt ram ihsin na hruaisuakmi na minung pawl in anmah ih mualphonak an tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An thlun dingih ka pekmi lamzin ihsin zamrangte in an pial zo a si; anmah hrangah sui in cawlem an tuah ih an biak ih a hnenah thawinak an pe rero zo a si. Cule, ‘Maw Israel, Izipt ram ihsin a lo hruaisuaktu khawzing cu himi hi a si,’ tiah an ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi minung pawl cu ka theihmi an si ih an lung a ruhzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah a kham i tum-aw hlah, ka thin a hengtuk a si hrangah ka siatsuah thluh hai ding. Cun nangmah le na tesinfa pawl cu miphun tumpi-ah ka lo tuah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Moses cun Bawipa a Pathian hnenah zaangfahnak a dil ih, “Maw Bawipa , cahnak le huham thawn Izipt ram ihsin na luattermi na minung pawl ih parah ziangah so na thin a heng ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Israel mi pawl tlang parih thihter duh le siatsuah thluh duh ah an Pathian in Izipt ram ihsin a suakter a si,’ tiah Izipt mi pawl in an ti lo ding maw? Na thinhengnak cu daiter awla na thin cu ṭhum hram aw; cubangtuk ih siatsuahnak cu na minung pawl ih parah thlengter hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sal pawl Abraham, Isaak le Jakob cu vun mang sal hai awla, ziangtlukin an hnenah na hmin rori in thu na tiam ih, ‘Van ih a ummi arsi zat in nan tesinfa pawl cu an tam ding. Ka lo kam cia bangtuk in hi ram hmuahhmuah cu nan tesinfa pawl hnenah ka pek ding ih kumkhua-in anmah ih ta a si ding,’ na timi kha vun thei sal hram aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu a thin a ṭhum sal ih a sim ciami siatsuahnak cu a minung pawl parah thlengter loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses cu tlangpar ihsin a vung ṭum ih a hmai hnih ih nganmi thukham lungpheng pahnih cu a vun keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi lungpheng pawl cu Pathian ih tuahmi an si ih a parih ca nganmi pawl cu Pathian thukham, Pathian amah rori ih khermi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule misenpi au thawm cu Joshua in a theih tikah, “Kan riahnak hmunah raldonak thawm ka thei,” tiah Moses hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Moses in, “A cuih thawmvang cu ralneh thangṭhatnak hla a si lo; ral an sungih an ṭah thawm khal a si fawn lo. Kei ka theihmi cu hlasak thawm a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses cu an riahnak hmun a hei naih deuh vivo ih cawzuk le misenpi an laam vutvo ciamco kha a hmuh tikah a thin a heng ngaingai. Cutikah a kenmi lungpheng pawl cu a hlon ih tlanghram ah a den kuai thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An tuahmi cawzuk cu a lak ih a ur hnuah phut thluh koin a rial ih a phut cu tidai parah a phulh. Cule acuih tidai cu Israel mi pawl a inter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Aaron hnenah, “Ziangbangtuk thil na parih an tuah ruangah so hitluk lawmmam ih thilsualral na tuahter hai hi?” tiah Moses in a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Aaron cun, “Ka bawipa, ka hnenah na thin heng hram hlah aw. Himi pawl cu thilsia tuah dingah ziangtluk tumtahnak so an neih ti cu na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hnenah an ra ih, ‘In hruaitu dingah khawzing pakhat in tuahsak aw; ziangahtile Izipt ram ihsin in hruaisuaktu hi milaipa Moses cu ziang a cang zo ti kan thei lo,’ tiah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Zoso sui a nei,’ tiih ka suh tikah, sui hlawnthil a neimi hmuahhmuah in an phoih ih in pek. Cuih sui pawl cu meisa sungah ka paih ih hi cawlem hi a ra suak ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misenpi cu kilkhawi theih ding an si nawn lo, ti kha Moses in a hmu; ziangahtile an kiangkapah ṭih dingmi ral tampi um na cingin Israel mi pawl cu Aaron in milem bia dingah a thlahthlam zo hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Curuangah an riahnak ih kotka ah Moses cu a ding ih, “ Bawipa ih hrangah zoso a ṭang ding? Bawipa ih lamih ṭan a duhtu hmuahhmuah ka hnenah ra uh,” tiah napi in a au. Cutikah Levi mi pawl cu a hnenah an ra ih Moses in an hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ Bawipa Israel ih Pathian cun, ‘Nannih Levi mi pawl, ralnam pakhat ciar nan lak pei ih hi lam kap ihsin riahnak khatlam kap tiang nan feh pei; nan unau siseh, nan rualpi le nan innhnen khal siseh, nan that thluh pei,’ tiin a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Levi mi pawl cun Moses ih thupekmi vekin an tuah ih acuih ni lawnglawngah minung thawng thum an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Moses in Levi mi pawl hnenah, “ Bawipa ih hrangih puithiam hnaṭuantu dingah nan fapa pawl siseh, nan unau pawl siseh, nan thahnak ihsin tuihsun ah nan pum nan pe zo. Curuangah Bawipa in tuihsun ah thlawsuah a lo pe a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A thaizing ah Israel mi hnenah Moses in, “Sualnak tumpi nan tuah zo. Sikhalsehla Bawipa ih hnenah tlangpar ah ka hung feh pei ih nan sualnak ngaidam dingah a hnenah ka hung dil hnik pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutiin Moses cu Bawipa ih hnenah a feh ih, “Maw Pathian, ziangtluk sualnak tum so himi pawl in an tuah zo ti cu na thei ko. Anmah hrangah sui in khawzing an tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an sualnak cu ngaidam hram aw. Na ngaidam lo ding hnak cun na minung pawl an hmin na khumnak na cabu ihsin ka hmin kha phiat sawn hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Ka parih a sualtu lawng ka cabu sung ihsin a hmin ka phiat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Curuangah atu cu ka lo hmuh dingmi hmunah Israel mi pawl hi fehpi aw. Zohhnik, ka vancungmi in a lo hruai ding ih ni khatkhat a caan a kim tikah an sualnak ruangah cawhkuan ka pe ding a si, ti cu ciing ringring aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Israel mi parah natsia a thlenter, ziangahtile cawzuk tuah dingin Aaron kha an fial ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Izipt ram ihsin na hruai suakmi pawl thawn hi hmun hin Abraham, Isaak, Jakob le nan tesinfa pawl hnenah pe dingih ka rak tiam ciami ramah va feh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nan hmaiah vancungmi ka fehter ding ih Kanaan mi, Amor mi, Hit mi, Periz mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi pawl cu ka dawi thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cawhnawi le khuaitizu luannak ram ah nan feh ding. Sikhalsehla kei cu nan hnenah ka feh lo ding. Ziangahtile milungruh pawl nan si ruangah lamzinah ka lo siatsuah thluh hai pang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih thusia cu Israel mi in an theih tikah an riah a sia ih an ṭap; zohman in an suingun khal an hruh duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Israel mi hnenah, ‘Nannih cu milungruh pawl nan si. Malte sung hman nan hnenah feh ningla ka lo siatsuah thluh ding a si. Curuangah nan suingun pawl cu phoih ṭheh uh. Cuih hnuah nan parah ziangso ka tuah ding ti ka thei ding,’ a ti tiin sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Sinai tlang an thlen hnu in Israel mi pawl cun an suingun an hruh nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in riahnak hmun an khuarnak pohah, Moses in Puanthlam cu a lak ih riahnak hmun ihsin a leng hla deuhah a sak. A cuih Puanthlam cu “ Bawipa ih Umnak Puanthlam,” tiah hmin a sak. Bawipa ton a duhmi pawl cu riahnak hmun ihsin an suak ih cuih Puanthlam ahcun an feh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses cu acuih Puanthlam lam a feh tinte in, senpi pawl cu an sangka ciarah an ding ih Bawipa ih Puanthlam sungih Moses a lut hlan lo an zoh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih Puanthlam sungih Moses a luh hnuah mero cu a zualin a rung zaam ṭheu ih Puanthlam sangka cu a zeel ṭheu; cule cuih mero sung ihsin Bawipa in Moses hnenah thu a sim ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puanthlam sangka ih mero a um kha misenpi in an hmuh tikah an ding ih an thlam sangka ihsin an lu an kuun ciar ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rualpi ṭha biak-awk bangtuk in Bawipa le Moses cu hmaitontein an bia-aw ṭheu. Cuih hnuah Moses cu riahnak hmunah a kirsal ṭheu. Asinain Moses bawmtu tlangval Joshua, Nun ih fapa cu thlam sungah a taangta ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Bawipa ih hnenah, “Hi Israel mi pawl Kanaan ramih hruai dingah i fial ti cu ka thei; asinain keimah thawn feh dingah zoso na thlah ti cu i sim hrih lo. ‘Nangmah cu ka lo thei zet ih ka lung i awiter zet a si,’ tiah i ti zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah ka parah na lung a awi a si ahcun nangmah cu ka lo theih sinsin ih na lung ka awiter ringringnak dingah na tumtahmi i sim hram dingin zaangfah ka lo dil. Hi Israel mi pawl hi na miphun si dingah na rak hril khal kha ciing hram aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Na hnenah ka feh ding ih hnangamnak ka lo pe ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “Kan hnenah na feh lo ding a si ahcun hi hmun ihsin in fehter nawn hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangahtile in fehpi lo a si ahcun na minung pawl le keimah in na mithmai ṭha kan co zia hi ziangtinso mi in an theih ding? In umpinak hin leilung tlunih miphun hmuahhmuah lak ihsin kan hleicetzia a langter ding a sisi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Na dilmi vekin ka tuah ding; ziangahtile ka lo theih zetmi na si ih na parah ka lung a awi zet,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “ Bawipa , zaangfahte in na sunlawizia i hmuh hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Ka sunlawizia cu ka lo hmuh ding ih ka hmin thianghlim cu na hmai rori-ah ka phuang ding: Keimah cu Bawipa ka si. Ka lainat duhmi cu ka laina ding ih ka zaangfah duhmi cu ka zaangfah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka hmai rori cu nan hmu thei lo ding. Ziangahtile ka hmai a hmutu cu zohman an nung lo ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Bawipa in, “Zohhnik, lungpi parah dinnak ṭha ka kiangah hmun a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na kiangte ihsin ka sunlawinak a ra lan tikah lungpi kua sungah ka lo thup pei ih ka lo lan ngah hlan lo ka kut in ka lo hup ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun ka kut ka lak sal tikah ka dunglam lawng i hmu ding; ka hmai cu na hmu ngah lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “A hmaisaih lungpheng bangtuk in, lungpheng pahnih tuah sal awla na khuai seksek thluhmi lungpheng parih ka ngan bangtuk in ka ngan sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thaizing ah timtuah cia awla Sinai Tlang parah hung kai in tlangzim ah i hung tong aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zohman na hnenah hung feh hlah hai seh; tlang parah zohman um hlah hai seh; tuu le caw khal Sinai Tlang kiangkap ah tlang hlah hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in a hmaisaih lungpheng pahnih bangtuk in lungpheng pahnih a thar in a tuah sal ih Bawipa ih fial vekin Sinai Tlang parah lungpheng pahnih kengin zingpitah a hung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cu mero in a rung ṭum; Moses kiangah a rung ding ih Bawipa timi a hmin cu a phuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa cu Moses ih hmaika ihsin a lan ih, “Pathian Bawipa cu lainatnak le zaangfahnak in a khatmi Pathian ka si. Ka thin a sau ih rin a tlakmi le duhdawtnak a nei ringringtu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hngetmi ka duhdawtnak cu san thawng tampi tiang ka kimter ih an mawhnak, an siatnak le an sualnak tla ka ngaidam. Sikhalsehla an pale pawl ih sualmawhnak ruangah an faale pawl le an tesinfa pawl cu santhum sanli tiang ka hrem hai a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Moses cu zamrangte in leilung dai in a lu a kun ih Bawipa cu a biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Moses in, “ Bawipa , ka parah na lung a awi a si ahcun in fehpi ve hram aw. Hi Israel mi pawl hi mi lungruh ngaingai an si; asinain kan siatnak le kan sualnak cu in ngaidam awla nangmah ih minung ngaingai ah in co hram aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Nanmah thawn thukamnak ka tuah ding. Israel mi pawl ih mithmuh ah leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah hnenah tuah dah keel lomi thilmak ka tuah ding a si. Bawipa ih thil a tuah theizia cu nanmah thawn a ummi hmuahhmuah in an hmu ding; ziangahtile nan hrangah a rapthlakza ngaingaimi thil ka tuah ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuihsun ih ka lo pek dingmi thukham pawl cu ṭhatein nan thlun pei. Nan hmaiih nan feh vivo tikah Amor mi, Kanaan mi, Hit mi, Periz mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi pawl cu ka dawi hlo ṭheh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi Kanaan ramih a rak ummi minung pawl thawn pawlkom awknak thukam nan tuah lonak dingah fimkhur zetin um uh; ziangahtile himi pawl thawn pawlkom awknak thukam nan tuah a si ahcun nanmah siatsuahtu thang bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuhnakin anmah ih biakṭheng pawl khi bal thluh sawn uh; an lungto thianghlim pawl khi khuai ṭheh uhla, Asherah milem pawl khal hau ṭheh sawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Khawzing nan bia lo pei; ziangahtile Bawipa ih hmin cu ‘Thiik hmang,’ a si; Keimah cu thiik nei Pathian ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi ramih minung pawl thawn thukamnak zianghman tuah hlah uh; zianghrangah tile taksa zuar pawl bangin an khawzing pawl an biak ih, raithawinak an pek tikah nannih khal an lo leem ding ih an raithawinak rawl tla nan ei pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An fanu pawl tla nan fapa pawl hrangah nan ṭhi pang pei ih cuih nunau pawl cun taksa zuartu bangtuk in an khawzing hrangah hna an ṭuan ding ruangah nan fapa pawl cu an hruai sual pang ding ih an khawzing pawl ih hnaṭuantu riangri-ah an canter pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nanmah hrangah thir pawl khi eer tahratin milem ah nan tuah lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thilnu tel lo Sang Puai cu nan tuah ringring pei. Thu ka lo pek zo bangtuk in Abib thla ah thilnu tel lo sang cu ni sarih sung nan ei pei; ziangahtile cuih thla ah Izipt ram in nan suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Minung siseh ṭilva siseh fatir pohpoh cu ka ta an si; nan caw siseh nan tuu siseh an hrin hmaisa bik a pa pohpoh cu ka ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla laakih fatir pohpoh cu a ai-ah tuu pakhat pekin nan tlen sal pei. Nan tlen lo asile a hngawng nan merh kiak pei. Nan fapatir pohpoh cu nan tlen pei. “Zokhal sisehla thawinak pe loin kut lawngin ka hmaiah a ra thei lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Niruk sung hna nan ṭuan pei ih lo rih caan le rawlkhawm caan a si khalle ni sarih ni-ah cun hna nan ṭuan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Nan sangvut pawl a cu ih nan khawm thok tikah Thlaithar Puai tuah uhla kum a cem zawng ih rawl nan khawm tikah Rawlkhawm Puai nan tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nan mipa hmuahhmuah cu kum khatah voithum Bawipa Israel ih Pathian Keimah in ra bia pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nan hmai ihsin miphun dang pawl ka dawi ṭheh ih nan ram ka kauhter ṭheh hnuah cun Bawipa nan Pathian keimah ih hmaiah kum khatah voithum puai tuah dingih nan rat sungah zohman in nan ram cu neh an tum lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka hrangih thawinak ṭilva nan pek tikah thilnu telmi sang cu nan hmang hrimhrim lo pei. Lantak Puai nan tuah ih ṭilva nan thahmi sa cu a thaizing tiang nan ret lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nan lo sung rawl nan khawm hmaisa bikmi sung ihsin a ṭha bik cu Bawipa ih innah nan rak keng pei. “Tuu note cu a nuih hnawiti in nan suang lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah, “Hi ka simmi pawl hi ngan aw; ziangahtile nangmah le Israel mi hnenih thukam ka tuahmi cu hi ka hmurka ihsin a suakmi ka ṭong pawl ruangih ka tuahmi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah Moses cu ni sawmli le zan sawmli, rawl ei lo le tidai in loin Bawipa ih hnenah a um. Thukamnak ih ṭongkam - Thukham Pahra sungih a ummi, Pathian ṭong pawl cu lungpheng parah Moses in a ngan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses cu lungpheng pahnih parih nganmi Thukham Pahra kengin a rung ṭum tikah, Bawipa thawn an biak-awk rero ruangah, a hmai cu a tleu ṭheh; asinain amah cun a thei-aw lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aaron le Israel mi pawl in Moses cu an rak zoh ih a mithmai tle kha an hmuh tikah an ṭih ih an naih ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Moses in a ko hai ih Aaron le Israel mi hruaitu pawl cu a hnenah an feh sal. Cule Moses cun an hnenah thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Israel mi pawl cu a hnenah an ra ṭheh. Cutikah Sinai Tlang parah Bawipa in a pekmi thukham hmuahhmuah cu Moses in Israel mi hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun thusim a ṭheh tikah Moses cun hmaikhuhnak puan paate in a hmai a khuh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa thawn bia-aw dingin Bawipa ih umnak Puanthlam sungih a luh tinte in a hmaikhuh cu a ong ih thlam sung ihsin a ra suah sal tikah a khuh aw sal ṭheu. Thlam sung ihsin a ra suah tikah Bawipa ih thupek hmuahhmuah cu Israel mi hnenah a sim sin ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutikah Moses ih mithmai cu tleu zetin an hmu. Thusim a ṭheh tikah a hmaikhuh cun a khuh aw sal ṭheu ih, Bawipa thawn bia-aw dingin Puanthlam sungih a luh sal hlan lo a hmai cu a khuh aw ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel mi hmuahhmuah cu hmun khatah a khawm ṭheh ih an hnenah, “ Bawipa ih thupekmi nan tuah ding pawl cu hi bangtuk in a si pei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Niruk sung hna nan ṭuan pei; asinain ni sarih ni cu nan hrangah ni thianghlim a si ih, ni sunglawi, nan hnaṭuannak ihsin nan colh ni, Bawipa ih hrangah thianhlimtermi ni a si pei. Cuih ni-ah zozo khal hna a ṭuan asile thah a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi sabbath ni-ah nan umnak pohpoh ah meisa nan muah lo pei,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in Israel mi hnenah, “ Bawipa ih thupekmi bangtuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah thawhlawm nan pek pei. Thawhlawm pek a duhtu hmuahhmuah in, sui, ngun, dar;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mepian, sen-uai, a senmi tuuhmul, puan mankhung, mehmul ih tahmi hnipuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuucang phaw a senih buhmi, saphaw ṭha le lawithing,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />meivannak siti, hriak culhnak ding le zihmui rimthaw dingah zihmui a phunphun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />lungmankhung sen le Puithiam Sang ih hruk ding ṭaangben hrang le angki thianghlim sunghruk parih ben dingah lungmankhung pawl nan pe pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nanmah lakih zungthiam hmuahhmuah in Bawipa ih fialmi thilri hmuahhmuah cu nan tuah pei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian umnak inn hrangah puanthlam le a tlun khuh, phar pawl le puan awk-nak kual pawl, phartlang, ṭhuam le a tawdam pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thukham Kuang le a putnak zawnfung pawl, kuangsin le kuang phentu puanzar pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cabuai, cabuai zawnfung pawl le a thilri pawl, Pathian hnenih pek ding sang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />meivannak fung le a thilri pawl, mei-inn le mei-inn hrang siti,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />zihmui rimthaw ur-nak hrangih biakṭheng le biakṭheng zawnfung pawl, culh ding hriak, zihmui rimthaw, puanthlam luhnak sangka puanzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mei-ur thawinak pek ding biakṭheng le biakṭheng parih dammi dar khohriik, biakṭheng zawnfung pawl le a thilri pawl, kut kholhnak kheng le a tawdam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puanthlam kulhnak puanzar le a ṭhuam pawl le a tawdam pawl, kotka puanzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puanthlam le a kulhnak hrangah thil bannak le a hri pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hmun thianghlim sungih puithiam pawl ih hmanmi hnipuan sunglawi le mankhungmi - puithiam Aaron le a fapa pawl ih puithiam hna an ṭuan tikah an hruh dingmi hnipuan thianghlim pawl cu an tuah pei,” tiah Moses in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Moses hnen ihsin Israel pawl cu an umnak ciarah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Puithiam hnipuan thianghlim tuahnak hrang, Bawipa ih Puanthlam saknak hrang le thlam sung hnaṭuannak hrangih a ṭulmi hmuahhmuah pawl cu pek a duhtu pawl le a lung a thotu pawl in Bawipa ih hnenah thawhlawm an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nunau siseh mipa siseh an ra ih thil mawiternak ih benmi a phunphun le hnakhai, zunghruk, ṭhi le sui ih tuahmi thilri pawl cu siang zetin an pek. Mi hmuahhmuah in Bawipa ih hnenah pek dingih an ruahmi thawhlawm, sui ih tuahmi thilri pawl tla cu Bawipa ih hnenah an rak keng ih an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul siseh, mehmulih tahmi hnipuan le a senih buhmi tuucang phaw le saphaw ṭha zet pawl siseh, a neitu in Bawipa ih hnenah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngun siseh, dar siseh a pe theitu pawl in Bawipa ih hnenah an pek ih, lawithing a neitu pawl in inn saknak ah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun nunau zungṭha pawl in pat an hnuk ih mepian, sen-uai le a senmi tuuhmul puan le patih tahmi hnipuan mankhung an tuah ih Bawipa ih hnenah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nunau zungṭha pawl in mehmul tla pat ah an hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hruaitu pawl in a thianghlimmi sunghruk angki le ṭaangben parih ben dingah lungmankhung sen an pek ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mei-inn van ding siti, culh ding hriak le zihmui rimthaw ur ding hrangah siti le zihmui tla an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel mi hmuahhmuah in nunau siseh mipa siseh, Moses hnen ihsin Bawipa ih thupek an theih bangtuk in a hnaṭuannak hrangah an pek duhmi thawhlawm cu Bawipa ih hnenah an pe ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Moses in Israel pawl hnenah, “Judah phun sung ihsin Hur ih tupa Bezalel, Uri ih fapa cu Bawipa in a hril zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa in Bezalel cu a thlarau in a khahter ih zungthiamnak, thil tuahtheinak le kutzung thiamnak ih tuah thei dingmi theihtheinak a nei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />pungsan a phunphun suai theinak le sui, ngun le dar in cuih pawl tuah theinak tla a nei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />lungmankhung taat thiamnak, zanthing in zuk tuahthiamnak le kutzung thiamnak a phunphun a nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bezalel cu Dan hrin sung ihsin Ahisamak ih fapa Oholiab hnenah an kutzung thiam pawl cu midang zirh thiamnak khal Bawipa in a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lungto parih lungkher thiam pawl le thing parih cangan le zuksuai thiam pawl, pungsan suai thiam pawl le mepian, sendup le a sen ih tah thiam pawl, puan parih ṭelh thiam pawl ih thiamnak bangtuk in Pathian in Bezalel le Oholiab hnenah thiamnak nasa zetin a pek hai. Hnaṭuan a phunphun an thiam ih pungsan a phunphun an suai thiam a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Bezalel, Oholiab le Bawipa in zungthiamnak le thilti theinak a pek mi pawl cun Bawipa ih inn hrangih a ṭul mi hmuahhmuah sak dingah a theitu pawl an si ruangah Bawipa ih thupekmi vek cekci in an tuah thluh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in zungthiamnak a pek zomi pawl Bezalel, Oholiab le a dang zungthiam pawl le hnaṭuan bawm duhtu pawl cu Moses in a ko ih hnaṭuan thok dingin a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel pawl in Puanthlam thianghlim saknak dingih thawhlawm an pekmi thilri hmuahhmuah cu an hnenah Moses in a pek ṭheh. Cuih tlunah Israel pawl cun zingtinte in an thawhlawm cu Moses hnenah an rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Puanthlam thianghlim sak hna a phunphun a ṭuantu zungthiam pawl cu an hnaṭuanmi taanta in an ra ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses hnenah, “ Bawipa in ṭuan ding in fialmi pawl hrangih thilri a ṭulmi hnakih tam deuh an pe zo a si,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Moses in misenpi hnenah thu a than ih, “Nunau siseh mipa siseh, Puanthlam thianghlim saknak dingah zohman in thawhlawm nan pe nawn lo pei,” tiah a ti. Cuih hnu cun Israel pawl in zianghman an rak keng nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An rak ken ciami cu an tuah ding hmuahhmuah an tuah ṭheh hmanah a cem dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnaṭuantu pawl lakih zungthiam bik pawl in Pathian umnak Puanthlam cu an sak. Puanṭha mankhung mepian, sendup le a senmi puan, cherub timi ramsa lem pawl cuangin coihcinmawi ṭelhmi puan zuun hra in an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puan pawl cu a saulam kaih 14 le a kauhlam kaih 2 ciar an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zuun nga cu an peh ih, a dang zuun nga khal an peh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutiih pehmi puan tlunta bikih zim veve-ah mepian puan in a beu pawl an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puan pehmi pakhatnak ah beu sawmnga an tuah ih, a pahnihnak puan pehmi khalah beu sawmnga an tuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlam cu umnak pakhat ih cang dingah puan awh-nak suikual sawmnga in an tuah ih cumi in puan thuah hnih cu an peh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Puanthlam khuhnakah mehmul in puan zuun hleikhat an tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zuun khatah kaih 15 a sau ih kaih 2 a kau. Puan cu an tia aw ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puan zuun nga kha zuun khatah an peh ih, a dang zuun ruk khal an peh thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An pehmi pakhatnak puanzimah puanbeu sawmnga an tuah ih pahnihnak puanzim khalah puanbeu sawmnga thotho an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlam pakhat ih cang dingin puan awh-nak darkual sawmnga an tuah ih, puan thap hnih cu cuih darkual cun an peh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thlam khuhnak dingah a senih buhmi tuucang phaw le acuih parih khuh dingah saphaw ṭha an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puanthlam ih phar cu a tung zawng in an song ih lawithing in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phar pawl cu tlep khatah dong hra a sau ih dong khat le hrek ciar a kau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Phar tlepkhat le tlepkhat pehkomnak ah a kap ciar kha an khuar. Phar a zatein cuticun an tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlanglam phar hrangah tlep kul an tuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />phar tawdamah ngunih tuahmi tawdam sawmli an tuah. An khuarnak zawn ihsin a hun dotu-ah phar tlepkhat ah tawdam pahnih fingfing an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saklam phar hrang khalah phar tlep kul an tuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />phar tlep khatah tawdam pahnih fingfing in ngun tawdam sawmli an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nitlaknak lam, thlam ih dunglam phar hrangah, phar tlep ruk le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />thlam ih dunglam kil pahnih hrangah phar tlep hnih an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi a kilih phar tlep hnih cu a tawdam ihsin a luzimih a ummi kual tiangin an peh-aw thluh. Phar kil pahnih ih phar tlep pahnih pawl cu a cutiih tuah thluhmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuhrangah phar tlep riat an um ih tlepkhat ah tawdam pahnih ciar in ngun tawdam hleiruk an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule lawithing in phartlang an tuah ih, saklam phar hrangah phartlang panga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />thlanglam phar hrangah phartlang panga le nitlaknak lam thlam ih dunglam phar hrangah phartlang panga an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Phar laifang zawnih an bunmi phartlang cu kil khat ihsin kil khat tiang a saumi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Phar siseh phartlang siseh, sui in an khuut ih phar parih an bunmi sui kual sungah phartlang pawl cu an hrolh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puanzar cu mepian, sendup, a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung, cherub timi ramsa lem pawl cuangin coihcinmawi ṭelhmi puan pawl in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Puanzar thlainak ah lawithing in ṭhuam pali an tuah ih cuih ṭhuam pawl cu sui in an khuut ih suikual pawl a parah an bun. Ṭhuam pawl dotu-ah ngun tawdam pali an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Puanthlam sung luhnak puanzar cu mepian, sendup, a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung coihcinmawi ṭelhmi puan in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ṭhuam panga an tuah ih cuih parah a kual pawl an bun. Ṭhuam le a zim pawl cu sui in an khuut. Cuih ṭhuam pawl hrangah dar thawn tuahmi tawdam panga an tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bezalel in Thukam Kuang cu lawithing thawn a tuah ih dong hnih le hrek a sau, dong khat le hrek a kau ih dong khat le hrek a sang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sunglam siseh a lenglam siseh sui hlir in a khuut ih a kimvel cu sui in a vel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sui kual pali a tuah ih khatlamah pahnih veve in a ke pali ah a bun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lawithing in zawnfung pali a tuah ih sui in a khuut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukam Kuang zawnfung cu khatlam kap veve ih suikual ahcun a hrolh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thingkuang sin cu sui hlir in a tuah ih dong hnih le hrek a sau ih dong khat le hrek a kau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sinih khatlam le khatlam zim veve ah cherub timi ramsa lem pahnih sui in a tuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zim khatah pakhat veve a ret. A dangte in si loin a sin thawn an peh-aw thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cherub timi ramsa lem pawl cu a tlunah an thla an pharh ih kuangsin cu an thla in an phen. Hmai hoih-aw in kuangsin cu an zoh veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bezalel in lawithing thawn cabuai a tuah ih dong hnih a sau, dong khat a kau ih dong khat le hrek a sang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sui hlir in a khuut ih a kimvel cu sui in a khap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tlangkap cu zung li kau in a tuah ih a kimvel cu sui thotho in a khap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sui kual pali a tuah ih a ke kiang cabuai kiil li ah a bun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih sui kual pali cu cabuai zawnfung a kaitu an si hrangah cabuai tlangkap ri zawn ah a bun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zawnfung pawl cu lawithing in a tuah ih sui in a khuut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cabuai parih inmi thawinak hrangah pakan pawl, hai pawl, khuat le kheng pawl cu sui hlir in an tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bezalel in meivannak fung cu sui hlir in a tuah. A tawdam le a fung cu ṭhazet ih sermi sui in a tuah. A mawitertu pangpar, a mum le a parh pawl tla cu a fung thawn an peh-aw thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A fung ihsin a ṭeek paruk a suak ih kap khatah ṭeek thum veve an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ṭeek ih kipah almon pangpar bangtuk in a mum le a parh thawn a mawitertu pangpar pathum ciar an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Meivannak fungah almon pangpar bangtuk in a mum le a parh thawn a mawitertu pangpar pali an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ṭeek khuahkhat hnuai ah pangpar mum pakhat fingfing a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pangpar mum pawl le a ṭeek pawl cu meivannak fung thawn an peh-aw ṭheh; sermi sui pakhat in tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Meivannak fung pakhat parah meivanmi pasarih a tuah ih caiceh le darkheng pawl cu sui hlir in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Meivannak fung le a thilri hmuahhmuah tuahnak ah sui pawng zakhat a hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lawithing thawn rimthaw urnak hrangah biakṭheng a don. A tung le a vang a can aw ih dong khat sau le kau a si. A saanlam cu dong hnih a sang. A parih a bunmi thingzum pawl cu biakṭheng thawn an peh-aw thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A par siseh a parih thingzum bunmi pawl le a kap pali tla siseh, sui hlir in a khuut ṭheh ih a kimvel cu sui in a khap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Suikual pahnih a tuah ih cuih biakṭheng putnak zawnfung pawl hrolhnak hrangah a tlangzim ih hnuai kap hnih ah acuih suikual pawl cu a bun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zawnfung pawl cu lawithing in a tuah ih sui in a khuut ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A thianghlimmi hriak culhnak hrangah siti le zihmui tuahtu pawl ih an tuah ṭheu vekin a hmuizetmi zihmui a tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bezalel in mei-ur thawinak hrangah biakṭheng cu lawithing in a don. A tung le a vang dong nga veve an si. A saanlam cu dong thum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A parih bunmi thingzum cu a kil kil li ah a bun ih biakṭheng thawn an peh-aw ṭheh. A zatein dar in a tuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih biakṭheng hrangih thilri pawl: khengkhuar, cawhleek, kheng, thil awh-nak le beel pawl tla cu dar in a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khohriik vekin darpheng a tuah ih biakṭheng a saanlam ih hrek a thlennak dingah acuih darpheng cu biakṭheng ih zim hnuai ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biakṭheng putnak hrangah darkual pali a tuah ih zawnfung pawl hrolhnak ah acuih darkual pawl cu darpheng ih kiil li ah a bun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zawnfung pawl cu lawithing in a tuah ih dar in a tuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule biakṭheng putnak ah a siir pahnih ih a ummi darkual ahcun zawnfung pawl cu a hrolh. Biakṭheng cu thingpheng in a tuah ih a sung a kuatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa umnak Puanthlam sung luhnak kotka-ih hna a ṭuantu nunau pawl ih neihmi dar thlalang pawl ihsin kut kholhnak darkheng le dar tawdam pawl a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puanthlam kulhnak a tuah tikah thlanglam kap kulhnak cu kaih sawmnga a saumi puan mankhung, a phiarih phiarmi in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ṭhuam kul le a tawdam kul pawl cu dar in a tuah ih ṭhuamtlang pawl le ṭhuamtlang khihnak kual pawl cu ngun in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saklam kapih kulhnak khal cu kaih sawmnga a saumi puanzar in a tuah ih puanzar thlainak ṭhuam kul le a tawdam kul cu dar in a tuah; cule ṭhuamtlang le ṭhuamtlang kaihnak kual pawl cu ngun in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitlaknak lam kulhnakah kaih kul hluannga a sau mi puanzar a hmang ih puanzar thlainak ah ṭhuam pahra le a tawdam pahra a tuah; ṭhuamtlang le ṭhuamtlang kaihnak kual pawl cu ngun in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nisuahnak lamah luhnak kotka a um ih kulhnak puanzar a hmanmi cu kaih kul hluannga thotho a sau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Luhnak kotka ihsin khatlam kapih puanzar cu kaih sarih le a hrek a kau ih ṭhuam pathum le tawdam pathum an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kotka ihsin khatlam kap khal cuvek thotho in a tuah; cuhrangah a kulhnak kotka ihsin vorhlam le kehlamah puanzar kaih sarih le a hrek veve a kau ih, ṭhuam pathum le tawdam pathum veve a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puanthlam kulhnak hrangih hmanmi puanzar hmuahhmuah cu a phiarih phiarmi puan mankhung hlir in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭhuam tawdam pawl cu dar in a tuah ih ṭhuam parih a ummi ṭhuamtlang kaihnak kual pawl le ṭhuamtlang pawl le ṭhuam lu tuamnak pawl cu ngun in a tuah. A kulhnak hrangih hmanmi ṭhuam hmuahhmuah cu ngunih tuahmi ṭhuamtlang in a kai ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kulhnak kotka-ih puanzar pawl cu coihcinmawi ih ṭelhmi a si ih mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le puan mankhung, a phiarih phiarmi in a tuah. Cuih puanzar cu a kulhnak hrangih hmanmi puanzar dang vek thotho in, kaih hra a sau ih kaih hnih le a hrek a hlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi puanzar cu darih tuahmi tawdam pali ih bunmi ṭhuam pali ah a thlaih. Ṭhuamtlang kaihnak kual, ṭhuam luzim khuhnak le ṭhuamtlang pawl cu ngun in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puanthlam hrangah siseh, a kulhnak hrangah siseh, puanzar awh-nak kual hmuahhmuah cu dar in a tuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thukham ngannak lungpheng pahnih an retnak Puanthlam sungih an hmanmi thilri pawl cu cazin an tuah ih a hnuailam bangtuk a si. Cuih cazin tuah ding cu Moses in a fial ih puithiam Aaron ih fapa Ithamar kuthnuai ih hnaṭuantu Levi mi pawl in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah miphun Hur ih tupa Bezalel, Uri ih fapa cun Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin thil hmuahhmuah cu a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezalel bawmtu, Dan miphun Ahisamak ih fapa Oholiab cu lungkher lamih zungthiam, pungsan suai thiam le mepian, sendup, a senmi tuuhmul le puan ṭha mankhung pawl tahthiamtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmun thianghlim hrangih a cemmi sui hmuahhmuah, Bawipa hnenih an pekmi sui cu biakinn cuai thlainak ih thlai tikah pawng thawnghnih za le sawmkua le pawng nga a rit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in mipum siar caanih an pekmi ngun hmuahhmuah cu biakinn cuai thlainak ih thlai tikah pawng thawngsarih zanga le sawmnga a rit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himi cu Israel pawl in mipum ih an siarmi mi pakhat in, mah-ih pek ding zat ciar an pekmi komkhawmin biakinn cuai khainakih an khaimi zat a si. Mipum siar tikah kum kul le a tlunlam cu an zatein minung thawngzaruk thawngthum zanga le sawmnga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngun an pekmi zate sung ihsin hmunthiang hrangah siseh, puanzar hrangah siseh, ṭhuam tawdam an tuahmi hmuahhmuah hrangah pawng thawngsarih le zanga an hmang. Pawng thawngsarih le zanga cu tawdam zakhat hrang a si ruangah ngun pawng sawmsarih le pawng nga cu tawdam pakhat hrangah an hmang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A taanglaimi ngun pawng sawmnga thawn ṭhuam hrangih ngunkual, ṭhuam luzim tuamnak le ṭhuamtlang pawl a tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa hnenih an pekmi dar cu a zatein pawng thawngnga zathum le pawng hra a rit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih dar cun Puanthlam sungih luhnak kotka ṭhuam pawl ih tawdam pawl, biakṭheng le khohriik vekih tuahmi darpheng le biakṭheng hrangih thilri hmuahhmuah an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Puanthlam kulhnak ṭhuam ih tawdam, kotka ṭhuam ih tawdam le Puanthlam hrangah siseh, a kulhnak hrangah siseh, puan awh-nak kual hmuahhmuah cu hi dar in an tuah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam pawl in hmun thiang sungah hnaṭuan caanih an hruh dingah tuuhmul in mepian, sendup le a senmi hnipuan sunglawi an tuah. Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin Aaron hrang khalah hnipuan thianghlim an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭaangthlaih angki thianghlim cu sui, mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung thawn an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sui cu a tlep a tlep i a phel hnuah mepian, sendup le a senmi pat lakah mawizetih ṭelhcih theih dingin paatete in an aat sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih ṭaangthlaih angki sihnak ah liangbah hri an tuah ih a sir ah an sih veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawizet ih tahmi taikhap cu acuih liangbah hri pahnih thawn an peh-aw. Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin hi taikhap khal hi sui, mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A senmi lungmankhung an taat ih a kimvel ihsin sui in an khap. Lung parih mi hmin an kher ṭheu vekin Jakob fapa hleihnih pawl ih hmin cu cuih lungmankhung parah cun an kher.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupeknak bangtuk in, Israel miphun hleihnih pawl theihsaalnak lungmankhung ih cang dingin liangbah hri pawl parah cun cuih lungmankhung pawl cu an ben.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ṭaangthlaih angki vekin mawizet ih ṭelhmi ṭaangben tla cu an tuah. Sui, mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le phiarmi puan mankhung in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tung le a vang an can-aw ih bil hnih ah an bil; zungpi bok pakua a saumi le a kaumi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih ṭaangben parah lungmankhung tlar li an ben: tlar khatnak ah a sen, a mepian le a sendupmi lungmankhung an ben.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlar hnihnak ah a taangphaw, a pawl le daimon lungvar an ben.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlar thumnak ah sendup, a sen le a engmi lungmankhung an ben.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlar linak ah tangphaw, sendup le a varmi lungmankhung an ben. Hi lungmankhung pawl cu an kimvel in sui in an vel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungmankhung hleihnih an ben ih a parah Jakob fapa hleihnih pawl hmin kher in an ngan. Hmin khermi vekin an kher ih lungmankhung pakhat parah Israel miphun pakhat hmin ciar an kher fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ṭaangben hrangah hrihrual bangtuk in a hrual-awmi sui hlir in sui ṭhi an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sui tlangkap pahnih le sui kual pahnih an tuah ih sui kual pahnih cu ṭaangben ih tlunlam kiil veve-ah an ben.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih sui kual pahnih ah sui hri pahnih an khit ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sui hri khatlam zim pahnih cu sui tlangkap pahnih ah an khih. Cuticun ṭaangthlaih angki ih hmailam liangbah parah sui tlangkap pahnih cu an thlaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dang sui kual pahnih an tuah ih ṭaangben hnuailam kiil veve ah a sunglam zim ṭaangthlaih angki sangtu-ah an sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sui kual pahnih an tuah lala ih ṭaangthlaih angki hmailam liangbah hnuailam ah an khit ih ṭhazet ih tahmi taikhap tlunlam ah an sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭaangben parih sui kual pahnih cu ṭaangthlaih angki ih sui kual pawl thawn mepian hrihrual in an ṭawnkom ih cuhrangah ṭaangben cu taikhap ih tlunah seep puakpo lo-in, Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vek cekci in ṭaangben cu a bek thlepthli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭaangthlaih angki hnuai ih hrukmi angki fualpi cu mepianmi tuuhmul hlir in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Angki fualpi-ah lu hrolhnak ong pakhat an tuah. Cuih ong kimvel cu an hruk tikah tlek lo dingin a tlang an khul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih angki hnuailam zim cu mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul le puan mankhung pawl in tale rah cuangin an ṭelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sui hlir in khingte an tuah ih tale rah karlak hnuailam zim kimvelah khingte cu an thlaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin puithiam hna an ṭuan ih an hrukmi angki fualpi ih thuailam zim kimvelah tale rah zuk ṭelhmi le khingte thlaihmi an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron le a fapa pawl hrangah puan mankhungih tahmi angki pawl an tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />cule lupawng le lukhum tla puan mankhung in an tuah ih, bawngbi tawi pawl cu phiarmi puan mankhung in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tai ṭemnak cu Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupeknak vekin phiarmi puan mankhung le mepian, sendup le a senmi tuuhmul thawn an tuah ih mawizetin an ṭelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sui hlir in calben thianghlim an tuah ih cakhennak parih cangan bangin a parah, “ Bawipa hnenih pekmi,” tiah an khen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupekmi vekin cuih calben pheng cu an lupawng parah an ṭemcih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawipa ih umnak inn Puanthlam cu an ṭheh. Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin Israel pawl in an tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa ih umnak inn Puanthlam le a thilri pawl, puan awhnak, phar le phartlang, a ṭhuam le a ṭhuam tawdam pawl;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a par khuh hrangah tuucang phaw a senih buhmi, a khuh sintu-ah saphaw ṭha le a khaptu dingih puanṭha mankhung pawl;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />lungpheng pahnih an retnak Thukam Kuang le a sin le a zawnfung pawl;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />cabuai le cabuai ih thilri le Pathian hrangih hunmi sang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />sui hlirih tuahmi meivannak fung, a meivannak, meivanmi a tlar ih ret ding pawl, a thilri dangdang le meivannak hrangih siti pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />sui ih tuahmi biakṭheng, hriak culhnak hrangih siti, zihmui rimthaw, thlam sung luhnak sangka puanzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />darih tuahmi biakṭheng, khohriik vek darpheng, a zawnfung pawl le a thilri hmuahhmuah, kut kholhnak kheng le a tawdam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />kulhnak hrangah puanzar, kulhnak ṭhuam le ṭhuam tawdam pawl, kulh luhnak puanzar, a hridai pawl le puanthlam hrangih thil bah-nak pawl, Pathian Umnak Puanthlam sungih hnaṭuan tikah a ṭulmi thilri hmuahhmuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />hmunthiang sungih hnaṭuan tikah puithiam pawl ih hrukmi hnipuan sunglawi, puithiam hna an ṭuan tikah Aaron le a fapa pawl ih hruk dingmi hnipuan thianghlim pawl cu Moses hnenah an rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moses hnenih Bawipa ih thupek vekin Israel mi pawl in hnaṭuan cu an ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />An tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu Moses in ṭhatein a zoh ih Bawipa ih thupek vekin an tuah ṭha a si, tiah a hmu. Cuhrangah cupawl cu Moses in thluasuah a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Moses hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thla hmaisa bikih ni khat ni-ah Bawipa ih Umnak Puanthlam cu nan din pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih thlam sungih Thukam Kuang sungah Thukham Pahra cu nan ret pei ih thingkuang cu puanzar phenah nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cabuai khal nan ret pei ih a thilri pawl khal a parah na ret pei. Meivannak fung ret uhla a parah mei nan vang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukam Kuang ih hmaizawn ah zihmui rimthaw urnak sui ih tuahmi biakṭheng cu nan ret pei ih luhnak sangka ah puanzar nan thlai pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Puanthlam ih hmaiah mei-ur thawinak biakṭheng cu nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A cuih biakṭheng le Puanthlam karlakah kut kholhnak kheng nan ret pei ih a sungah tidai khal nan ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kulhnak pawl cu nan bun thluh pei ih luhnak kotka ah puanzar khal nan thlai pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Cun hriak nan lak pei ih, Pathian Umnak Puanthlam le a sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah nan culh pei. Cubangtuk in Puanthlam le a thilri hmuahhmuah cu Pathian hnenah nan hlan pei ih inn thianghlim ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinak biakṭheng le a thilri pawl khal hriak nan culh pei. Cubangtuk in Pathian hnenah nan hlan pei ih a thianghlim zetmi biakṭheng a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kut kholhnak le a tawdam khal hriak nan culh pei ih cubangtuk in Pathian hnenah nan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Aaron le a fapa pawl cu Puanthlam sangka ah ra hai sehla tidai in kholh-aw hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aaron cu hnipuan thianghlim pawl hrukter uhla ka hrangih puithiam hna a ṭuan theinak dingah hriak culh in thianghlimter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A fapa pawl khal a kiangah ra hai sehla angki hrukter uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An pa hriak nan culh vek thothoin a fapa pawl khal hriak culh uh; cuticun ka hrangah puithiam hna an ṭuan ding. Hriak culhmi an si ruangah kumkhua in puithiam hna an ṭuan ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek vekin Moses in a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuhrangah Izipt ram an taan hnu kum hnihnak, thla hmaisa bikih ni khat ni-ah Bawipa ih Umnak Puanthlam cu an dingter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah Moses rori in a dingter a si. Moses in ṭhuam tawdam pawl cu a ret ih ṭhuam pawl cu a phun; phartlang pawl khal a bun ih phar pawl khal a song ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khuh pawl cu a pharh ih Bawipa ih thupek vekin Puanthlam cu a khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun thukham ngannak lungpheng pawl cu a lak ih Thukam Kuang sungah a ret. Zawnfung pawl cu thingkuang parih thlaihmi a kual sungah a hrolh ih thingkuang cu a sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian umnak Puanthlam sungah Thukham Kuang cu a ret ih lang lo dingin puanzar in a phenter. Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in thukham ngannak lungpheng pawl retnak kuang cu puanzar in hitivek in a phenter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Puanthlam sungah cun cabuai khal a ret; thlam sung saklam kap deuhah puanzar lengah a ret ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek vekin Bawipa ih hrangih hunmi sang cu cabuai parah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlam sung thotho ahcun thlanglam kap cabuai ih siir zawn ah meivannak fung a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupek vekin Bawipa ih hmai ahcun meivannak parih van dingmi mei-inn pawl a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sui ih tuahmi zihmui rimthaw urnak biakṭheng cu puanzar hmai zawn ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih biakṭheng parah Bawipa ih thupek bangtuk in zihmui rimthaw cu mei in a ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Puanthlam sung luhnak sangka ah puan a zaar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinak hrangih biakṭheng cu sangka hmaiah a ret. Cuih biakṭheng parah pekmi rawl a ret ih mei-ur thawinak khal a tuah ih Bawipa ih thupek vekin sa pawl cu cem koin a kangter thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih biakṭheng le Puanthlam karlakah kut kholhnak kheng a ret ih kholh awknak dingah tidai khal a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cuih tidai cun Moses, Aaron le Aaron ih fapa pawl in an kut le an ke an kholh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawipa ih Puanthlam sungih an luh tikah siseh, biakṭheng ih an feh tikah siseh, Bawipa ih thupek vekin an kholh-aw hmaisa ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanthlam le biakṭheng kimvelih kulhnak hruang tla cu Moses in a tuah ṭheh ih kulhnak kotka khalah puan a zaar. Cuticun Moses in hnaṭuan hmuahhmuah cu a ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Puanthlam cu mero in a tuam ih Bawipa ih sunlawinak tleu in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutiin Bawipa ih sunlawinak tleu in a khah ruangah a sungah Moses a lut thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmunkhat ihsin hmun dangih Israel mi pawl an ṭhawn tikah Pathian umnak Puanthlam ihsin mero a kian tik lawnglawngah an ṭhawn ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mero a kiang lo asile hmun dangah an ṭhawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ramṭhing lakih an vahvaih sung hmuahhmuahah Bawipa an hnenah a um ti langternak ah Puanthlam tlunah sunah mero an hmu ih zanah mei a vang ringring ti an hmu.
  </para>
</usx>
